window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5301,"title":"Chapter 5301: Scheme","paragraphs":["There were no gunshots. Hearing that, Xia Jinyuan frowned. He raised his binoculars and looked again. His vision was blocked, so he couldn’t see anything.","The situation in the village was unknown. The government forces had never sent soldiers to check on the problem, but they hoped that the peacekeeping forces would send soldiers into the village. Xia Jinyuan lowered his binoculars and said in a low voice, \"Return the way we came.\"","\"That village...\"","Before the lieutenant could finish speaking, Xia Jinyuan interrupted him with a cold facial expression. \"Even the government forces don’t care about it. Do we have the right to care?\"","That was true!","The lieutenant immediately understood what Xia Jinyuan meant. Sometimes, one needed to be vigilant when negotiating with the government forces. If the government forces didn’t do anything, the peacekeeping forces couldn’t do anything either.","Once the peacekeeping forces appeared, it would cause a fight. It wouldn’t be as simple as a fight between the militants and the government.","It was impossible for the government forces not to know the consequences of the peacekeeping forces taking the initiative to send troops in. They knew that but they still wanted the peacekeeping forces to enter the village to take a look. Xia Jinyuan didn’t believe that there was something bigger going on in the village.","\"Get in, get in. Go back the way we came. Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!\"","The lieutenant’s voice came from the intercom. Ye Jian immediately arranged for all the female soldiers to get into the truck. This time, she didn’t sit in the Jeep. Instead, she sat in the truck with the female soldiers.","In the village, a black man in a miscellaneous military uniform retracted his gaze and quickly came down from the tall tree.","\"Those idiots. They didn’t lure the peacekeeping forces into the village!\" The man ran into an old wooden house and said to the black men who were eating with their hands. \"We should have intercepted them. We can’t let them discover that this place has been occupied by us.\"","The wooden house was filled with men in military uniforms. They were all rebels. Rebels could be seen throughout the village at any time.","\"The bastards from the peacekeeping forces won’t fall for it easily. They’re very cunning. Do you expect those idiots to let them enter our territory with just one sentence? No, that’s impossible.\"","One of the rebels, who was chewing meat, casually wiped the oil off his fingers. He stood up and didn’t forget to pick up the rifle beside him. \"We need vehicles, and they have vehicles. Let’s go, guys. Kill them and snatch the vehicles we need. In the future, no matter which country it is, they can forget about going over.\"","After he finished speaking, the other three black men who were eating grinned.","\"That’s a great idea!\"","\"They have five trucks and a Jeep. We need to snatch them all.\"","\"Then what are we waiting for? Hurry up, guys!\"","\"Let’s move, guys.\"","The five of them walked out together. The rebel who reported the situation raised his gun and fired several shots into the sky. Gunshots sounded. Countless rebels rushed out from all corners of the village. At the same time, they made excited exclamations.","These people were all rebels. A few days ago, with the help of the rebellious government forces, they entered the village and occupied it.","As for the Walla residents, although they had their own armed forces, because they were not on guard against the government forces that had always been cooperating with them, all their armed forces were killed by the rebels. The elderly, children, and women in the village had no power to resist.","The gunshots frightened the women and children in the village. The women hugged their children and hid in a corner. They didn’t dare to move. Their eyes were filled with fear."]},{"number":5302,"title":"Chapter 5302: Bold","paragraphs":["They wanted to escape, but no one managed to. Some elderly and younger women who tried to escape were killed by the rebels in front of everyone in their village.","The rebels were warning them that if anyone escaped again, they would end up like the women they killed.","It had been three days. Other than the people who had fled in the first two days, no one dared to do it today. They stayed in the village to wash clothes and cook for the rebels, taking care of their daily lives.","They had hatred in their hearts. But no matter how much they hated the rebels, there was nothing they could do.","The rebels raised the guns in their hands and screamed excitedly as they rushed out of the village. Not everyone rushed out of the village. Some rebels were left to guard the village to prevent the rear from being lost. They also needed to prevent the women and children who worked for them from escaping.","With the help of the stupid and timid government forces, no one knew that the village had been occupied by the rebels. They hoped that no one would discover them.","As for the bastards from the peacekeeping forces who suddenly appeared outside, they had to be killed. As long as they escaped alive, the secrets of the village would definitely be leaked.","\"Get in, get in! Hehe, hurry up and get in!\"","Three dilapidated trucks drove out. The running rebels climbed onto the tailboard of the trucks with both hands. They were very flexible and kept pulling people onboard.","In the distance, Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice came from the intercom. \"There are gunshots in the village. The situation is bad. Accelerate!\"","\"Yes!\"","The peacekeeping soldiers driving the five trucks stepped on the accelerator. The trucks drove back on their original path.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t sit in the Jeep. He was sitting with the soldiers in the fifth truck. The Jeep led the way at the front. He had to hold the fort at the back to guard against any changes.","On the battlefield, they had to be prepared to retaliate at any time. Even if they had already retreated, they could not let down their guard.","Ye Jian, who was riding with the female soldiers, patted the back of a female soldier’s hand. \"Don’t be afraid. I’m here. I won’t let anything happen to you. Trust me.","\"Since they’re here, we’ll just shoot. Didn’t we train hard to kill our enemies for many years just so that we can go to the battlefield one day? Now, this is the battlefield. It’s time to put what you learned to use. It’s time to test if you can pass the tests!\"","Ye Jian was emboldening the female soldiers. Similarly, the male soldiers were emboldening themselves too. Xia Jinyuan was very direct. He told the male soldiers that he had seen too many situations like this after being in the military for so many years. The last time he fought with the rebels was half a month ago.","\"Half a month ago, there were reports that seven Chinese soldiers lost contact with the peacekeeping forces. I was one of them. I lost contact with them from night until dawn the next day.","\"On the battlefield, the biggest enemy is often not the enemy opposite you but yourself. When facing your enemies, you have to control your fear first and maintain your composure. That way, you can fight better and protect yourself and your comrades.\"","Although Xia Jinyuan said it so directly, he actually looked down on what he said. To describe it in later words, he was giving chicken soup to the soul.","The biggest enemy on the battlefield wasn’t the enemy on the other side but themselves? Bullsh*t. As a soldier, didn’t he know who his enemies would be after entering the military unit?","Soldiers trained hard day and night. If they lost on the battlefield, they would be cowards."]},{"number":5303,"title":"Chapter 5303: Trapped","paragraphs":["Based on Xia Jinyuan’s temper, if it were his own soldiers, he would’ve kicked them out long ago.","They had just come from the country. The peacekeeping soldiers who had not entered the company camp might exchange fire after getting off the plane. No matter how calm this group of soldiers was, they would more or less panic.","They were not used to the environment of sleeping with gunshots. They had not completely immersed themselves in this complicated and dangerous war-torn country. Although they were well-prepared, there would still be a process for them to go through.","Now was a good time to overdo it.","Hearing the gunshots and hearing the lieutenant colonel’s calm combat deployment, the panic in their hearts decreased. Their fear almost disappeared. From the moment they chose to be peacekeeping soldiers, they were already prepared to sacrifice themselves at any time. What was there to be afraid of now?!","\"There are three trucks chasing after us. They might be government rebels. They might’ve entered a combat state.\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","\"Entering combat mode!\"","\"Accelerate the vehicles and enter the combat area in front.\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","Xia Jinyuan gave orders one after another. The five trucks rushed toward the mountain at their fastest speed. There were still about two kilometers left.","The lieutenant was on the phone with the peacekeeping camp. He quickly reported the situation on their side. He highly suspected that the village belonging to the Walla people had been occupied by the rebels. Currently, the firepower of the rebels was unknown. They could start fighting with the other party at any moment.","The peacekeeping camp received the call. The colonel in charge had a cold expression on his face. There was a problem with the government. The negotiations had been taking place for a long time, but there was no result. The United Nations wanted to join a few times but was rejected by the government. Now, they didn’t even know that a village was occupied by the rebels.","Soon, the government forces found out that a village was occupied by the rebels. During the confirmation process, the government forces stationed not far away from the village insisted that the village was safe.","As for why there were rebels wearing miscellaneous military uniforms, it was because of the Walla’s own armed forces.","Why did they drive to block the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers? It was probably a misunderstanding.","They insisted that everything was normal and that the government wouldn’t send soldiers over immediately to check on the situation. Even if they really sent soldiers over, the rebels would stop them. The government wouldn’t start a gun battle easily. Everything was still under negotiation. As long as they moved, the entire Libya would enter a new round of war.","The government didn’t want any more wars.","The rebels were too familiar with the leaders of the government. They were the rebels of the government. How could they not understand?","The rebels knew what the government forces were thinking and what their motives were. They knew that the government forces were afraid and did not dare to fight them easily.","If Xia Jinyuan hadn’t informed them in advance that there was something wrong with the government forces stationed near the village, they might have been deceived by the rebels.","How could a village with its own armed forces be suddenly occupied by the rebels without any exchange of fire? No one would believe it.","The latest report came. The Chinese peacekeeping forces, who were heading to their camp, were sneak attacked by the rebels on their way to the camp. Because the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers were vigilant, they immediately sensed that something was wrong in the village in front of them. Hence, they avoided danger and quickly evacuated. The exchange of fire between the two sides was fierce, and there were no casualties among the Chinese soldiers."]},{"number":5304,"title":"Chapter 5304: Graduation","paragraphs":["The reporter immediately reported the situation of the battle and pulled the camera far away from the firefight area. He saw continuous gunfire in the photo. Bullets rained down, creating dust all around, even affecting the clarity of the photo.","The reporter from the Chinese base reported in detail. First, he showed the scene of the peacekeeping soldiers swearing an oath in the country. Then, it changed to the scene of the peacekeeping soldiers fighting with the rebels.","The situation of the battle was transmitted back to the country in real-time through satellite transmission. It allowed the citizens of the country to see their soldiers fighting bravely on the battlefield. Their soldiers were not afraid of bloodshed or sacrifices. They were fighting to protect the peace of this land.","\"Being able to fight and win is a benchmark.\" This was a requirement for every soldier in the military unit. It was also the best test of the military unit’s combat ability. Here, the citizens of China could see their soldiers using their actions to tell the people of Libya that they would use their guns and their lives to protect the peace of this land!","Although the war reporter’s report was a little emotional, every word was true.","In combat, China’s peacekeeping soldiers did use their lives to protect the peace of this land. They kept moving forward while maintaining the fearless bravery of the country’s soldiers. They used their strength to show the indomitable, brave, and tenacious combat style of China’s soldiers.","\"Yang Zhen, retreat to the left! Support from the back!\"","\"Yes!\"","Ye Jian, who was lying on the ground, shouted sternly. She ordered Yang Zhen to lead two female soldiers to retreat. Gao Xiao and the other two would take over and enter the next round of counter-attack.","The surroundings were filled with gunshots. Yang Zhen, who was covered in brown dust, retreated from the left with the female soldiers—Li Xia, Xu Sucheng, and Guan Long.","They were suppressed by the firepower at the front, so the male soldiers had to come and reinforce them.","Xia Jinyuan’s voice came from the intercom. \"Sniper, kill the enemy observer at 11 o’clock in front!\"","The sniper was Ye Jian. She turned her head and looked at the intercom on her shoulder. She replied quickly, \"Sniper received, sniper received!\"","\"I’ll give you five minutes! Take care of the observer!\"","\"Okay!\" Ye Jian placed one hand on the ground and squatted down. She said to Gao Xiao, Qiu Tong, and Li Qi, \"The three of you will cover me. I need to push forward 50 meters. Cooperate with the male soldiers and suppress the other party with firepower!\"","The Type 95 automatic rifle in her hand was equipped with a scope with three times the white light. It could shoot a distance of 400 meters. However, if one wanted to aim accurately and shoot, one had to be within 200 meters. For Ye Jian, she could shoot accurately within 300 meters.","Currently, the other party’s observer was at a distance far greater than 300 meters. She needed to close the distance to complete an accurate shooting.","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","The three female soldiers came over calmly. After firing their first bullets, the ten female soldiers entered combat mode at their fastest speed. They picked up the 95 automatic rifles in their hands and started defending themselves.","If the rebels fired their first shot and violated the United Nations treaty, the soldiers could choose to retaliate immediately.","They didn’t even have the time to wonder why Instructor Xia would order their instructor Ye to kill the other party’s observer. They didn’t have the time to wonder why Instructor Ye was so calm in the face of the rain of bullets. They only knew that they had to use the rifles in their hands to protect Instructor Ye, who had to push forward 50 meters."]},{"number":5305,"title":"Chapter 5305: Definitely","paragraphs":["Pushing forward 50 meters on the battlefield was equivalent to putting one’s life in the hands of others and sending it to the enemy’s palm.","They had to complete the cover-up. They couldn’t let Instructor Ye be in danger!","The bullets wrapped in the aura of death passed through Ye Jian’s head. Ye Jian, who was crawling forward, pushed forward quickly like a snake. She couldn’t push forward continuously. During the crawling process, she needed to constantly hide and cover herself so that she wouldn’t be exposed and become a target.","White Crane, who was aiming in front, saw his comrade crawling forward. His face, which had always been gentle, was filled with killing intent. He frantically used the gun in his hand to protect his comrades.","The male and female soldiers saw Ye Jian. The female soldiers were sweating profusely. Even though it was their first time in combat, they didn’t retreat because of fear. Instead, they became braver and fiercer. They couldn’t let the other party couldn’t gain any advantage.","50 meters, 40 meters, 30 meters... Ye Jian’s propulsion speed was sometimes fast and sometimes slow. She was getting closer and closer to her target. Ten minutes later, she finally approached the three tree stumps.","She lay down. Her chest was filled with the smell of gunpowder. She let out a long breath and slowly set up the 95 automatic rifle. She adjusted the distance and aimed at the target...","Bang!","The bullet was pushed out of the barrel and headed toward the target with a small tail of fire that was inconspicuous in the day and could not be seen with the naked eye.","The initial velocity of the bullet was 930 meters per second. It successfully hit the target at a direct distance of about 300 meters.","\"F*ck! Arnaud! God, Arnaud! F*ck! F*ck!\"","The target fell to the ground and died from a bullet in his head. A furious roar came from the other party’s camp. They saw that a bullet had accurately hit the target’s head. They didn’t catch the direction where the bullet came from.","However, as rebels who had undergone formal and systematic military training, they immediately knew that there was a sniper ambushing them when they saw him lying on the ground.","On the battlefield, one feared a sniper’s ambushes the most. Snipers were like ghosts. There was no way they could find the sniper’s exact direction immediately.","\"Get down! All of you, get down! Damn it, they have snipers! All of you, get down!\"","As they screamed, the bullets became more concentrated. A soldier let out a painful groan. His body twitched violently as he lay on the ground. He bit his lower lip to prevent himself from making a sound.","He was shot in the arm.","\"A soldier has been shot! Cover team, cover the injured soldier and leave!\"","The 50 peacekeeping soldiers were divided into teams after Xia Jinyuan’s combat deployment. The division of labor was clear. They only needed an order to move out immediately.","The soldier who was shot in the arm was immediately carried away by the soldiers from the cover team. White Crane said in a low voice, \"There are around 40 to 50 rebel soldiers. I suggest that we destroy them all.\"","\"Let’s see if they’ll retreat first. If they retreat, we won’t chase them. If not, we’ll fight to the end,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a cold gaze. He glanced at the figure that hadn’t moved. His eyes were deep and dark.","They reunited after more than nine months. On the first day, he personally pushed her to the most dangerous place.","He thought that there was no other boyfriend as ruthless as him in this world.","However, they had to shoulder their mission. Even though they knew how dangerous the path was ahead, no matter how reluctant they were, they had to fulfill their responsibilities.","Ye Jian had an intercom on her and was within the communication distance. But she turned off the intercom because she was afraid of exposing herself."]},{"number":5306,"title":"Chapter 5306: Physical Reaction","paragraphs":["After completing her target shooting, she retracted her rifle and tried her best to hide her slender body behind the three tree stumps. Only when the sound of the stray bullets weakened did she slowly start aiming at her next target.","She wasn’t wearing a blue helmet. Her surroundings were yellowish-brown, so the other party would easily spot her with her blue helmet. Ye Jian, who wasn’t even wearing her helmet, wiped the sweat on her forehead and stared ahead with a cold gaze. Her finger pulled the trigger again.","Amidst the dense gunfire, her first shot was completely covered up. The second bullet was fired, and the second target fell to the ground. This time, it wasn’t a single shot. It was a continuous shot.","Five bullets hit five targets in a row in the company.","The five targets that were knocked down made the rebels around them even more chaotic. They shouted ’sniper’ so loudly that even Xia Jinyuan and the rest could hear them.","The other party was clearly flustered, as demonstrated from the messy shooting. At the same time, Xia Jinyuan had stabilized the morale of the soldiers and ordered all the soldiers to focus on shooting.","As they shot from the left, right, and front, they swept through all the rebels in a semicircle.","Xia Jinyuan advocated annihilation!","After hitting several targets in a row, Ye Jian stabilized herself and started to retreat slowly.","The rebels wanted to find the exact direction of the sniper, but Xia Jinyuan didn’t give them a chance. He started the last round of fire from the small hill. Guns sounded, and countless rebels were killed on the spot.","The rebels began to fight and retreat, fleeing in the direction of their parked trucks.","\"Retreat, retreat!\"","\"Quick, quick, retreat! Return to the trucks. Everyone, return to the trucks!\"","The remaining rebels shouted loudly. Ye Jian, who was preparing to retreat, slowly raised her rifle...","The target was 320 meters away. The rifle in her hand had an effective shooting range of 400 meters. There was no wind, so she could give it a try.","She locked onto her target tightly despite bullets whizzing past her ear. It was as if the Grim Reaper was whispering in her ears. Ye Jian, who was in danger, remained calm. She didn’t panic or be afraid. She calmly sniped her last target.","The sound of a gunshot came again. The guy who was commanding the rebels to retreat in the chaos suddenly froze. After about five seconds, he leaned to the left and fell to the ground. He died on the spot.","\"Foley, Foley!\"","Someone shouted loudly and tried to pull up the person who was shot. The rebels who were retreating didn’t help. They had to escape immediately!","The peacekeeping soldiers didn’t chase after them. They continued to shoot from afar. They didn’t stop shooting until the three old trucks of the rebels drove away.","The female soldiers from the special forces, who were in their first combat, displayed the combat power of their first female special forces unit. They were like a newly polished sharp knife, carving out a bloody path in the fiercest manner and giving themselves a satisfactory answer.","The firefight stopped, and the surroundings were dead silent. The wind blew over, and the smell of blood was so strong that it made people want to vomit. The female soldiers who were fighting bravely a few minutes ago turned pale. Their stomachs churned, and they felt nauseous.","\"Blargh...\"","Someone suddenly vomited, causing a chain reaction. A few vomiting sounds followed.","It was a normal physiological reaction. The cruel battlefield didn’t just bring about physiological reactions. It also brought about psychological reactions. Why would some soldiers have post-war trauma? It was because... the battlefield was too bloody and cruel."]},{"number":5307,"title":"Chapter 5307: Dark Journey","paragraphs":["This time, it was alright. Only the enemies died, not their own. They didn’t see their comrades fall with their own eyes. Just their physiological reaction was enough to show that the female soldiers had strong minds.","After the battle, Ye Jian, who was wary of cold possible snipers from the other party, heard the female soldiers vomiting. Her heart ached as she looked behind her. She sighed softly.","There would always be such a process. It would pass.","Five minutes later, Ye Jian retreated back to the hill under the cover of Xia Jinyuan and White Crane. The female soldiers had stopped vomiting, but their faces were pale.","Ye Jian opened her arms and hugged the female soldiers. Her clear voice came slowly. \"You’re very brave. You’re even braver than I thought. In my heart, you’re real female special forces soldiers.\"","\"Instructor Ye...\" Gao Xiao buried her head in Ye Jian’s shoulder. Her hands were still trembling. She was even more anxious than before the combat. \"Aren’t you afraid?\"","She asked in a low voice.","Ye Jian smiled slightly. \"I started my mission when I was still in my first year. I’m not unfamiliar with combat situations such as today’s.","\"At first, I was afraid too, but later, I wasn’t afraid anymore. We’re fighting for justice, so don’t feel burdened.","\"We trained for so long for a crucial moment. Now is that crucial moment. You’re female special forces soldiers. You can’t be defeated so easily.\"","Perhaps it was because of Ye Jian’s consolation, but the female soldiers’ expressions gradually improved.","The male soldiers were in a slightly better situation than the female soldiers. Only a few of them had pale faces. The first time they killed an enemy with a gun in their hands and saw so many lives die at the hands of their guns, they all had a psychological process.","The entire combat lasted for less than an hour. The rebels acted on impulse and pointed their guns at the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers who were well prepared and on standby to fight at any time. They were doomed from the moment they drew their guns.","All the rebels had been wiped out. The news report didn’t release all the casualties. This was to protect the soldiers and not stimulate the nerves of the rebels.","After the combat ended, the event location was in a mess. No one cleaned up the scene, let alone care about the corpses lying on the ground. Five trucks carried the peacekeeping soldiers and quickly left the battlefield, heading toward the camp.","One of their soldiers was shot in the arm, and his wound was casually bandaged. They had to rush back to the camp as soon as possible to take out the bullet.","The female soldiers in the truck didn’t let down their guard just because the truck had started moving again. They didn’t dare to relax until they reached the camp.","Even though the tragic scene of the enemy’s defeat would appear in their minds from time to time and even though they felt a little flustered when they recalled the scene, they couldn’t relax.","Ye Jian shouldered the burden of the female soldiers and chatted with them along the way. She mentioned two things that she had experienced in the past.","She didn’t reveal the date and time, so the female soldiers thought that the missions she mentioned happened during the nine months she was away.","With Ye Jian’s timely guidance and the fact that Ye Jian was the instructor of the female soldiers, they trusted Ye Jian very much. Gradually, the female soldiers relaxed and slowly moved on from the battlefield.","As special forces soldiers, their tolerance was much stronger than ordinary soldiers. Their resistance to pressure was also much stronger. After all, they had to carry out high-risk missions. They only needed to clear the path effectively and they would be able to survive."]},{"number":5308,"title":"Chapter 5308: Long-Term Plan","paragraphs":["In China, Commander Xia rubbed his temples as he was a little dizzy from staying up late. He turned off the television and rested for a while before working.","The situation in Libya was more complicated than a year ago. The Chinese had sent a total of 370 peacekeeping soldiers. The mission they carried was extraordinarily heavy.","The peacekeeping soldiers were in danger, and so was the engineering team that was supporting the construction of Libya. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, who were sent out a few months in advance, had arrived with Ye Jian. Their true mission would be assigned soon.","Commander Xia, who was seated at the table, flipped through a document with the word ’top secret’ printed on it. This was the mission that Xia Jinyuan and the rest needed to complete.","A core scientist from a certain country has been under house arrest for a year because he wanted to return to his country to serve. The task of the Snow Region Special Forces is to rescue this scientist and bring him back to his country.","Five months ago, the Ministry of National Defense received an email full of strange symbols. After receiving the email, the information processor did not treat it as a prank email because the mailbox was encrypted.","After receiving this email that was formed by special symbols, the information processor immediately reported it to the National Defense Signals Management Center.","After three days of deciphering, the contents of the letter were finally deciphered.","A scientist who succeeded in a certain core technology in a certain country decided to return to China secretly to serve. He didn’t alert anyone and bought a plane ticket for his entire family on the pretext of going on a holiday. He planned to return to the country through the transit.","The scientist knew the consequences of his decision. Hence, he didn’t tell any friends about his plan. He didn’t even tell his wife or child. However, he was captured the night before he left.","All the information in his hands was confiscated, as well as his home phone and notebook. Before the notebook was taken away, he said that there was a rather important piece of information that needed to be sent to the research center. That was because the research center would need to use it tomorrow morning. He wanted to have the last chance to access a computer. The scientist would use a special method to send an email back to China. At the same time, he wouldn’t leave any traces on the computer.","The printed email was in Commander Xia’s hand. It was composed of all kinds of chemistry symbols, molecules, physics formulas, mathematical formulas, and even Roman numerals. Ordinary people would treat it like spam.","After deciphering it, it immediately attracted the attention of the higher-ups. In order to verify the authenticity of the email and the identity of the scientist, the Ministry of National Defense secretly sent people to investigate. The results were sent back to the country a week ago.","The contents of the letter were true. The scientist was under house arrest. Rescuing the scientist, his wife, and child was imminent.","After a few meetings, it was decided that Ye Jian would join the peacekeeping force and meet up with Xia Jinyuan.","However, Commander Xia didn’t expect Ye Jian and the rest to fight with the rebels before they even arrived at the company camp, causing a soldier to be shot in the arm.","At 4:00 pm, the 50 soldiers arrived at the campsite. The injured soldier immediately underwent surgery to retrieve the bullet in his arm. The female soldiers were also arranged by the soldiers in charge of logistics. Ye Jian didn’t need to do everything herself.","After White Crane parked the Jeep, he immediately informed his comrades. When they saw their captain bringing Ye Jian over, G3, T6, V8, and Z7, who were standing still, suddenly ran toward Ye Jian."]},{"number":5309,"title":"Chapter 5309: Unavoidably Excited","paragraphs":["When the four of them ran, two of them stood still.","White Crane had already seen Ye Jian. As for K7, he didn’t run... He didn’t expect these guys to suddenly run. They had agreed to stand still and admire their captain with his girlfriend!","They had agreed on this, but in the end, they all went back on their word.","White Crane didn’t run. Seeing that K7 didn’t run, he reminded him kindly, \"We haven’t seen Azure Bird for so long. Aren’t you excited? Aren’t you going to run over and hug her?\"","K7, who was silent, replied to White Crane as if he were looking at an idiot. Of course, he was excited to see Azure Bird, but did he need to run?","Run over and hug her?","Hmph.","Was their captain that generous of a man?","Would they be allowed to hug Azure Bird casually?","How naive.","K7 didn’t move. He just watched with a cold expression.","White Crane, who was choked after getting treated by an idiot, saw their captain protecting Azure Bird behind him. White Crane raised his hand and silently gave K7 a thumbs-up.","\"Your words are cold, but your mind is clear. No wonder you won the bet.\"","K7 hugged his gun and accepted his comrades’ praise.","Just because he didn’t like to talk didn’t mean that he was blind. Q King was strict with Azure Bird during training because he was afraid of losing her.","In their line of work, someone could still be talking and laughing with you one second. The next second, they might not even be left with their corpse intact.","The environment was cruel. Q King, who was afraid of losing, had to be strict with Azure Bird.","K7, who didn’t participate in the madness, didn’t stay in the same spot. He strode forward with his long legs and quickened his pace as he walked toward Ye Jian.","It had been a long time since they last met. She was still his comrade.","When White Crane saw this, he couldn’t help but shake his head and smile. K7 was an interesting comrade.","On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan saw G3 and the other three running toward Ye Jian like crazy bulls. He realized his comrades’ intention and immediately shielded Ye Jian behind him. \"Stand properly. Don’t come over.\"","He stared ahead vigilantly. As long as these guys dared to pounce on his girlfriend and hug her, he would kick them away.","Trying to hug his girlfriend? No way!","Ye Jian understood what he meant instantly. She pursed her lips and smiled. \"It’s been a long time since we’ve met. It’s normal to hug, right?\"","\"I haven’t seen the female soldiers for a long time. Don’t you think you’ll be at a disadvantage if they all came to hug me?\" Xia Jinyuan had a good reason for not giving his comrades a chance.","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows. \"That’s different. You have a superior-subordinate relationship with them. There are boundaries to your relationship. Also, they’re all afraid of you whenever they see you. They’re so frightened that they want to disappear from your eyes immediately. Let alone hugging you, even talking to you is a challenge for them.","\"I’m different from G3 and the rest. We’re comrades. It’s been so long since we last met. It’s inevitable that I’m excited. If you haven’t seen each other for a long time, wouldn’t you hug each other too?\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was blocking in front, smiled meaningfully. \"That’s right. It’s been a long time since we last met. I can’t help but be excited.\"","Hearing that, Ye Jian’s body reacted faster than her brain. She turned around and ran.","The fox was no match for the hunter. Even if she wanted to run, Xia Jinyuan didn’t give her a chance to. He had already guessed what she might do. He turned around and hugged Ye Jian with his long arms.","The six people who ran over were speechless.","Damn it!","Wasn’t it a little unkind to be so lovey-dovery in front of them?","White Crane felt at ease. He had already been hurt in the Jeep earlier. His comrades should experience the same thing. This was what it meant to share blessings and suffer together."]},{"number":5310,"title":"Chapter 5310: Whirling Around","paragraphs":["There was no one around, so Xia Jinyuan’s actions didn’t seem abrupt. He hugged Ye Jian tightly and moved his thin lips closer to her earlobe. His low voice made Ye Jian shiver. \"It looks like I restrained myself too much just now and didn’t show just how excited I am to see you again. I’ve wanted to hug you the moment I saw you. I wanted to kiss you very much. I missed you so much...","\"Those were my thoughts, but I had to restrain myself. Now, I can finally hug you properly.\" It was an open hug.","Ye Jian felt that she was about to explode. This man was acting like a hooligan again.","Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian and spun around on the spot before she could make a move. Ye Jian was so shocked that she pressed on his shoulders with both hands. She could already hear his loud laughter.","He was really happy that she was here. He was so happy that he, who had always been calm and composed, was overjoyed.","She looked around. Yes, there was no one else around besides her comrades. She didn’t see any other blue-helmeted figures either. In that case, she would just let him hug her.","He said that he wanted to kiss her and hug her... Cough, she had the same thoughts too.","So be it, then. If their comrades saw them like this, so be it. They all knew about her relationship with Captain Xia. They probably... wouldn’t say anything.","Ye Jian hugged Xia Jinyuan with both hands and let Xia Jinyuan be impudent for once.","It was really difficult. Sometimes, it seemed like he was teasing her regardless of the occasion, but he had a limit. He wouldn’t embarrass her or other people.","Ye Jian trusted Xia Jinyuan on this point.","Their comrades, who had suffered a blow to their hearts, stared at Xia Jinyuan silently. Their gazes were so cold that they could pierce a few holes in him.","He was showing off the fact that he had a girlfriend!","If it were them, they would hug her for at most three seconds before letting go. Then, they would pat Ye Jian’s shoulder and congratulate her for graduating from the military school. They would also ask her when she would return to the team.","That was all!","But this fellow really knew how to cause trouble!","He was hugging Ye Jian and spinning her in circles.","Wasn’t he dizzy?","Was it so great that he had undergone dizziness-resistant training?","They had too!","\"What do you think will happen if I imitate our captain and hug Ye Jian?\" Z7 held his chin with one hand and said thoughtfully.","T6 glanced at him and thought for a moment before replying, \"I don’t know. Why don’t you try doing it?\"","V8 looked at T6, who wanted to deceive his comrade. He cleared his throat and chimed in, \"That’s right. Why don’t you give it a try? There shouldn’t be any consequences, right? We’re already so familiar with each other, right?\"","\"That’s right. We’re already so familiar with each other. Nothing will happen,\" T6 egged him on.","Z7 smiled back. \"Why don’t you give it a try? Your wife and Azure Bird have been good friends for many years. Their relationship is very strong.\" There was no way he would go seek death himself.","\"Tsk, if you don’t dare to do it, don’t say it.\" T6 raised his hand and didn’t fall for it. He explained seriously, \"My lumbar disc has been protruding recently. I’m afraid I’ll drop Azure Bird if I hug her and spin her around.\"","\"What a coincidence. My lumbar disc is protruding too. I was in pain for the entire night last night.\" Z7 raised his hand and placed it on T6’s shoulder. There was a pained expression on his face. \"Oh my, it’s starting to hurt again. I need to apply ointment.\"","What a coward. This time, even G3 felt that Z7 was a coward."]},{"number":5311,"title":"Chapter 5311: Amazing","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan placed Ye Jian down carefully. He even reminded her carefully, \"Stabilize yourself. Don’t sprain your ankle.\"","Ye Jian, who was standing properly, glared at him. Her face was red from shyness. \"Now, you’re worried about me spraining my ankle? Why were you spinning me around so happily just now?\"","\"You can interpret it as an excited hug.\" After saying that, Xia Jinyuan turned around and stared at his comrades for a long time. His gaze was so intense that it could poke holes. \"Alright, I’ve hugged her on your behalf. Let’s find a place to sit and chat.\"","His comrades chuckled. Why did he have to find an excuse? He was just that narrow-minded.","In the end, they didn’t hug her. Instead, they patted her shoulder. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but remind them, \"Be gentle. Don’t you know how strong your bear paws are?\"","G3 couldn’t take it anymore. He suggested to Ye Jian seriously, \"Azure Bird, you have to deal with him. He’s too annoying! He nags like a woman!\"","\"Do you mean that I nag too?\" Ye Jian asked with a smile. At this moment, she was definitely on the same side as her man. They had to unite against the outside world.","G3 took a deep breath and smiled. \"No, of course not.\"","G3 patted Ye Jian’s shoulder and reminded his comrade, K7, \"Let’s not pat Azure Bird’s shoulder anymore. That narrow-minded man beside her is probably thinking about how to torture our bear paws now.\"","K7 walked to Ye Jian’s side. He was excited, but his thin and handsome face was still cold, and so was his tone of voice. He walked over calmly. \"Welcome back to the team.\"","Then, K7 did something that all his comrades wanted to do but didn’t dare to!","After he finished speaking, he stretched out his arms and hugged Ye Jian. That was right, he hugged her. His arms went around Ye Jian’s shoulders, and he hugged her tightly!","Oh my god!","What an amazing person!","He was so amazing!","What the f*ck? Did he want to die?","What a ruthless person!","G3, Z7, T6, V8, and White Crane widened their eyes so much that their eyeballs were about to fall out. Amazing! From now on, they would take K7 as their big brother!","Looking at the gloomy-faced captain, the five of them held hands and took a step back. Then, they took another step back. They took three steps back and left more space for the gloomy captain.","As for Xia Jinyuan, his expression was a little dark. The main reason was that he didn’t guard against K7!","Who would guard against K7?","He didn’t like to interfere in things, and he usually went to the top of the mountain to sit for a few hours when he had nothing to do. He would watch the clouds for a few hours and listen to nature’s music. When there were crowds, he wouldn’t join in the fun. He would be cold to everything. In private, his comrades even said that K7 was definitely a cold fellow.","This cold and indifferent fellow had done something that was definitely not something he would do normally!","Xia Jinyuan’s gloomy face wasn’t because K7 hugged Ye Jian. It was because he had been blind and didn’t see through K7’s cold appearance.","Ye Jian was stunned for a moment. However, she reacted quickly and hugged K7 too. She patted K7’s back three times, and the three-second hug ended.","After it ended, K7 frowned and looked at Ye Jian seriously. He seemed to be thinking about something important. His serious expression made Ye Jian’s heart jump."]},{"number":5312,"title":"Chapter 5312: So Scary","paragraphs":["Did... Did she hug the wrong person just now?","Was it wrong of her to hug him back and pat his back?","What should she have done?","Did she make K7 angry?","How could she have forgotten that K7 hated interacting with them in life?","It was over, it was over. She had made a mistake.","The gloomy-faced Xia Jinyuan swallowed his words and reorganized them. He asked coldly, \"I didn’t even frown. Why are you frowning? Did you suffer when she hugged you?\"","He and Azure Bird were the ones at a disadvantage, okay?!","K7 frowned for a while. He looked up at Xia Jinyuan and said calmly, \"You should be happy.\"","Even someone as smart as Lieutenant Colonel Xia couldn’t understand what K7 meant.","Should he be happy that K7 hugged his girlfriend?","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. \"K7, I almost thought that I made a mistake by hugging you back.\"","\"No.\" K7 shook his head. \"I was confirming something.\"","The comrades who were watching the show saw that the atmosphere was harmonious and it didn’t look like they could fight, so they surrounded him.","\"Confirm what? You hugged Azure Bird to confirm something? K7, how bold. I respect you as a man!\" Z7 gave him a thumbs-up. Just now, he was so cowardly that he pretended to have a lumbar disc protrusion. K7 was a man of few words, but he hugged her the moment he went over. What a man!","His comrades were very curious. They were all anxious to get something out of Z7.","K7, who was surrounded, was very cold. \"I don’t like Azure Bird.\"","This was a huge bomb. Before it exploded, his comrades were already dizzy. He wasn’t a real man. He was a f*cking fool who didn’t care about his life!","Ye Jian choked and coughed continuously.","’K7, you win!’","Xia Jinyuan was expressionless. \"You don’t like Azure Bird, so I should be happy. This is what you meant, right?\"","\"Yes.\" The fool nodded. He wasn’t afraid, but his comrades beside him were!","Damn it!","The sky was about to collapse!","What were they waiting for? Run!","Before he escaped, G3 didn’t forget to pull Ye Jian along. He also reminded Q King, who was covered in dark clouds and lightning, in a trembling voice, \"We’re all brothers. Please show mercy. Don’t be rash and make mistakes. Don’t forget that you still have Azure Bird.\"","After reminding him with a trembling voice, he pulled Ye Jian and retreated immediately.","Danger ahead. Retreat, retreat immediately!","Ye Jian couldn’t stay even if she wanted to. G3 was pulling her on her left and T6 was on her right. Her feet left the ground as she was carried away by her comrades who ’cherished their lives’.","\"Come, come, come. Let’s go to the camp. You have to familiarize yourself with the surrounding environment.\"","\"Let’s go to the refugee camp too. There’s a group of very cute children. If I had known you were coming, I would’ve troubled you to bring us a few footballs.\"","\"The situation now is quite complicated. Sometimes, we don’t dare to believe the government forces. We’re afraid that one of them will betray us.\"","\"The refugee camp is already full, but many more refugees want to come in. Alas, there’s no choice. It’s already saturated. We can only reject them every time.\"","In order not to worry Ye Jian, the five comrades tried their best to divert Ye Jian’s attention. Ye Jian, who was actually very calm, looked at them and didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"I’m not worried. The reason why I want to stay is to ask K7 why he said that he doesn’t like me.","\"Don’t you think that his statement is very interesting? He was confirming if he liked me. In that case, can we assume that a woman confessed to K7 and mistakenly thought that he liked me?","\"Or maybe you can say that K7 was using his actions to prove to that woman that he doesn’t like me. He likes her.\""]},{"number":5313,"title":"Chapter 5313: Problem","paragraphs":["The silence was terrifying. The ferocious special forces soldiers on the battlefield were dumbfounded again.","T-That was right!","Why didn’t they think of this?","Damn it!","Did they miss another big show?","\"Shall we go back?\"","\"Go back?\"","\"Are we really going back?\"","\"We’re really going back!\"","The last sentence was said by Ye Jian. She decided to go back and take a look!","The group hurriedly went back.","K7, who was having a heart-to-heart conversation with Xia Jinyuan, was standing with his back against a tree. He was probably looking at the wind. He kept looking into the distance while hugging his rifle. There was a hint of confusion on his cold face.","\"When I was hugging Azure Bird, I didn’t feel anything,\" K7 said. The confusion in his eyes deepened. \"She says that I like Azure Bird.\"","Xia Jinyuan rubbed his eyebrows. Damn it, relationship counseling wasn’t his specialty. It was rare for K7 to say what was in his heart. How should he comfort him?","G3 and the rest ran faster than rabbits. He didn’t even have anyone to discuss it with.","Why not pry out who that woman was from K7’s mouth first?","\"Who’s the woman?\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had accidentally learned a huge secret and was still a little frightened, pretended to be serious and asked, \"You have to understand what she’s thinking before you can solve the problem.\"","\"You know her—Zhou Yijin. She said that she has a cousin called Xia Jinyuan...\"","Xia Jinyuan was speechless. What the f*ck could he say?!","He thought that he knew K7’s secrets, but he didn’t expect to hear Zhou Yijin’s name!","Half a year ago, he contacted his aunt. His aunt said that Yijin was a clerk, but she was busier than when she was a military arts soldier. She was so busy that she didn’t even have time to find a boyfriend.","Did she not have time to find a boyfriend?","She clearly had a boyfriend behind her family’s back!","He couldn’t take it anymore. He had to catch his breath. The day had been too eventful. His heart couldn’t take it.","Xia Jinyuan, who had changed from standing to sitting, took a deep breath for himself so that he could accept this news.","\"You should be her cousin. That’s why I’m telling you.\" K7 sat down too. Xia Jinyuan’s expression didn’t make him stop talking. \"She pursued me first.\"","Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes. \"Are you looking for praise? If not, then shut up.\"","She pursued him first, and that was enough to win him over?","The ladies in the Xia family had always been scarce. All of them were pampered and doted on by their families. Back then, Xia Yiwei hid the news from her family and didn’t dare to let them know that she was bullied by that bastard Hou Zi. Later on, before she got married, Xia Jinyuan’s uncles, fathers, and aunts appeared. They were all wearing military uniforms and threw their guns on the table. Hou Zi chose one and shot himself in the leg.","Later, Hou Zi told them about it. At that time, as a boss in the underworld, he almost peed his pants because of the chiefs.","Now, a similar thing was happening again.","Zhou Yijin pursued K7 first and was even left hanging.","If he didn’t know K7 and knew that he didn’t have so many thoughts, he would have beaten K7 up today.","\"So, what do you intend to do now? You don’t like her, right? If you don’t like her, reject her directly. Many will woo and dote on the ladies of the Xia family.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s expression was really ugly now.","K7 frowned again and retracted his gaze that had been looking into the distance. He looked at Xia Jinyuan without blinking and said seriously, \"I hugged her before, and I was very excited. You were very excited when you hugged Azure Bird just now.\""]},{"number":5314,"title":"Chapter 5314: I Like Her","paragraphs":["The comrades who ran back didn’t hear the full conversation and only heard that part.","\"He hugged her before, and he was very excited!\" V8 looked at Ye Jian excitedly. \"Azure Bird, you’re amazing! You really guessed it!\"","Ye Jian waved her hand, staying humble. \"No, it’s mainly because K7 was acting very abnormally. So I knew there had to be something wrong.\"","\"You could guess that there was someone in K7’s heart just by hugging him. It’s really...\" G3 fell silent as he spoke. He turned to his comrade beside him. \"I now understand why K7 could guess that Q King was acting weird because of Azure Bird’s arrival. He probably misses that woman too!\"","T6 glared. \"No wonder I lost!\"","\"Come on, with your IQ, you’d lose either way.\" V8 rolled his eyes. \"You said you’re married, but you don’t know anything.\"","Z7 also felt that he had lost unjustly. He lost to K7 just like that. How stupid!","\"Lower your voice. Let’s find out who K7 likes.\" Ye Jian made a shushing gesture, indicating for her comrades to lower their voices.","That made sense. They couldn’t miss the most important piece of information!","It was quite difficult to pry some personal matters out of K7. They could only rely on their captain. They hoped that they could get something out of him.","Xia Jinyuan asked with a straight face, \"So?\"","\"I like her. I’ll pursue her.\"","K7 replied calmly.","\"Will Yijin agree just because you pursue her? How naive.\" Xia Jinyuan sneered. \"You’re in Libya. How are you going to pursue her? Spiritually?\"","\"I’ll pursue her until she agrees. You won’t be able to stop me.\" An extremely vicious light shot out of his cold eyes. K7, who had no desires in his heart, showed his persistence for the first time.","Ye Jian and Z7 were talking, and Z7 asked, \"Is this the Yijin I’m thinking of?\"","\"If it wasn’t Yijin, Captain Xia wouldn’t have had such a huge reaction.\" Ye Jian analyzed calmly. \"The reason why he’s so protective must be because of the Yijin we know.\"","\"We’re all comrades. Can’t you share the information with us? Who’s Yijin?\" White Crane asked.","\"Our captain’s cousin is Zhou Yijin. Her mother is Commissioner Xia from the Political Bureau. Her father is the principal of the Engineering College, which is the military school where White Crane studied. Her family background is prominent, right?\"","Z7 shared what he knew generously. \"Her cousin is our captain, and her cousin-in-law is Azure Bird. K7 is wooing Yijin now. Is there a chance?\"","Her family background made things exciting.","Most importantly, the woman K7 liked was Captain Xia’s cousin. No wonder she was so bold. As it turned out, she had a backer!","G3 said, \"In terms of family background, K7’s family background is not bad. His entire family is filled with authoritative doctors. The famous founder of the hospital in Nanguang is K7’s grandpa. In terms of family background, he’s compatible.\"","\"His family background isn’t a big problem. However, the problem is Captain Xia. Would he be willing to let his cousin get together with K7? It’s hard to say.\"","Everyone was silent. That’s right. Family background wasn’t a big problem. Family was the big problem.","Ye Jian lowered her head slightly and thought for a while. She shook her head and said firmly, \"No, there won’t be a problem with Captain Xia because he understands all of us.\"","\"There shouldn’t be a huge problem with her family, right?\" Xia Jinyuan’s aunt and uncle were both soldiers and had open minds. They wouldn’t force Yijin to break up because of K7’s profession, right?","Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t stop them because of K7’s profession since he was the same. What right did he have to stop his comrades?","Hence, Xia Jinyuan said, \"I’ll watch over your progress with Yijin. I won’t interfere.\""]},{"number":5315,"title":"Chapter 5315: New Love","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan made it very clear. He wouldn’t help K7 chase after Yijin just because he was a comrade. At the same time, he wouldn’t stop K7 from chasing after Yijin just because he was her cousin.","The two of them would settle their own matters. No one could make a decision for the two of them.","Whether the outcome was good or bad was up to them.","K7 didn’t answer immediately. He was silent for a while before saying calmly, \"If I were afraid of you, I wouldn’t have mentioned it.\"","Only K7 had the ability to anger people to death.","Ye Jian saw that her man was gritting his teeth and hurriedly walked out from behind them. Z7 overtook her and beat Ye Jian to it. As he walked, he smiled and said, \"Fortunately, I was smart enough to turn back. If not, I would’ve missed the biggest secret of the year.\"","\"You’re smart? Heh.\" T6 exposed him mercilessly. \"Azure Bird was the one who said that she would come back and take a look. How dare you say that you’re smart?\"","Ye Jian, who was already used to the way the comrades of the Xueyu unit interacted with each other, appeared behind the two of them with a smile.","Xia Jinyuan raised his head and looked at his girlfriend who was walking over. He couldn’t help but laugh. \"You look quite happy. What’s the matter? Are you optimistic about the two?\"","The six of them were sitting under the tree and discussing loudly. Did they think that K7 was deaf?","Ye Jian took a few steps forward and sat on the ground with him. She smiled and said slowly, \"It’s not that. I just feel that since both of them have a good impression of each other, K7 can give it a try. Back then, I hid as far away as I could when you wooed me.\"","She seemed to be speaking casually, but the serious atmosphere instantly improved.","When G3 and the rest came out, they joined the discussion and applauded K7.","Ye Jian took the opportunity to pull her boyfriend to the side and talked about how she saved Yijin a few years ago. \"At that time, I felt that Yijin treated K7 differently. Now that I think about it, she must’ve started to have feelings for him then. But she was afraid that K7 would see through her, so she deliberately targeted K7.\"","That past had always been the pain in Ye Jian’s heart that she didn’t want to touch the most. Every time she thought about it, she would have nightmares. She would always dream of personally stabbing a sharp dagger into her lover’s chest, dyeing her hands and the ground red.","Now that she mentioned it again, her heart palpitated in fear. Unknowingly, her palms were already covered in cold sweat.","She suddenly felt warmth. A warm and broad hand held hers. She heard the man beside her say gently, \"I’m sorry to have made you worry.\"","\"Yes, I was really worried. But we’re both in the same boat. There’s no need to mention it between us in the future.\" Ye Jian raised her head and looked at the handsome man. \"Let’s talk about Yijin. The past is in the past. I’ve already moved on from it.\"","After experiencing so many storms, she knew that the past was in the past. She knew that she should let go of it and not restrain herself.","Her eyes were calm, and there was no gloominess in them. Xia Jinyuan’s heart melted as he looked at her. His voice softened unknowingly. \"I won’t stop them. Although Yijin’s surname is Zhou, her personality is like that of our Xia family. She won’t regret it even if she gets hurt.","\"Yiwei and Hou Zi have suffered enough. She even saw Hou Zi hugging another woman with her own eyes, but Yiwei could bear it. She put up with it until the last bit of love in her heart was erased. Even if they had separated again, she wouldn’t regret anything.\"","Ye Jian’s heart trembled when she heard that. This kind of ruthlessness was simply self-torture."]},{"number":5316,"title":"Chapter 5316: Absolute","paragraphs":["However, this also meant that the daughter of the Xia family was determined. She was ruthless to herself. If she wanted to cut ties with her, she would cut ties completely and not leave behind anything. The good and bad would end with the end of their relationship. For the rest of her life, that person would never appear in her dreams again. She would never cry for that person again.","Sometimes, if you were ruthless to yourself, you could live a better life in the future.","\"Since Yijin has been interested in K7 for a long time, I won’t stop her. Firstly, it’ll hurt the relationship between comrades. What does it have to do with me as her cousin? Secondly, it’ll make Yijin even more rebellious if I stop her. The more I restrict her, the more she’ll want to do it.","\"I might as well let go and let her do as she pleases. She can only cherish her blessings after tasting the pain herself.\"","Everything he said made sense. Ye Jian nodded slightly. \"Alright, then we won’t bother ourselves with it. Let nature take its course.\" Then, she smiled and said, \"K7 will definitely treat Yijin well in the future.\"","\"If he wasn’t a good person, I wouldn’t have let him off.\" Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. In his heart, he felt that the two of them were quite compatible.","Yijin was a lively person, like a ball of fire. She was a natural optimist. She often made people laugh with her eloquent words, and everyone in the family loved and pampered her.","K7 was a cold lump. He didn’t take the initiative to talk to others, so he needed someone with a fiery spirit by his side.","Just now, when K7 mentioned Yijin, the brightness in K7’s cold eyes frightened Xia Jinyuan. At that time, there was only one thought in his mind, \"Damn it, I can finally see life in K7.\"","He really thought so.","On one side was his cousin whom he doted on, and on the other side was his most trusted comrade. He knew both of their personalities very well. If they could really get married, he would sincerely wish for the two of them to live together forever.","The fact that K7 liked a woman dealt a blow to the other three bachelors. V8, White Crane, and Z7 were surging with bitterness. They thought that they had to take leave after returning to the country!","They wanted to take leave to look for their girlfriends. They didn’t want to be outdone by their comrades!","Before they could think of a plan and before Ye Jian could bring the female soldiers out to patrol, on the fourth night of Libya, a total of eight special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were sent to a construction site in Libya to be in charge of safety.","When the female soldiers knew that their instructor was leaving, they couldn’t bear to let her leave for a long time. They held Ye Jian’s hand and asked pitifully when she would be back.","Ye Jian, who received the mission, smiled and patted Gao Xiao’s head. \"I’m not in the same team as you. It’s normal for me to go to another camp now. I don’t know when I’ll come back. I’ll come back after the construction there ends. But I might go to the next construction site.\"","The female soldiers became dispirited. Their eyes turned red again as they held Ye Jian’s hand.","The special forces soldiers sitting in the white armored bulletproof car couldn’t help but laugh when they saw this. This group of female soldiers was quite attached to Azure Bird. It could be seen that they had deep feelings for Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t say too much to the female soldiers. She had said everything she needed to say. She would always rely on herself and not others.","The female soldiers were very powerful. They were able to carry the responsibility that belonged to them. They were all responsible and brave Chinese soldiers.","It wasn’t until the armored bulletproof car drove far away from the camp that the female soldiers reluctantly retracted their gaze. Their hearts felt empty as the car drove away."]},{"number":5317,"title":"Chapter 5317: Final Goal","paragraphs":["The female soldiers didn’t have much time to adjust their emotions. Soon, the ten female soldiers entered the peacekeeping project. When they heard the sharp whistle from the refugee camp, the female soldiers carrying rifles on their backs quickly headed in the direction of the whistle.","Something had happened at the refugee camp again!","They no longer thought about their sadness from separating with Ye Jian. As the whistle got sharper and sharper, the sound of fighting got louder and louder. The female soldiers faced the emergency they needed to deal with with full attention.","In the armored vehicle, Xia Jinyuan glanced at his comrades one by one. There was a rare coldness in his voice. \"This time, we entered this country as mercenaries to rescue the wife and child of a scientist who had been placed under house arrest.","\"We’re responsible for rescuing the scientist’s wife and child, while X and his 12 people are responsible for rescuing the scientist. The two parties will work together to send the scientist and his family back to China.","\"According to reliable sources, the scientist’s wife and son have been secretly sent to Molaban by other countries. Our identities have been erased, and we’ll become illegal mercenaries who entered Molaban until we successfully rescue the scientist’s wife, Alice Cheng, and their son.","\"Brothers, this time, it’s even more dangerous than the previous mission. We’re illegal mercenaries. The local police and soldiers can punish us on the spot, and our country... won’t step in.","\"After entering Molaban, you and I are no longer Chinese soldiers. Our past glory will be erased. Our identities are just illegal mercenaries. We’re the kind of people who will die without anyone to collect our corpses.\"","The news was so explosive, but the special forces soldiers were not afraid. Instead, they felt at ease.","G3 let out a long sigh. \"Now, we finally know why we were sent here for peacekeeping. The real work begins.\"","\"This is the second time we’ve been to that place. Q King, you’ve lived in Molaban for a long time. You’re familiar with that place. We’ll follow you.\"","Besides Ye Jian, White Crane, who was driving, heaved a sigh of relief.","\"From July until now, I had always thought that we were just doing peacekeeping. Alas, now that I think about it, I was too naive. Our leaders are so powerful. They started making arrangements five months in advance and knew how to bide their time.\"","China was indeed a country that knew how to hide their strength and bide their time. If not, how could they rise into a great country?","The special forces soldiers who now knew their real mission finally felt at ease. Ye Jian, who had only been in Libya for less than three days, looked at her comrades’ relaxed expressions and exhaled softly.","Her comrades had really strong psychological qualities. She had to learn from them.","Xia Jinyuan probably noticed Ye Jian’s exhalation. He turned and looked at Ye Jian. \"This is your first time carrying out such a mission. You don’t have to feel too burdened.","\"Although our identities have changed, they’ll be immediately restored when we come back. We won’t be affected.\"","The prerequisite was that they had to come back alive.","Ye Jian knew that. She smiled brightly at him. She knew. Hence, he didn’t have to worry about her.","She would definitely come back alive. She wouldn’t throw her life away in a foreign country.","Molaban was a country where criminals dared to use guns to wipe out the police. Back then, the destruction of Cobra—who used his identity as a drug dealer, painter, and successful businessman as a cover and worked as a spy for a certain country—didn’t cause much of a stir in Molaban."]},{"number":5318,"title":"Chapter 5318: Doubts","paragraphs":["There were too many people like Cobra. There were many criminals who were even more powerful than Cobra. The government wouldn’t care about Cobra. To them, they would be safer if all these people were killed.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to step into the Molaban again.","However, he had nothing to worry about. Everyone who saw him in the past had been killed. No one would recognize him if he appeared again.","He wasn’t worried about what danger he would encounter if he stepped on Molaban again. At this moment, he was frowning as he wondered why the country that placed the scientist under house arrest would secretly send his wife and children to Molaban.","Why did they make such an arrangement?","Wouldn’t it be better to place them under house arrest in their country?","They could let their own people watch over them and not let outsiders come into contact with them. At the same time, they could also monitor the friends of the scientists. It was beneficial to have them stay in their country.","Why did they have to be sent to Molaban?","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know what the purpose of this arrangement was. Perhaps Alice Cheng, the Chinese wife of the scientist, would have the answer.","They arrived at Molaban three days later. The next day, the embassy secretly sent eight cell phones to the eight of them. The numbers they used were all three to four years old. They had been maintaining a record of phone calls every month. That meant that if someone came to check their communication, they wouldn’t be able to find anything.","The first thing the eight people remembered was each other’s mobile phone numbers.","They chose some important numbers to memorize. There was no need to memorize the rest.","In order to protect the eight special forces soldiers who were now illegal mercenaries, the country had helped them with all the details they could so that there wouldn’t be any hidden dangers in the future.","Ye Jian was best at memorizing numbers.","The people sent by the embassy stayed in Xia Jinyuan’s room for about half an hour before leaving. An hour later, Xia Jinyuan called the other six people to his room for another meeting.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan ate, lived, and slept on the same bed as each other as lovers.","\"Someone will pick us up in the afternoon and bring us to see an auction of all the Chinese cultural relics. Our mission is to snatch two of the cultural relics with a higher commission. The person we’re facing is one of the top local tyrants in the city. No one has ever succeeded or left alive.","\"The employer is very generous. If a mercenary dies, he’ll compensate us with 200,000 USD. If we successfully snatch the cultural relics he needs, everyone will be paid 100,000 USD. We’ll also be rewarded with 50,000 USD which we can split among ourselves.","\"Brothers, aren’t you excited to accept such a big order on your first visit?\"","After receiving the mission, Xia Jinyuan was quite relaxed. There was no sign of uneasiness or fear. He was the captain and the backbone of the entire team. If he panicked and was afraid, he would be utterly useless.","Ye Jian waited for him to finish speaking before raising her question.","First, why did they have to go to the territory of the local tyrant to snatch cultural relics? What was the reason?","Second, what was the identity of the person coming to pick them up? Did he know about their mission? Did he know why they came? Why was he helping them?","These questions were of utmost importance."]},{"number":5319,"title":"Chapter 5319: Restless","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan smiled and took a sip of the cold water to moisten his throat. \"It’s said that the scientist’s wife and child might be in the hands of the local tyrant. The person who’s picking us up is the person who’s helping us enter the local tyrant’s auction. He knows that we’re illegal mercenaries who entered the country illegally to save people for money. As for why he’s helping us, it’s because he knows the scientist’s friends and the scientist’s wife.","That meant that he knew why they were here, but he didn’t know their true identities.","More importantly, the scientist’s wife and child came to Molaban because he rescued them from another country first. In the end, before he could send the mother and son out of Molaban, they were kidnapped again.","He was the one who snatched the cultural relics. He was also the one who needed illegal mercenaries to save the mother and son.","The Chinese just went along with the situation to send Xia Jinyuan and the other eight special forces soldiers to his side.","After clearing a few questions, Ye Jian lay back on the bed and slept. She rested well and waited for the afternoon to be picked up.","After taking a shower, Xia Jinyuan saw that she had fallen asleep the moment she touched the bed. Her sleeping appearance was sweet and unguarded. He wiped his hair dry and knelt on one knee by the bed. He leaned down and kissed her lips dotingly.","\"Do you trust me so much?\" After kissing her, Xia Jinyuan sat by the bed again. He reached out his hand and gently brushed away the black hair that covered her forehead. \"A man is a demon when he’s impulsive. He can do you in minutes.\"","As he spoke, he didn’t forget to tap the tip of Ye Jian’s nose.","Ye Jian, who was sleeping soundly, felt a little uncomfortable and turned over lightly.","The familiar aura made her face Xia Jinyuan and move toward him unconsciously. She had always been strong, so when she revealed her reliance on Xia Jinyuan in her sleep, the smile in his eyes immediately deepened.","\"I really don’t know what to do with you. You make me want to sleep as well just from looking at you.\"","After he finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan threw away the towel around his waist. He wore a pair of underwear and lay on the bed almost naked.","Not only did he lie down, but he also hugged Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was sleeping soundly, felt that she was lying in a furnace. At first, she felt comfortable, but as the temperature of the furnace got higher and higher, Ye Jian, who began sweating, felt uncomfortable.","When she opened her eyes, she heard the sound of even breathing. His moist breath blew on her face. Ye Jian didn’t need to look up to know who it was.","She lowered her pupils slightly and saw a long arm pressing on her chest and a bare leg pressing on her legs.","Her entire body was pressed down by him, and she was surrounded by his breath. It was a refreshing smell.","The moment she moved her hand, her elbow touched an expanse of warm skin. Ye Jian was so shocked that her scalp turned numb.","He, he, he... He wouldn’t be sleeping naked, would he?!","Ye Jian’s scalp turned numb. She didn’t dare to stay in his arms anymore. She carefully raised the long arm below her chest with her free hand and placed it aside in fear. Then, she slowly moved his leg. As long as she moved his leg away, she would be able to escape from his warm embrace.","She had a good plan, but the person sleeping beside her was a hunter who was very vigilant even when he was taking a nap. The hunter had already woken up when she carefully raised his arm.","He closed his eyes the entire time and held back his laughter.","Seeing that she had escaped from his arms, Xia Jinyuan turned around and pressed Ye Jian on top of him. His strong and sexy upper body was revealed in front of Ye Jian."]},{"number":5320,"title":"Chapter 5320: Meeting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s face turned red when she met his teasing black eyes. \"You... You were pretending to be asleep!\"","\"I was sleeping. You were the one who kept twisting in my arms. You woke me up and started playing the blame game. You’re dishonest. You deserve to be punished.\"","Before Ye Jian could do anything, Xia Jinyuan, who said that he wanted to punish her, used his actions to ’punish’ her.","This punishment was a little exciting. Ye Jian’s face was as red as a tomato, and her hands were sore. They smelled of a musky scent. Beside the bed was a pile of used paper.","She jumped up from the bed like a monkey and rushed to the bathroom. Xia Jinyuan, who was lying on the bed with a satisfied expression, smiled as he looked at the fleeing figure. He said roguishly, \"You’ve seen and touched all of me. When are you going to give me a proper title?\"","Ye Jian was rendered speechless. She couldn’t answer. She didn’t know what he would say if she replied.","At 5:00 pm, Ye Jian came out of the bathroom after calming down for 15 minutes. The man who was lying on the bed was already in his shirt and pants. He was standing by the window and talking in English. The setting sun was just right outside. The faint golden sunlight shone through the glass and enveloped his body, outlining his handsome face. He was so handsome that she stared at him for a few seconds.","After a few years, Captain Xia’s charm had increased. Even his appearance seemed more handsome than before.","Xia Jinyuan, who was communicating in English, had a casual and roguish aura. Occasionally, he would laugh coldly, but it was also sinister to the core. At this moment, he only had a little of the aura of a soldier. More than anything else, he looked ruthless enough to do anything for money.","In 15 minutes, her Captain Xia seemed to have become a different person.","After hanging up, Xia Jinyuan opened the closet door and handed Ye Jian a set of black sportswear. \"We’ll be picked up in 15 minutes. Get ready.\"","He no longer had the decadent aura from before. His facial expression was as cold as frost, and he looked like a different person from when he was on the bed.","At 5:20 pm, Xia Jinyuan put his arm around Ye Jian’s shoulder. Behind him were six men. They walked out of the hotel ostentatiously.","A young man was standing beside a nine-seater MPV. When he saw them, he immediately went up to them and bowed slightly. He said respectfully, \"Hello, sir. Our master is waiting for you to get in the car.\"","It was very respectful and polite. It made people feel comfortable.","Xia Jinyuan raised his chin and gestured for the young man to lead the way. He displayed his true nature as an outlaw.","The current Xia Jinyuan was an illegal mercenary. One look and you could tell that he lived his life by licking knives.","He acted so well that even Ye Jian was drawn into the role.","In the car sat a mixed-race man around 40 years old. His facial features were deep. He had a Western face, but he had a pair of black Asian eyes. He was very charming and decadent.","The first thing he said when he got into the car was not small talk. He expressed what his goal was and hoped that the mercenaries he hired at a high price would achieve his goal.","The entire conversation was in English. They also talked about money. The two of them had a pleasant conversation.","One was generous with money, while the other was generous with his life. They both liked each other’s motives.","The employer didn’t even look at Ye Jian until Xia Jinyuan said that his girlfriend would be there tonight. The employer frowned and didn’t agree. \"A woman will drag you down.\"","\"No, sir, you’re wrong. My woman is not an ordinary woman. She won’t drag us down. On the contrary, she’s much more charming when she kills.\""]},{"number":5321,"title":"Chapter 5321: First Meeting","paragraphs":["As soon as Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, a cold dagger was pressed against the employer’s neck.","\"I hate being despised.\" Ye Jian held the dagger in her hand and pressed it against the employer. She said calmly, \"Even if it’s my employer, I won’t allow it.\"","Fast and dashing, coupled with her cold voice, the frozen employer smiled. \"Your girlfriend is amazing.\"","\"Yes, my little fox is very powerful. I love her very much. I love her even more when she kills people. She’s really beautiful,\" Xia Jinyuan said with a smile. He raised his hand and slowly touched Ye Jian’s face. His voice was low and gentle as he said, \"Alright, my little fox. Don’t scare our Mr. Will. Next, we still have important things to complete.","\"Don’t forget that Mr. Will is our employer. You can’t do this.\"","His fingers suddenly grabbed Ye Jian’s chin. He pinched her especially hard. The viciousness on his handsome face made Mr. Will very satisfied.","This mercenary he invited back was someone who knew how to kill people, not someone who only knew how to drink.","The car drove on the spacious streets of Molaban. They went from the city to the suburbs and finally entered a village with red, yellow, and blue walls.","The venue for the cultural relic auction was here.","Will entered the auction venue very smoothly. He brought Xia Jinyuan and the others into the venue. The auction would start at 7:00 pm. A total of ten batches of Chinese cultural relics were open for bidding.","Westerners liked to collect Chinese cultural relics. No matter what kind of cultural relic it was, it was worth a lot if it came from China.","Here, Ye Jian saw the Buddha’s head that had been cut off and had crossed the sea. She saw the jade bowl that came from the palace, bronzeware, the paintings that were still around even after a thousand years, the unique copies of ancient calligraphy masters that didn’t exist in China, and the exquisite and luxurious hairpins...","The ten cultural relics were all from China.","\"I need the Buddha’s hand and the portrait.\" Will told Xia Jinyuan what cultural relics he wanted. \"I’ll give you five days. I hope you can hand them to me as soon as possible.\"","\"Also, the people I need you to save should be rescued as soon as possible. The cultural relics can be done later. I need you to rescue my trapped friend as soon as possible.\"","Xia Jinyuan said that it wouldn’t be a problem.","The auctioneer was a bald old man who was at least 55 years old. He was Caucasian and had sinister facial features. Every time a cultural relic was brought out, his eyes would sweep across the bidders below.","A businessman who had just bid for a cultural relic suddenly shouted and questioned, \"Why is the jade bowl different from what I saw just now? Damn it, you bastards, you must be hiding the real jade bowl and swapped it for a fake jade bowl for me!\"","Before he could kick up a fuss, the bald old man raised his hand. A few burly white men in tight T-shirts walked over and knocked the businessman unconscious without a word. They dragged him away like a dead pig.","The bald old man smiled and explained, \"I’m very sorry! I hope I didn’t scare everyone. For your safety, I need to take effective measures.\"","It seemed that everyone knew who the bald old man was. Someone put his finger to his mouth and whistled sharply. Someone even stood up and shouted, \"You should’ve killed the troublemaker!\"","\"Hahaha, that’s right. He should be killed. Doesn’t Cyril like to kill people the most?\" Before the laughter of the person who said this could end, a few burly men appeared from an unknown corner and dragged him away.","The entire process was done extremely neatly and shocked the entire place."]},{"number":5322,"title":"Chapter 5322: Introduction","paragraphs":["After the ten cultural relics were auctioned, Will brought Xia Jinyuan and the rest out. As soon as they got into the car, Will suddenly asked, \"What do you think of the bald old man who hosted the auction just now?\"","Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"He’s a ruthless person and very cunning!\"","\"The bald old man isn’t simple. He’s Cyril’s adviser. Many of the operations carried out by Cyril were planned by him. His nickname is...\" As he spoke, Will glanced at Ye Jian and sneered. \"His nickname is also Fox. This sly old fox is a cunning and ruthless character. Now that the two foxes have met, let’s see who’s stronger, the bald sly old fox or our beautiful fox.\"","He knew that Ye Jian was called ’little fox’.","\"Just you wait and see! Just watch! Where are we going now?\" Ye Jian, who had disguised herself, said disdainfully.","It gave Will the illusion that Ye Jian would get stronger when she met someone stronger. She had the urge to conquer challenging characters.","\"Okay, I believe you have already figured it out. I just showed you how powerful the bald guy is. Now, I’m going to take you to have a good meal. I know a very good Western restaurant.\" Will, who was very satisfied with this group of mercenaries, said excitedly, \"After eating, you should have more energy to work. I can’t wait to see you work for me.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was hugging Ye Jian’s shoulder, kissed Ye Jian’s face and laughed. \"Don’t worry, Mr. Will. You made the right choice.\"","The car drove out of the village road and sped toward the city.","The comrades at the back stared coldly at the surroundings of the car. In this dangerous city where drugs were rampant and guns were everywhere, they needed to keep a clear mind at all times. If not, they might become victims. Even if they were in the car, they might not be safe.","After entering the city, the driver made many turns and parked the car at the entrance of an American-style restaurant.","A male doorman in a neat uniform was standing at the entrance of the cafeteria. When he saw Will walking over, he smiled and pulled open the door to the restaurant. He nodded and bowed. \"Welcome!\"","A standard greeting floated out from his mouth.","After entering the restaurant, a good-looking Molaban attendant walked over and led everyone to a table in the inner area. Will said to Xia Jinyuan, \"There are very few restaurants that are open until midnight. This restaurant is an exception. It’s open until morning and will only close during the day.\"","Xia Jinyuan got the attendant to hand over the menu but then passed it back. \"Since it’s a place recommended by you, Mr. Will, why don’t you help all of us order?\"","\"Okay, as long as you can accept it, I have no objections.\" Will took the menu and started ordering without looking at it. It was obvious that he had memorized the menu here.","In the middle of the night, not many people came to eat food. They mainly drank, so the food Will ordered was served very quickly.","Looking at the food that was served, Will, who was in a good mood, said, \"Come on, hurry up and try it. I can guarantee that this is definitely the best steak you’ll ever have in Molaban.\"","As he spoke, he started eating."]},{"number":5323,"title":"Chapter 5323: Action","paragraphs":["Ye Jian cut a small piece and put it into her mouth. She chewed and tasted it slowly. Actually, she didn’t taste anything special about it. She smiled at Xia Jinyuan and said, \"It’s indeed not bad. The texture of this meat is many times better than what we ate yesterday!\"","\"Not only are the ingredients good, but the chef’s skills are also on point. No wonder Mr. Will likes this place so much!\" Xia Jinyuan, who was never picky about food, ate a big piece of meat in his mouth. His eating style was rough, which was in line with his identity.","Because it was really delicious.","The delicious ingredients combined with the beautiful music from the piano in the hall made the customers forget where they were at this moment. Everything seemed so beautiful!","Mr. Will slowly enjoyed this moment of peace. This was his current state of mind.","G3 and the rest maintained their coldness. The six of them sat at two tables and looked around as they ate. They were also doing things that matched their identities.","When the piano music ended, Will stood up and said to the leader of the mercenaries who had finished eating and was standing up, \"Alright, you have to start working now.\"","He took out a stack of money from his wallet that was enough to pay for the meal. Without waiting for Xia Jinyuan, he walked out first.","When he walked out of the restaurant, it was so dark as even the street lamps were turned off. Will cursed angrily. He jumped into the driver’s seat. The young chauffeur, who was driving, had left at some point in time.","Will’s behavior was a little strange. He was sometimes calm, sometimes angry, sometimes silent, and sometimes talkative. His emotions fluctuated too much, and the more one looked at him, the stranger one found him.","Ye Jian secretly gave Xia Jinyuan a look. Xia Jinyuan leaned over to Ye Jian’s ear in the dark. \"We need him now. No matter how strange he is, we have to bear with it.\"","From Will’s point of view, he saw that the leader of the mercenaries was kissing his girlfriend again.","If it weren’t for the fact that they were very powerful, he would have sent them all away.","Will took out his car keys from his pocket and started the car. He turned on the glaring headlights and faced the mercenaries who didn’t plan to get into the car. \"What’s the matter? Do you want to go back to the hotel to sleep after eating? Don’t forget that you still need to save people for me. I’ll bring you to save them! Get in the car!\"","Go save people now?","This speed was a little fast!","However, Xia Jinyuan and the rest had no objections. They came to Molaban to save people. The earlier they acted, the better!","However, Will’s unstable emotions had already made everyone vigilant.","\"Get in!\" Xia Jinyuan waved his hand. T6 quickly opened the door of the back seat. Xia Jinyuan got in first. Then, Ye Jian got in. T6 and the rest got in too.","The car sped past. About 30 minutes later, the car arrived outside a factory. He stopped and instructed Xia Jinyuan, \"Someone needs to keep an eye on this place. Send your men down.\"","He was very familiar when giving the orders. It was as if he had done it many times before.","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze darkened. He raised his hand and gestured for T6 and V8 to get out of the car. \"Listen, guard here. Contact me immediately if there’s any movement.\"","He used English to communicate with his comrades because they were all soldiers who came out of the battlefield alive. After they retired, they became mercenaries who did the most profitable and dangerous jobs.","T6 and V8 got out of the car. Then, the car drove for about a hundred meters. Will asked Xia Jinyuan to send someone out of the car to guard the place again.","Z7 and White Crane got out of the car. When the car stopped completely, there were only G3, Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, and Will in the car."]},{"number":5324,"title":"Chapter 5324: Distrust","paragraphs":["This time, it was G3 and Ye Jian who got out of the car and stood guard.","Seeing this, Will’s gloomy expression improved a little.","\"This is Cyril’s factory. I suspect that the people we need to find are hidden here.\" Will pointed at the huge factory in front of him and stared at Xia Jinyuan gloomily. \"I hope that you can enter the factory tonight! I’ll pay a high fee for the hire, but you need to work equally hard.\"","Xia Jinyuan looked around. His voice, which contained blood lust, floated into Will’s ears coldly. \"Don’t worry, Mr. Will. You’ll pay, and I’ll give. We’ll make a fair deal. We need to discuss it properly now because you gave the order out of the blue. We need a plan.\"","\"Okay, you don’t have to mind me.\" Will stepped back and returned to the car.","Soon, he got out of the car and stuffed a document into Xia Jinyuan’s hand. \"The factory blueprint. I think it’ll be useful.\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. He took the blueprint and looked at it. \"Mr. Will, if we save your people, how are you going to go back? There’s only one car here now. How do you plan to leave this place? I’m saying what if. If we really save them, how are we going to leave?\"","Will, who was in a fickle mood, sneered. \"I know that my friends might be locked up here, so of course, I have my own plans. If you save them, everyone can leave. Okay?\"","\"Okay, you seem very confident. In that case, we’ll believe in you. However, I have a request too. If we still need to protect you later on, we’ll have to charge double.\"","He was not afraid that Will would disagree.","In the darkness, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were cold as he stared at Will. He saw the subtle changes on Will’s face.","For instance, his pupils constricted slightly. He was nervous.","At the same time, the corners of his mouth were pressed down. He was angry.","In the end, he closed his eyes and hid his nervousness and anger. \"You mercenaries will die because of money one day! Do you think you can take your money with you when you meet God later?\"","\"Hahaha, thank you for your concern, Mr. Will. If it wasn’t for money, we wouldn’t have followed you to this godforsaken place.\" Xia Jinyuan laughed. He was arrogant and proud. Most importantly, he was very confident.","He was so confident that Mr. Will remembered that he had heard all kinds of rumors about this mercenary. He suppressed his impatience.","A smile appeared on his face again. \"Alright, gentlemen and that beautiful lady. If I really need you to protect me, I’ll double your fee. Good luck.\"","With that, Will strode back to the car.","After closing the car door, Will, who was still smiling, immediately changed his expression. One could vaguely sense that he was struggling.","\"There’s something wrong with him,\" Ye Jian said firmly again. \"He must be hiding something from us.\"","Xia Jinyuan retracted his smile and nodded with a dark gaze. \"Don’t bother with him. Let’s go to the factory to take a look. For now, we can only rely on him to save them as soon as possible. According to the information from above, the people we’re looking for might indeed be in the hands of Cyril.","\"Inform G3, K7, Z7, and White Crane to come over. Let’s plan properly. If the people are really here, we’ll try to succeed in one try. Otherwise, we’ll alert the enemy and be forced into a passive position later.\"","Ye Jian nodded and immediately informed her other comrades to come over."]},{"number":5325,"title":"Chapter 5325: Inexplicable","paragraphs":["She immediately called T6, who got out of the car first. \"It’s me. The location has been confirmed. We’ll gather immediately.\"","It was concise. After T6 ended the communication, he immediately rushed to the gathering point according to the location. Ye Jian informed K7 and waited for her comrades to arrive.","The factory should be an abandoned factory. The surroundings were very quiet, so quiet that it made people panic.","In the car, Mr. Will looked around intently. He was like a trapped beast that wanted to struggle away but realized that he was helpless.","His heavy breathing came from the car, indicating that he had lost control of his emotions again.","No, he needed to calm down. He needed to calm down!","There didn’t seem to be anything alive in the quiet surroundings. Even the figures running over were silent like ghosts. Will saw a black shadow running past the front of the car and heaved a sigh of relief.","They were indeed as powerful as they were in the investigation reports. In that case... they should be able to successfully bring the people out.","They would definitely succeed!","After the comrades who got off the car halfway reunited, Xia Jinyuan signaled them to stay away from the car. T6 looked inside the silent car, exhaled deeply, and said as if relieved, \"I’ve been so depressed. I’m relieved I can finally start working again.\"","Before he could finish speaking, the sound of a car engine came from the quiet night. The eight of them had cold expressions on their faces as they looked at the car.","Will, who was holding his phone, got out of the car as he spoke, \"Yes, that’s right. Drive straight ahead. When you reach the destroyed steel factory, I’ll wait for you here.\"","Someone else was coming!","Ye Jian’s expression darkened. What... did Will want to do?","Could it be that he didn’t trust them, so he was capricious?","A pickup truck quickly appeared in front of them. The lights of the truck were turned off, and a young man jumped out of the truck. He should be a young man because his footsteps were very light.","Will pointed at the young man. \"This is my bodyguard, Noah. He’s very familiar with this place. It’ll save time if he brings you in.\"","Noah looked at the illegal mercenaries hired by his boss and took the initiative to greet them, \"Hey, mercenaries, hello! My name is Noah, and I’m my boss’ bodyguard. I’m very happy to work with you this time!","\"Before we work together, can you tell me what you’re best at? Yes, I used to be a soldier too. After I retired, I’ve been protecting my boss. Now that we’re working together, I think we should understand each other better.\"","Z7 was the first to reply, \"Communications, break out.\"","\"Medical care.\" K7’s calm voice followed closely behind Z7’s.","\"Blaster.\" A cold voice came from G3’s mouth.","Xia Jinyuan pointed at himself and said unhappily, \"I’m their leader. I’m a soldier who climbed above a hundred people on the battlefield. This is my girlfriend. She likes to kill people the most.\"","\"You guys sound very powerful.\" Noah shrugged and then said to Will respectfully, \"Boss, the people you found should be able to save your friend.\"","\"Bring them in.\" Noah’s arrival calmed Will’s uneasy emotions. Even his tone when he spoke to Xia Jinyuan became gentle. \"I’m sorry. I’ll only feel at ease if he goes in with you. It’s all thanks to Noah that I found out that my friend might be hiding here. He was also the one who told me that you were here.","\"Noah will help you enter the factory. Trust me, with his help, you’ll be able to save my friend faster.\""]},{"number":5326,"title":"Chapter 5326: How Arrogant","paragraphs":["There were indeed traces of the military on Noah’s body, especially his lower jaw, which had a scar from a stray bullet. It was obvious that he was injured by bullets.","He had a pair of brown-blue eyes. When he spoke, his lips would curl up, and he looked at the other party politely. You could feel respect in his eyes and inadvertently feel probing.","Ye Jian, who was standing at the side, played with the dagger in her hand, allowing Noah to secretly size her up.","They had all disguised themselves before they set off. For example, her skin had turned tanned. She had also pulled her clothes and hat over her head. The wide brim of her hat almost covered her eyes. If Noah wanted to see what she looked like, he would have to put in some effort.","Moreover, they were standing in the dark. No one could see each other clearly.","Noah really wanted to see what these illegal mercenaries looked like. Unfortunately, no matter how good his vision was, he couldn’t see through the darkness of the night.","Mr. Will, who was waiting at the side, started to get impatient. He glared at the mercenaries he hired, and his tone became much fiercer. \"You can leave with Noah now. Hurry, don’t waste my time.\"","Xia Jinyuan ignored Will. Instead, he suddenly asked Noah, \"You borrowed your vehicle, right? Where did you hide it?\"","\"You have good eyesight. Of course, I borrowed it. You won’t know where it was hidden even if I told you,\" Noah replied casually. After he finished speaking, he raised his eyebrows. \"Why? Do you have any questions?\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled. His low voice was filled with danger when he spoke, \"It’s best if you borrowed the vehicle. If not, trouble will come looking for you.\"","\"I think we’re thinking the same thing.\" Noah smiled too. His laughter was clean, like a carefree boy’s. \"I like working with smart people. My boss likes working with smart people too.\"","\"Come on, mercenaries. I wish us a happy cooperation.\" Noah reached out his hand and held Xia Jinyuan’s. The moment he did, his clean laughter got louder.","Ye Jian snorted. \"It looks like there’s really no one around. You’re not even hiding your laughter.\"","Noah stopped laughing. \"Your reminder was timely. I was so happy to see you that I forgot where I was.\"","\"Make your own arrangements. I just want to see my friend as soon as possible.\" After Will finished speaking, he turned around and returned to the car. Noah shrugged his shoulders and said helplessly to Xia Jinyuan and the rest, \"Although the boss is very generous, his temper is bad. If I’m fired by my boss one day, can I join your mercenary organization?\"","\"No.\" Xia Jinyuan rejected him. He looked down on Noah.","Noah had a good temper and didn’t collapse from anger. He replied regretfully, \"That’s a pity.\"","Glancing at him, Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to talk anymore. Noah had probed too much, so he should show that he was very impatient. He said, \"Since everyone is here, tell us about the factory.\"","\"Since we’re taking Mr. Will’s money, we’ll naturally complete the job given to us. As for you, Mr. Will’s bodyguard, stop testing me.\"","In the darkness, Noah heard the sound of the safety catch of the pistol being pulled. He narrowed his eyes slightly. This guy... was indeed the same as the investigation report made him out to be.","He was arrogant and insolent.","Noah, who was squinting, smiled again. He didn’t think much of Xia Jinyuan’s impatience. \"Okay! Okay! We’ll get to work immediately. Don’t you need some good things before you work? For instance, guns and grenades? Do you need them? You definitely do. I don’t see any lethal weapons on you.\""]},{"number":5327,"title":"Chapter 5327: Other Intentions","paragraphs":["As soon as Noah finished speaking, he heard countless clicking sounds of bullets being loaded.","He laughed. Xia Jinyuan pressed on the map with one hand and asked him angrily, \"Bodyguard, what are you laughing at?\"","\"Haha, I’m sorry. I can’t help but want to laugh.\" Noah ignored the other party’s anger and laughed until he recovered before speaking. \"You want to rely on a few guns to enter? Do you think that the other party has no guns? Do you think you can beat them in a firefight?\"","Wasn’t this group of mercenaries thinking too simply of Cyril?","After he finished laughing, Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"Bodyguard, don’t you know that the eight of us like to snatch weapons from other people’s hands? Oh, I’m sorry. I don’t think your boss will tell a bodyguard everything.\"","Will truly didn’t tell Noah this. A hint of coldness instantly appeared in Noah’s clean smile. It seemed that Mr. Will hadn’t been completely honest.","A grenade was suddenly thrown out. It landed beside Noah’s feet. He was squatting on the ground with a flashlight. When the grenade was thrown over, his first reaction was to escape. His pupils constricted. However, he saw the safety catch on the grenade. Noah picked up the grenade and looked at it. \"As it turned out, you do have lethal weapons. It looks like I was too worried. However, there’s something you definitely need. Give me three minutes.\"","After he finished speaking, Noah ran toward the car he was driving. Soon, he came over with two hotel bags. He unzipped them and revealed the equipment inside. \"We need communication tools that can maintain contact at any time. The mainframe is connected to the boss’ business car.\"","This was to tell Xia Jinyuan that Will could hear their conversation after they started working.","Wireless communication was indeed a good thing. The eight of them arranged it one by one and tried the channels. Noah didn’t waste any more time and finally breached the topic. \"Next, we’ll start doing serious things.\"","The factory was indeed very complicated. However, Cyril’s men didn’t guard the entire factory. His men only guarded one place. As for them, they only needed to go to one place.","\"Mr. Will has already given you the factory blueprint just now. Take a good look at it, mercenaries. You’ll definitely need it.","\"From the outside, this looks like an abandoned steel factory. However, there’s a huge underground drug-making center inside. The underground warehouse has been modified. We can’t enter directly from the entrance. We have to climb through the sewer pipe.","\"The environment in the sewers is a little bad. For instance, there might be rats. I hope that you can remain calm after stepping on them. Don’t scream. Otherwise, we’ll be unlucky.","\"After entering from here...\" Noah’s fingers slid across the floor plan of the factory. He said calmly, \"There’s a 50-meter corridor with people guarding both sides of it. Normally, there will be about ten people. After entering the underground factory, we need to deal with the people here before we can enter the underground factory and find the boss’ friend.","\"I need to remind you that the entire underground factory is equipped with surveillance cameras. The control room is 50 meters away from where we walked. As for which room is the control room, I’m sorry, I didn’t get the exact information.\"","To be able to get the factory blueprint, know the secret route to enter the underground factory, and even enter the underground factory was not something an ordinary person could do.","Xia Jinyuan looked at Noah intently. This bodyguard was not simple."]},{"number":5328,"title":"Chapter 5328: Making Use Of Each Other","paragraphs":["After listening to Noah’s detailed description, Xia Jinyuan looked at the factory blueprint. After looking at it quietly for a few minutes, he started to make arrangements in a low voice. His arrangements were very rough, matching his identity as a mercenary.","For money, they would be cruel and bloody. They wouldn’t think about other people.","As Noah listened quietly, the suspicion in his heart dissipated a little.","These eight fellows... shouldn’t be a big problem. It was indeed Will who wanted to find people to save the mother and child. The Chinese might not know what had happened, which was why they hadn’t acted.","At the thought of this, the expression on Noah’s face relaxed.","In the car, Mr. Will, who was listening, relaxed a lot. It sounded like these guys were reliable.","\"The problem with the surveillance room will be solved immediately. K, guard this place. After we kill our way in, you have to be here. I don’t want to see anyone else besides you.\"","In front of Noah, Xia Jinyuan erased the numbers behind all his comrades’ codenames. K was K7.","K7 nodded. He would guard this place. No one could pass by him.","\"Z will take care of Cyril’s surveillance and communication facilities. B will protect Z.\"","Z was Z7, and B was White Crane.","\"T and V, the two of you will scout the path together. Kill everyone you can. G, help clean up the mess at the back. I don’t want to see any survivors going out to report the situation.\"","The three of them nodded, indicating that they understood.","As for Ye Jian, she cooperated with Xia Jinyuan and followed closely behind Noah.","\"She and I will enter the underground factory. After we find the people, T, V, and G, you’ll cause a huge commotion and clean up the surroundings. After we rescue them, Z and B will be in charge of receiving them. Send them to Mr. Will as soon as possible. We’ll bring up the rear and clean up this place. I believe Mr. Will will be very happy to see us turn this place into a sea of fire.\"","His arrangement deepened the smile in Noah’s eyes. This man was a very smart mercenary. This fellow must have been a commander in the past. He was also a commander who liked to destroy.","Will, who was hiding outside, began a long wait. He hoped that the rescue tonight would be successful. He hoped he could send his friend out of Molaban and that he could meet his friend’s family as soon as possible.","Will drew a cross in front of his chest. He held it with both hands and lowered his head to pray.","Ye Jian and the rest followed Noah into the sewer. The group of nine people crawled forward on all fours. The environment was as bad as Noah had said. Fortunately, this was an abandoned sewer, so there was no sewage.","A rat swooshed past the back of his hand, squeaking all the way to an unknown place.","No one panicked. They quickly crawled through the complicated sewer pipe. After about 15 minutes, Noah, who was leading the way, whispered, \"We’re here. Be careful.\"","Being able to come out of the sewer meant that they had entered the heavily guarded underground drug factory. It meant that all of them had entered the danger zone.","Xia Jinyuan, who came out first, held Ye Jian’s hand so that she could stand up with the strength of his arm. His palm itched slightly, and a few words were quickly written in his palm.","\"Noah might not be Will’s bodyguard.\" Ye Jian finished writing quickly. There was coldness in the depths of her clear black eyes. \"The two of them don’t seem to have an employer-employee relationship.\"","Will couldn’t influence Noah’s arrangements at all, and he listened to Noah.","Xia Jinyuan wrote on Ye Jian’s palm, \"Let’s find them first. We’ll discuss it when we get back.\"","They both felt that something was wrong with Will and could tell that there was something wrong with Noah as well. The relationship between the two was unclear, but Will was a key figure who could save the scientist’s wife and child. The Chinese needed to be careful, so they could only rely on Will."]},{"number":5329,"title":"Chapter 5329: Bloodbath","paragraphs":["Despite knowing that there was something wrong with Will and Noah, the soldiers could only continue walking. They would take it one step at a time and deal with it according to the situation.","After entering the 50-meter corridor, they encountered the first surveillance camera. Noah, who had hidden himself, pointed up. \"There are three of them here. Destroy them so that we can pass through the 50-meter corridor.\"","Z7 looked at the surveillance cameras on top and said calmly, \"It’s not difficult. Leave it to me.\"","After he finished speaking, he stared at the camera and whispered to White Crane beside him, \"Get ready.\"","White Crane nodded and moved in front of Z7. Hearing Z7’s low shout, White Crane pounced and rolled over. He went under the first camera and quickly stuck to the wall.","Noah was taken aback. Did that guy successfully pass through the blind spot on one side when the camera turned?","Fortunately, these guys were mercenaries. They weren’t sent by the Chinese.","Z7 was in charge of communication. He could play with all kinds of communication equipment. He only needed to look at the camera to calculate the angle, time, and blind spots.","Right on the heels of that, Z7 pounced and rolled over. The two of them, who had evaded the surveillance cameras, quickly infiltrated the surveillance room. Then, they took care of the surveillance staff at lightning speed.","\"We’ve taken care of it.\" Z7’s smug voice came from the earpieces. Looking at the useless cameras, Noah felt that they had a high chance of saving the people tonight.","This made Noah believe in the capabilities of mercenaries. They moved like ghosts and cooperated very well. Before he could react, there were four corpses in front of him.","He also understood why they said that they were used to snatching other people’s weapons. Before entering the interior, they had four more AKs in their hands. Noah’s expression was a little solemn.","It was already midnight. The people patrolling with guns gradually became tired. Two of them were even hugging their guns and leaning against the wall to sleep.","Noah saw that the mercenaries killed the victims as easily as rabbits, so he gently walked around them. Two mercenaries grabbed the guys’ heads and twisted them backward. With two clicks, the heads of the two unlucky guys who were sleeping were twisted at strange angles.","\"Do you need it?\" Ye Jian picked up the AK in her target’s hand and passed it to Noah provocatively. \"We’ll be picking up a lot. Do you need it?\"","Noah narrowed his eyes and smiled. He replied elegantly, \"Thank you, but I don’t think I need it for now.\"","\"Ha.\" Ye Jian sneered. This was exactly what she wanted.","White Crane covered Z7. Z7 only heaved a sigh of relief when he turned off all the cameras in the entire factory and implanted new ones. From the surveillance cameras, he saw that there were no problems under every camera.","White Crane guarded the door of the surveillance room. Behind the door were three corpses with their necks broken.","\"I’ll cut another small window to show them where there are people and where there are no people.\" Z7 stretched his arms and quickly typed in the monitoring room. The scene on the monitoring screen did not move, but the small window he cut allowed him to see the situation of the entire factory through the probe.","The two men were wearing clothes that had been taken off by the surveillance personnel. If there were people passing by outside, it was difficult to see anything wrong without careful observation.","The door of the surveillance room opened. Xia Jinyuan and the rest carried the six corpses in. After cleaning up outside, they left quickly.","With Z7’s help, Xia Jinyuan and the rest dealt with their targets very smoothly. It was so smooth that Noah almost suspected that this wasn’t Cyril’s drug factory. All the guards were so weak that no one noticed them despite eight people being killed."]},{"number":5330,"title":"Chapter 5330: Watch Out","paragraphs":["No, it wasn’t that Cyril’s guards were weak. It was just that these mercenaries were too powerful. No wonder they were the most expensive team in the entire illegal mercenary organization.","The eight of them took down the guards easily. Even as a former soldier, Noah was shocked.","He thought that they needed his help. In the end, he was really just in charge of leading the way. Other than leading the way, he had no other use.","Z7 was also looking for a place where the scientist’s wife and child could be locked up. He checked all the surveillance footage of the entire underground factory and saw that the drug production was in full swing, with everything from raw materials to semi-finished products to finished products.","\"Avoid the production room on the left and go through the corridor,\" Z7 said in a low voice. There was a thin layer of sweat on his forehead. He instructed Xia Jinyuan and the rest, who were all wearing the company uniform, to avoid the dangerous area with many people.","However, Noah said, \"If we avoid it, don’t even think about finding the people we’re looking for.\" He looked at the leader of the mercenaries who had given him a huge surprise. \"The people we’re looking for are inside. There’s no safer and tighter place than the drug production room.","\"We need to go in.\"","The air was a little heavy. Xia Jinyuan looked at Noah like a vicious beast that could pounce on him at any moment. \"Are you kidding me?!\"","\"I’m very serious,\" Noah replied.","Will’s unhappy voice came from the earpieces. \"Do you guys not want to receive your sky-high fees? You’re a bunch of greedy guys. If this rescue mission weren’t so difficult, would I have risked my life to find mercenaries to rescue them?","\"If you accept my price, you need to accept the risk behind the price. Isn’t that right?\"","Xia Jinyuan calmed down for a few seconds and said fiercely, \"Get to work!\"","Will and Noah heaved a sigh of relief. They were really worried that these outlaws would give up in the end. Fortunately, the temptation of money was huge. They didn’t give up.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at Noah secretly before raising his hand to signal his comrades to enter the drug production room.","There were also people holding guns protecting the production room. They would habitually raise the AKs in their hands intermittently, looking very intimidating. The busy workers didn’t look at them. They were already used to it. As long as they worked obediently, there wouldn’t be any problems.","Z7 and White Crane held their breaths. K7, who was guarding the sewer pipe, rubbed the gun in his hand with his fingers. He was already prepared to fight at any time.","T6 and V8 entered the production room first with their AKs. When they entered, several gazes swept over.","Outside, two armed guards on patrol passed by the monitoring room. Perhaps they sensed something was wrong, so they stopped at the door of the monitoring room and noticed White Crane coughing softly. He gave Z7 a subtle wink.","There was a knock on the door. After saying something, the two of them pushed the door open and entered. They didn’t look behind the door. Their gaze landed on Z7, who was sitting in front of the large screen of the surveillance cameras. He was speaking in the language of Molaban.","Z7 didn’t move, and White Crane didn’t move either. Snores could be heard. The two people who walked in laughed. As it turned out, they had fallen asleep.","They reached out their hands and were about to push them awake when the people who were sleeping suddenly moved. A cold light flashed past their eyes. The two people who were about to nudge them suddenly froze and staggered back. They opened their mouths, only for blood to spurt out from their necks.","Their windpipes and aortas were instantly cut off at the same time. Unexpectedly, they fell to the ground and died."]},{"number":5331,"title":"Chapter 5331: Impressive","paragraphs":["White Crane cleaned up the event location. He pulled up their company uniform and pressed it against their necks. The blood that spurted out was absorbed by their clothes. It wouldn’t immediately stain the ground.","In the production room, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian walked along the wall one after another. They looked like ordinary patrol guards. They were so relaxed that no one could detect any problems.","Not all the guards knew each other, and since there was no movement outside, the patrolling guards guarding the production room merely took a few glances.","Noah felt that his back was drenched in sweat. Two patrolling soldiers walked along the aisle of the production room. He was about to turn along the wall when he met them. Noah swallowed his saliva. Sweat gathered into a line and dripped down his chin.","\"Hey...\"","Someone spoke to Noah. His entire body turned tense. He stopped in his tracks and whispered to the mercenary who was walking with him, G3, \"Walk forward. Do you see the steel door? Think of a way to enter. I’ll hold them back.\"","G3 nodded and relaxed his footsteps as he walked toward the bright steel door.","Noah spoke the Molaban language. He stopped to talk to the patrolling guards who greeted him.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan turned around and walked into the production room. They hid among the busy workers. With the cover of the workers, they were safer.","Ye Jian turned off the communication device and secretly took off her earpiece. She whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"We were too anxious this time. We followed their arrangements without figuring it out first. There’s something wrong with Will. When something happens, we don’t know if Will will wait for us outside.\"","\"We had different identities before, so we needed to be cautious. Now, we are a group of lawless desperadoes who will do whatever it takes to get money, and leave without money. We are mercenaries, and we need to do things that are consistent with our identity as mercenaries.\"","\"Think about it again. What we’re doing now is what we should be doing. Do you understand?\" Xia Jinyuan smiled and raised the AK in his hand to block the gaze of the guard who was looking at him sideways.","After passing through the narrow aisle, the steel door that Noah mentioned was in front. G3 passed through the steel door and turned around with his footsteps. He walked toward Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","Were the people they needed to save really behind the steel door?","\"Steady. There are 11 guards in total. Think of a way to lure them out,\" G3 said in a low voice. Xia Jinyuan nodded slightly and led Ye Jian and the other two past him.","Outside, Z7, who had received the update, looked at the alarm and smiled. \"Leave it to me, comrades.\"","A few seconds later, an alarm suddenly sounded from outside. The sharp sound made the 11 guards guarding the production room rush out with their guns.","The alarm sounded near the production door. This was the area they were in charge of.","The expression of the guard who was talking to Noah changed drastically. He shouted in a low voice, \"Guard them!\"","He asked Noah to stay behind and rushed out with his gun.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian quickened their pace and rushed toward the locked steel door. They took out pistols with silencers. Ye Jian hit the center of the lock twice.","Just as Ye Jian and the rest were about to break in, a few more guards came back. Noah panicked and suddenly raised his gun and fired at the door.","The guard who solved the alarm fell to the ground without reacting. G3 no longer had the mind to kill Noah. He cursed and raised his AK to shoot at several guards who came over after hearing the noise.","Gunshots suddenly sounded. The workers who were making the drugs were so frightened that they hugged their heads and squatted down one by one. They were very afraid, but they seemed to be used to this kind of shooting scene. No one screamed."]},{"number":5332,"title":"Chapter 5332: Bloody Battle","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan glanced over, picked up his pistol, and shot at a worker who was touching under the lathe in the production room. He wanted to report it to the outside!","Bang!","The sound of a gun was heard. The worker who wanted to report the news fell to the ground. Noah shouted in the Molaban language, \"Behave yourselves. No one is allowed to move. We’ll leave quickly! We won’t hurt you!\"","Then, he shouted at Ye Jian, who was still shooting at the lock of the steel door, \"Damn it, hurry up!\"","After shouting, he swept his gaze outside again. The guards who came as reinforcements fell to the ground one by one. In the car, Will, who heard the gunshots, couldn’t sit down anymore. His forehead was sweating non-stop. He took out a handkerchief and wiped his sweat with trembling hands. He kept muttering, \"God bless, God bless.\"","Z7, who saw everything through the surveillance cameras, pointed at Noah and cursed, \"Bastard! Bastard! Damn it, he ruined our plan! Mr. Will, your stupid bodyguard did something very stupid!\"","After cursing, he turned to White Crane and said, \"Quick, go and support them. I’ll guard here and give you all the directions!\"","The situation was very dangerous. White Crane nodded and pulled open the door of the surveillance room to rush to the production room.","Noah had indeed ruined all their plans.","Even if there was a fight, it should have started after the people were found. It shouldn’t have started before the people were found.","The eight bullets in the pistol were all fired. The lock of the steel door was finally knocked off by Ye Jian. She raised her leg and kicked the steel door fiercely. With a bang, the steel door was kicked open. Ye Jian quickly dodged to the side to prevent an ambush from behind the door.","\"I’ll guard it. Go in and look!\" Xia Jinyuan stared at the entire scene. He fired his AK from the middle aisle and shouted angrily, \"Get up, get up! All of you, squat down against the corner of the wall! Hurry!\"","He was speaking English, which was not the language of Molaban. Noah repeated his words in the Molaban language.","With Xia Jinyuan’s shooting, the workers who squatted down trembled and hugged their heads as they leaned against the corner of the wall.","There were at least 30 guards who came to support them. White Crane, who had rushed over, fired from the back. The guards who were caught off guard fell like dominoes.","Noah didn’t have the time to turn around to see if the steel door was broken. He was sweating and kept shouting, \"Damn it, we have to hurry! Cyril has three drug-making chains here, guarded by more than a hundred people. Hurry! Hurry up and look for the people!","\"They’re inside the steel door!\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was in control of the factory, didn’t miss a word of Noah’s. He memorized everything he said and waited to settle the score with him after he went out.","Damn it!","An impatient bastard might cause them to lose their lives at any moment!","Ye Jian had already rushed into the steel door. The steel door was filled with completed products. There were all kinds of colorful balls and white dust. The finished products on the World Poison Rankings could be seen here.","Ye Jian, who had lurked in Myanmar before, knew these finished products. She could tell their names with a glance. Now was not the time to care about harmful substances, though. She needed to find her targets.","Ye Jian searched through the warehouses one by one. Since she didn’t see anyone guarding the place, she took the risk and shouted, \"Alice Cheng! Alice Cheng...\"","\"Mm... Mm... Help, help... Help...\"","A weak voice came from the warehouse on the left. Ye Jian rushed over almost instantly. The voice was too weak. Ye Jian found two small warehouses and heard a weak voice in a warehouse filled with miscellaneous items."]},{"number":5333,"title":"Chapter 5333: Sharp Blade","paragraphs":["Ye Jian turned on the flashlight in her hand and shouted in a low voice, \"Alice Cheng, you’re Alice Cheng, right?\"","\"I... Yes, I’m Alice... Help... Help, help...\" At the end of the clutter, Ye Jian saw a lady with tied hands and feet. Her face was pale. With one look, Ye Jian matched the photo with Alice Cheng.","That was right, she was Alice Cheng.","\"I’ve found Alice Cheng...\" Ye Jian informed the outside as she quickly bent down and used her dagger to cut the ropes on Alice’s hands and feet. She said, \"Mr. Will asked us to save you. He’s waiting for you outside.\"","\"Will? It’s Will?\" Alice didn’t even have the energy to speak. She was hungry and thirsty. She couldn’t muster the energy to speak. \"Water, give me water... Give me... water.\"","Ye Jian didn’t have water.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief after rescuing Alice, who found it difficult to walk now.","Although Noah had messed up their plans, at least they found the scientist’s wife. Wait! Where was the child? Where did the child go?","\"Alice, where’s your child? Where did the child go?\"","\"I... I don’t know... I... I don’t know...\" At the mention of her child, Alice cried involuntarily. She was so weak that she looked like she was about to die from crying.","Ye Jian’s heart sank. She hugged the other party tightly and said in a low voice, \"We’ll find your child. We need to go out now.\"","In the car, when Will heard that Alice had been found, he was so happy that he covered his face with his hands and started crying. She was saved. She was finally saved.","After coming out of the steel door, Xia Jinyuan shouted, \"Retreat!\" He and G3 covered Ye Jian as they rushed out of the production room.","White Crane shot from the back. The guards, who were attacked from both sides, didn’t even have a place to hide and were killed by the AK bullets.","Noah brought up the rear and kept urging the people in front to hurry up. Z7 was already prepared to receive them and was just waiting for his comrades to come out.","They were very fast. In addition, Cyril’s four production lines were not in the same place but in basements of other abandoned factories. The gunshots in the basement could not be heard, and the guards of the other three drug-making chains could not detect them and provide support.","\"Hurry, hurry, hurry!\"","Noah urged them. He knew how powerful Cyril was and how many people he had here. That was why he was more nervous than anyone else. He just wanted to leave as soon as possible.","They needed to evacuate immediately and couldn’t clean up the event location. Someone in the production room saw them leaving and quickly got up to pounce on a certain spot. He raised his hand and pressed a red alarm.","This was an alarm that was connected to the other three production lines. As long as it was pressed, the other three production lines would immediately know that something was wrong.","Footsteps suddenly sounded under the quiet abandoned factory. Z7, who was guarding the surveillance room, saw a group of guys with AK rifles rushing over through the surveillance cameras. He pressed the microphone by his mouth and said fiercely, \"We’ve been discovered. Retreat! Retreat!\"","These were all Cyril’s men. Besides leaving some people to guard the production lines, the rest surrounded the middle.","Z7, who had been watching the surveillance cameras, kept telling his retreating comrades about the situation outside. When his comrades appeared in front of him, he raised his gun and destroyed the entire surveillance cameras. Then, he immediately shielded Alice with Ye Jian.","\"K, prepare to receive them!\"","\"No problem.\"","K7 replied. He had been guarding the sewer pipe, waiting for his comrades to come over."]},{"number":5334,"title":"Chapter 5334: Keep A Close Eye","paragraphs":["The evacuation was much faster than when they came. There was no need to worry about cameras, and there were no targets in front to clear. After a while, K7 received his comrades.","Noah was the first to crawl into the sewer pipe and quickly climb out.","Faster, faster, faster!","He couldn’t be caught by Cyril. That vicious fellow had many ways to torture the captured captives. The police commissioner of a certain district in Molaban had once destroyed his business. Cyril brought people into the commissioner’s house and killed the commissioner’s entire family. In the end... he cut the commissioner’s flesh until he stopped breathing.","He said that the destroyed drugs were his flesh. He had to let the commissioner have a taste of getting his flesh cut.","The sewer pipe was the entrance found by Noah, and even Cyril himself didn’t know it. When Cyril’s men rushed to their underground factory, Ye Jian had already climbed out of the pipe channel. She carried Alice out.","Mr. Will finally saw his good friend. He shouted in a tearful voice, \"Alice, my friend, I’ve finally saved you. God bless, God bless.\"","\"Mr. Will, Alice needs water,\" Ye Jian reminded him. She and K7 supported Alice and quickened their pace.","This was not a place to talk. There was still danger. They needed to leave immediately!","The car started moving. Noah, Will, Alice, V8, and T6 took the MPV. Noah drove quickly away from the abandoned factory.","Ye Jian turned off her communication device and said in a low voice, \"We should be with them.\"","\"V8 and T6 know that there’s something wrong with Will and Noah.\" Xia Jinyuan flicked Ye Jian’s forehead. \"V8 is a scout. It’s more suitable for him to keep an eye on them.\"","This was Xia Jinyuan’s arrangement. He still didn’t know what Will and Noah’s motive was. He didn’t dare to put Ye Jian beside them.","Outside, female captives had always suffered worse than male captives.","G3, who was the first to rush out, had already driven the pickup truck that Noah ’borrowed’. The truck didn’t stop. It just slowed down.","Everyone quickly got into the truck one by one. The underground factory that they destroyed was filled with blood. When Cyril received a call and knew that his factory had been destroyed, he took out his gun and killed the two women who were wrapped around him.","After knowing that the drugs were not damaged and only dozens of people had died, and that the woman they had locked up previously had disappeared, Cyril felt a little better.","He could accept his people getting killed, but he couldn’t accept his drugs getting destroyed.","He ordered his subordinates to search the surroundings. Then, he arranged for them to find who dared to cause trouble in his territory.","At this moment, the special forces soldiers who had been fighting nervously for nearly an hour had already left the abandoned factory. After G3 drove a distance away, everyone in the car relaxed a little.","\"There’s finally an explanation for this mission.\" Z7 exhaled and turned to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian looked at the road in front of her with her bright eyes. She shook her head and said in a low voice, \"It’s too early to say that. Only when the scientist, his wife, and his child are brought back to the country safely can we say that we have an explanation.\"","Z7 smiled and glanced at Ye Jian. \"Do you have to be so serious? At least we’ve saved Alice. We just have to be careful on the way back, and nothing will go wrong!\""]},{"number":5335,"title":"Chapter 5335: Complicated","paragraphs":["Nothing would go wrong...","Ye Jian rubbed the rifle in her hand lightly. She frowned and didn’t say anything else.","She didn’t know the relationship between Will and Noah, and she didn’t know who Noah was... Because she didn’t know these things, she felt a little uneasy.","Xia Jinyuan knew her uneasiness. Considering how Alice disappeared, how she fell into the hands of a drug dealer, the sudden appearance of Noah—who used to be a soldier—and the few times he probed them, he had as many questions as Ye Jian.","Why was Alice in Molaban?","Why did she end up with a drug dealer? Why did the drug dealer kidnap Alice? There was no relationship between the two.","Noah, who used to be a soldier, suddenly appeared and was able to make decisions for Will. What was the reason behind this?","Ye Jian only wanted to know Noah’s identity, but Xia Jinyuan was looking at the bigger picture. He was considering the entire incident and the various relationships involved.","If... he handed the rescued Alice to Noah, would something happen again?","If nothing happened, his vague guess wouldn’t be valid. If something happened, he could further expand his thoughts and think about it.","The car belonged to someone else. If they had any questions, they couldn’t say them in the car. They could only wait until they returned to the hotel.","After resting for a while, Xia Jinyuan said to White Crane, who was sitting beside him, \"Contact the vehicle in front and tell him that we’re behind him. Tell him to drive slower and wait for us to meet up.\" He paused for a moment and continued, \"G, drive faster and catch up with K as soon as possible.\"","The night sky was dotted with stars. One could only hear the rumbling of the motor.","After receiving the call from his comrades in the vehicle at the back, V8 smiled easily and said, \"Mr. Will said that we’ve already left, so there won’t be any more problems. Let’s go to the hospital first and settle the commission.\"","\"Hahaha, I’ll use this commission to drink the best wine here and look for the prettiest girl in Molaban.\"","V8 smiled ostentatiously. He hadn’t gotten the money, but he was already thinking about how to squander it.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"Of course. You can stay here for a long time. Oh right, speak softly. Don’t forget that there’s a lady in your car.\"","\"Is that lady okay? Do you and T need to take care of her?\"","V8’s gaze moved slightly. He laughed and replied, \"No, no, no. There’s no need for us to take care of her at all. Mr. Will is a very meticulous man. There’s also his bodyguard, Noah. With them, T and I don’t have to do anything.\"","\"Gentlemen, don’t forget that Mr. Will is our employer. Please be more serious with your employer, okay?\"","\"Oh, okay. Thank you for your reminder,\" T6 replied. He turned his head and looked at Will behind him. He waved and smiled. \"Hey, Mr. Will, do you need our help? The commission remains the same.\"","Listening to the conversation between the mercenaries, Noah smiled slightly and looked out of the car window. Alice had been rescued, but the one who needed to be baited had yet to appear.","He took out his cell phone and looked at the time. Then, he immediately put it back in his pocket. Will, who was taking care of Alice, saw the cell phone screen. His hand trembled violently.","Did they need to continue?","Alice was already in this state. Why wouldn’t they let her off? Why wouldn’t they let a woman off?","Will, who was sitting in the back, looked pained."]},{"number":5336,"title":"Chapter 5336: Ambush","paragraphs":["The car sped through the city from South District to North District. When they passed by an empty street, a loud bang suddenly sounded in front of them. Right on the heels of that, Ye Jian saw flames rising into the sky not far away.","An ominous feeling rose in Ye Jian’s heart. \"G, hurry! It’s our vehicle. Hurry!\"","The vehicle reached the explosion point. Before G3 could stop the vehicle, his comrades had already jumped out of it.","Xia Jinyuan’s face turned cold when he saw this. The vehicle that was being burned by the fire was V8’s vehicle. Not far away, there was a motionless person. The others were gone.","Xia Jinyuan shouted in a low voice, \"Azure Bird, go and see who’s lying down. White Crane, search the surroundings. G3 will check the vehicle with me.\"","The few of them split up. Ye Jian ran toward the person lying on the ground. It was T6. The person lying on the ground was T6!","She squatted down and bent over. She didn’t move T6 or shout. She immediately checked if T6 had any serious external injuries.","White Crane quickly searched his surroundings. Xia Jinyuan and G3 walked around the burning vehicle. All the doors were open, and there was no broken glass on the ground. The vehicle was not damaged, which meant that everyone in the vehicle had gotten out. No one stayed inside.","After looking at it, the two of them looked at each other. Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"Take another look at the scene. I’ll go and check on T6.\"","\"Okay.\" G3 nodded.","Xia Jinyuan ran to Ye Jian’s side. \"How’s the situation?\"","Ye Jian stood up and pointed at a black car part beside her. \"The back of his head is injured and bleeding. There’s hair on the part. He was probably injured by the part and fainted from the explosion.\"","In other words, this unlucky fellow... was hit by the component when he was running and then fainted from the shockwave.","A vicious look flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s eyes. \"Let’s go to the hospital first!\"","After checking the surroundings of the vehicle and confirming that there was no one in the vehicle, G3 ran over. When he saw that the person lying on the ground was T6, his expression darkened. \"How is it?\"","\"He’s alive. He injured the back of his head, and he fainted.\" A cold voice floated out of Ye Jian’s mouth. \"Captain Xia, there’s a huge problem with Noah and Will!\"","\"I know.\" Xia Jinyuan bent down. G3 quickly bent down and helped T6 up. \"Let’s go to the nearest hospital. The problem we’re facing isn’t so simple.\"","Ye Jian’s gaze turned cold.","White Crane, who had found the mark left by V8, came back. \"V8 has left a safety sign. There’s no problem on his side.\"","After knowing that V8 had left a safety sign, Ye Jian felt much more at ease. White Crane drove the car all the way to the hospital. After reaching the hospital, he sent T6, who was still unconscious, into the operating room with the help of a nurse.","Outside, Z7 sat in the chair and gritted his teeth. \"Damn it! If I see them again, I’ll skin them alive!\"","At this moment, Ye Jian became calm. Xia Jinyuan sat down and said to Ye Jian, \"Tell me what you think.\"","Ye Jian thought for a moment and said slowly, \"Our operation has been targeted since the beginning. Otherwise, V8 and his team would not have been ambushed as soon as we rescued Alice. Will and Noah are also responsible.","\"But I’m more inclined to think that this has something to do with Noah. Will is Alice’s friend. Alice’s body is so weak, and Will won’t risk that. In that case, that leaves only Noah.","\"The ambush on V8 was caused by Noah’s forces and had little to do with Cyril’s forces.\""]},{"number":5337,"title":"Chapter 5337 - 666 Performance","paragraphs":["The ambush on V8 might be from Noah’s side. G3 and Z7 agreed with this.","However, the prerequisite was that they needed to know Noah’s identity. Only by knowing Noah’s identity could they investigate.","G3 pondered for a moment and asked Xia Jinyuan, \"You should be familiar with the environment and organizational forces of Molaban. Who else do you think would want to kidnap Alice?\"","Before Xia Jinyuan could reply, Z7 said, \"According to the information, Alice isn’t working. She has been taking care of the child at home. She’s just an ordinary housewife. Which organization would want to kidnap her?\"","After the accident, K7, who had been silently guarding the place, said, \"Her husband is not ordinary.\"","K7 received the burning gazes of his comrades. Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes and smiled with interest. \"What else?\"","He felt that K7 should be thinking the same thing as him.","K7 glanced at Xia Jinyuan. Facing his comrades’ burning gazes, he lowered his gaze unnaturally. \"If they’re targeting her husband, that would explain it.\"","That would explain why someone would kidnap a housewife who was not working and just took care of the child at home.","Another thought suddenly flashed past Ye Jian’s mind. Noah was a Caucasian. He even admitted that he was a former soldier. Wait... Wait...","An extremely bold but logical idea formed in her heart.","Ye Jian raised her eyes and looked at Xia Jinyuan without blinking. She slowly voiced the idea in her mind, \"I have a speculation. It might be bold, but I do think that there’s a high possibility of it.\"","V8 looked at Ye Jian. Did she have a new speculation? He was still at a loss.","K7 felt that with Ye Jian’s intelligence, he didn’t have to intervene anymore, so he stood there silently, continuing to keep silent.","G3 let out a soft exclamation. \"What’s your speculation? Tell us. You’ve always been more meticulous than us. Perhaps your speculation might just be the real thing.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled and looked over. He used his gaze to encourage Ye Jian to say what she was thinking.","With K7’s hint and his little fox’s intelligence, she probably already thought of the key. However, she had always been cautious and wouldn’t say things that hadn’t been confirmed. That was why she said that she had a speculation.","Although she had changed a lot, her meticulous personality had not changed.","It was not entirely good. The good thing about her phrasing was that it would make others feel comfortable and think that she was a girl who was easy to get along with and was considerate of others.","The bad thing was that if she needed to complete something alone in the future, her cautiousness would easily be seen as too gentle by people who were not familiar with her personality. That would make them question her arrangements.","He still needed to talk to her later. She needed to know when she could be cautious and when she needed to be bold.","Since they were in the hospital and she was about to get to the main point, Ye Jian lowered her voice and spoke slowly. It was so that K7, who was standing, could hear everything she said.","\"Noah is a soldier, and he’s staying by Will’s side as his bodyguard. Will is afraid of him, so Noah can make decisions for Will. We all know that soldiers can’t go out for no reason. It’s the same for any country. If we’re staying by someone’s side, it must be because we’re on a mission. In that case, can we think that a certain country sent Noah to get close to Will?\""]},{"number":5338,"title":"Chapter 5338: The Powerful Ye Jian","paragraphs":["When Ye Jian said her bold speculation, other than Xia Jinyuan, the other three comrades were shocked. The silent K7 looked at Ye Jian and slowly retracted his gaze.","Just now, he said that Alice’s husband wasn’t ordinary, but he was only referring to what G3 had said. He didn’t link it to Noah’s identity as a soldier and the country behind him.","G3 slapped his thigh. Even though he had lowered his voice, he couldn’t hide the surprise on his face. \"Yes, yes, yes. Azure Bird’s speculation is very possible! The key point is that as a soldier, Noah was sent by a certain country to get close to Will. It’s completely possible!\"","V8 thought to himself, ’It looks like my IQ is indeed low. I couldn’t think of anything even when I forced myself.\"","Ye Jian hadn’t finished speaking.","Seeing that her comrades agreed with her and seeing the smile in her man’s eyes, Ye Jian was especially happy. \"In that case, why did Noah make contact with Will? I’ll simplify the reason.","\"There are three possibilities as to why Alice entered Molaban. One is that Alice escaped with the child, contacted Will, and entered Molaban with Will’s help. However, the two of them hadn’t met yet when Alice and the child were taken away by Cyril because of something.","\"Secondly, Alice and the child were deliberately released by a certain country that had been putting the mother and son under house arrest. Then, they secretly sent Noah to follow them and see who would help Alice. That country would then immediately subdue these people who helped Alice.","\"Thirdly, a certain country deliberately released Alice and the child. Then, they sent Noah to follow them and see if any countries would save Alice and the child because of the scientist under house arrest. That way, they could confirm whether our country knows about the scientist who wants to return to our country to serve. However, because Cyril had captured Alice and the child, that country couldn’t use Alice and the child to confirm if our country knew anything. Hence, we needed to save Alice.\"","No one voiced up against Ye Jian because Ye Jian’s words were completely solid with no flaw.","Seeing that her comrades’ facial expressions were getting more and more serious because of what she said, Ye Jian, who knew that her comrades had accepted her ideas, voiced another thought.","\"Personally, I’m more inclined to the third possibility. That would explain why Noah knows about Cyril’s underground factory. He could also find the sewer pipe that even Cyril doesn’t know about. He also knows the internal structure of the entire underground factory, including Alice’s exact location. It’s because there’s more than one soldier like Noah who’s secretly operating.","\"In that case, it can explain what happened to V8’s truck. No one in the truck left. I think T6 would’ve been able to leave too. However, he was unlucky. He was stunned by the shockwave, and the back of his head was injured by a car part.","\"These are my personal thoughts, but I’m somewhat sure. You guys can think about it.","\"I’m inclined to the third possibility you mentioned,\" G3 said before looking at Xia Jinyuan. \"Q King, you should have some thoughts too. Tell me about them. If your thoughts are similar to Azure Bird’s, then the possibility is at least 50%.\"","Xia Jinyuan, a virgin, was very gratified. He looked at Ye Jian deeply and nodded. \"It’s not similar. It’s exactly the same.","\"I have doubts about Noah’s identity. The moment he revealed that he was once a soldier, he kept probing us. His goal was to know if we were real mercenaries or soldiers sent by the Chinese to rescue Alice and her child.\""]},{"number":5339,"title":"Chapter 5339: Interlinked","paragraphs":["Although the two had exactly the same thoughts, their way of thinking was completely different. Ye Jian thought that there was something wrong with the person after seeing the incident, while Xia Jinyuan, as the commander, looked for flaws in the conversation from the very start. He first suspected Noah and then found the key to the problem.","The former used a steady and cautious approach, while the latter figured it out in advance and paid close attention. It was more fitting of his role as a leader.","Everyone listened attentively as Xia Jinyuan said, \"The power behind him is the country where the scientist is under house arrest. He followed Alice all the way to Molaban. Just like what Azure Bird said, he wants to know if the Chinese have taken any action.","\"Alice was suddenly grabbed by Cyril, causing Noah and the rest to lose the chance to probe China. They also needed to save Alice. As a soldier, it was inconvenient for Noah to appear, so he let Will find stronger mercenaries to save Alice and the child. I’m afraid it was Noah who told Will about the idea of hiring mercenaries to save her.","\"Noah is a soldier. He was the one who told Will that Alice and the child were taken away by Cyril. This shows why Will listens to Noah’s arrangements.\"","As soon as he finished speaking and before his comrades could express their opinions, Xia Jinyuan’s cell phone in his pocket vibrated. The buzzing made Ye Jian and the rest look at Xia Jinyuan’s thigh. Not many people knew his cell phone number!","\"Could it be... Will?\" V8 probed. \"If Noah is really a soldier from that country, he has to leave someone to report to us.\"","It was indeed possible that it was Will.","Xia Jinyuan immediately took out his cell phone. Ye Jian, who was sitting beside him, leaned over and looked at it. She recognized the cell phone number at a glance. It was Will.","\"Will,\" Ye Jian said softly. Xia Jinyuan pressed the answer button and said in a deep and cold voice, \"Mr. Will, are you trying to avoid paying us by suddenly disappearing? You should know that we’re very, very angry now!\"","\"Q, Alice was kidnapped by a group of people again. Q, I urgently need your help again. To show my sincerity, I’ll immediately give you the first payment when we meet! Believe me, I’ve never thought of not paying you. I can swear to God that I’ve never thought of it!\"","Xia Jinyuan sneered, \"She’s just a woman. I really can’t figure out why so many people are kidnapping her. Also, Mr. Will, she’s just your friend, not your woman. Why are you willing to pay expensive fees again and again for her sake?","\"Ha, you’re full of lies! You and Noah joined forces to lie to us because you want to avoid paying us! Let me tell you, we won’t be fooled again! Also, hand over my brother immediately! If not, I’ll make sure you won’t be able to sleep from tonight onward!\"","Will was stunned by Xia Jinyuan. He looked at Noah, who was sitting in front of him, for help. What should he do? The other party wasn’t fooled at all.","Noah thought for a moment and lowered his voice. \"Ask him where he is now. We’ll send the money over personally!\"","Will swallowed his saliva. He used an even more panicked tone to show his sincerity. \"Q, calm down. Please calm down. I’m not lying to you. I really need your help now. Where are you now? I’ll send the money over immediately!","There was no other sound on the phone except heavy breathing. Just as Will thought that Xia Jinyuan would reject him, he suddenly heard the other party say angrily, \"Okay, I’ll give you one last chance. Send the money to the hospital! Now, immediately, send it to me!\""]},{"number":5340,"title":"Chapter 5340: Luring The Snake Out Of Its Hole","paragraphs":["In the hospital?","Noah was a little surprised. Why were they in the hospital?","He asked Will to ask who was in the hospital.","Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly and told Will, \"Mr. Will, Alice was kidnapped again. Do you have any other enemies besides Cyril?","\"Or maybe the person who kidnapped Alice is your enemy. Did you do something horrible to be targeted by these organizations?","\"Also, who exactly is Alice Cheng? Is she a special person? Did someone know that she was coming to Molaban and kidnap her through some local gangs? If she’s really important, then it’s possible that a local gang or even an organization from another country is involved.","\"You don’t have to answer all my questions. You just have to answer whether Alice Cheng is an ordinary woman or not!\"","Will was sweating from Xia Jinyuan’s questions. Alice was an ordinary housewife, but her husband was not ordinary at all.","What should he say?","If possible, he really wanted to tell the mercenaries who had the ability to rescue Alice that she was in Noah’s hands now. He wanted to ask them to help save her and bring her to the safest place.","The safest place... was the country her husband wanted to go back to.","But he couldn’t say it.","\"No, no, no. Alice is very ordinary. I suspect that my enemy kidnapped her. Is your brother alright? He wasn’t injured when we came out of the truck. I really don’t know how he got injured. I’ll come to the hospital immediately. Please wait for me.\"","Xia Jinyuan replied with an ’okay’ and emphasized that Will needed to bring everyone’s payment. \"I’ll wait for you at the hospital. As for how my brother got injured, we can only wait for him to wake up and see if he has any clues. You, bring the money and come over immediately. If you come quickly, we might be able to discuss who kidnapped your friend.\"","\"Okay, okay. I’ll come over immediately. Take good care of your brother!\" With that, Will hurriedly hung up the phone and looked at Noah. \"I’ve already done as you asked. Please take good care of my friend!\"","Will got up angrily. He picked up a small black suitcase that was placed beside the electrical cabinet and strode away. He really didn’t want to see Noah for a moment longer!","Looking at Will’s disappearing figure at the door, Noah fell into deep thought. He needed to think about whether he had left any flaws for the group of mercenaries.","This group of mercenaries was not simple. He had to be careful and vigilant.","Will pushed the door open and left. Just then, a tall Caucasian man walked over and saluted before asking, \"Colonel, do you need someone to keep an eye on him?\"","\"No, there’s no need. He’ll come back obediently.\" After saying that, Noah frowned and thought for a moment. He ordered, \"Chase after Will and ask him to think of a way to lure those mercenaries to our hotel.\"","As long as he saw these mercenaries, he would feel more at ease.","Will really wanted to punch Noah in the face. An hour later, Will, who was suppressing his anger, arrived at the hospital and handed the small black suitcase with all the money to Xia Jinyuan to show that he had no intention of avoiding payment."]},{"number":5341,"title":"Chapter 5341: Start Your Performance","paragraphs":["Will handed the small black suitcase containing the money to Xia Jinyuan. The two of them chatted in the hospital. He also told Xia Jinyuan that in order to express his sincerity, he had already booked a hotel for them. It was all presidential suites. He hoped that they could stay there.","He was so sincere that he even prepared hotel rooms for them.","Xia Jinyuan exchanged glances with G3 and pretended to consider it. He didn’t agree immediately.","When Will saw this, he remembered Noah’s instructions. He cursed Noah in his heart. His face revealed an unbearably sad expression. \"There’s nothing I can do. I can only rely on you to help me save Alice.\"","\"Didn’t you ask me who Alice was on the phone just now? I’m sorry, Q. I lied to you just now. Fortunately, only one of you was injured.\"","After he finished speaking, Will closed his eyes and drew a cross.","Will seemed very devout.","However, the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit came up with two pieces of information. Firstly, Will and his companions did not find V8 and thought V8 was with them. Second, Will wanted to tell them Alice’s true identity.","The other party didn’t find V8, so V8 was temporarily safe.","But who instructed Will to tell them Alice’s true identity?","Noah was the most likely candidate.","The expressions of the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit darkened. Ye Jian received G3’s signal and rushed out like a lioness. Without a word, she punched Will’s stomach and shouted angrily, \"You damned liar! How dare you lie to us?!\"","She still wanted to hit Will, but Xia Jinyuan hugged her waist. Ye Jian raised her legs and kicked Will, who was bent over from her punch. He was in so much pain that he couldn’t get up for a long time.","\"Calm down, baby. Calm down.\" Xia Jinyuan, who was smiling in his heart, hugged Ye Jian’s slender waist and lifted her high. He hugged her tightly in his arms. \"Don’t be angry. Although Mr. Will lied to us, we need to forgive him for the sake of money.","\"Okay, baby, you can calm down now. For the sake of the money, you need to calm down.\"","In the hospital, Ye Jian used her words and actions to portray a hot-tempered female killer who liked to kill people.","Will, who was in so much pain that he wondered if he was bleeding internally from the punch, hated Noah even more. He wanted to ask the mercenaries in front of him to help him deal with this problem.","Damn it. If it weren’t for Noah, Alice would’ve been rescued and sent to a safe place!","Ye Jian wasn’t so calm. She shouted again, \"T hasn’t come out of the operating room. He hasn’t come out of the operating room! He should’ve told us that Alice’s identity wasn’t simple. We would’ve definitely been on guard and not let T be in danger!\"","There was no mention of V8. Will, Noah, and the rest didn’t know that V8 was hiding in a hotel at this moment and staring at Noah.","Witnessing Ye Jian’s bad temper, Will, who was helped up by G3, decided to stay away. He leaned against the hospital wall and held the soft handrail that was installed on the wall to facilitate a patient’s walking. Will looked at Ye Jian vigilantly. She was still jumping around. But he was already in a sorry state. \"I’m sorry. I’ve realized my mistake.","\"Alice is really just an ordinary housewife. It’s just that... It’s just that her husband isn’t an ordinary person. I suspect that her husband is the reason why she was kidnapped again.\""]},{"number":5342,"title":"Chapter 5342: Well Done","paragraphs":["Just like what the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit had guessed, if it weren’t for Noah’s instructions, Will wouldn’t have revealed Alice’s identity.","After he finished speaking, a doctor in a white coat and a mask walked over from the corner corridor of the hospital. He was a tall man, and his walking speed was not slow. As he walked, he flipped through the documents in his hand. He glanced at Xia Jinyuan and the rest casually before lowering his head to flip through the documents.","Xia Jinyuan and the rest didn’t seem to notice the doctor. It was normal for doctors to come and go in the hospital. However, just as the doctor was about to brush past them, Xia Jinyuan, who was still hugging Ye Jian tightly, nodded and agreed to Will. \"Alright, since you’re so sincere, we’ll stay in the hotel you arranged.\"","After he finished speaking, he quickly kissed Ye Jian. \"Baby, are you satisfied with the presidential suite?\"","His comrades, who were witnessing their captain showing off again, secretly clenched their fists. They kissed again! He really took every opportunity to kiss her!","Ye Jian elbowed Xia Jinyuan’s chest and stared at Will coldly. \"If you dare to lie to us again, I’ll definitely kill you!\"","\"Let go! Stop kissing me! Go and kiss your favorite money!\" Her tone was fierce. She was addressing Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. His chest hurt from her push.","Seeing him in pain, his comrades were happy.","Well done, Azure Bird!","In the hotel, Noah sat on the balcony and opened a bottle of red wine. He looked like he was deep in thought.","He recalled receiving the phone call about the mission to board the plane and enter Molaban, witnessing Cyril kidnapping the surveillance target with his own eyes, and checking into the hotel to monitor Will and collect intelligence on Molaban.","After that, he waited for his other comrades to enter Molaban to look for Cyril’s whereabouts. He suggested to Will that if he wanted to successfully rescue Alice, he could try to contact some mercenaries.","Of course, this wasn’t his idea alone. He only told Will after the higher-ups agreed.","They needed to hide their identities well to avoid exchanging fire with the drug dealers who were powerful. Also, Cyril was very powerful. The best way to save Alice was to find mercenaries.","They would wait for the mercenaries to enter Molaban illegally through a special method. Then, they would use their ’illegal entry’ to make the mercenaries listen to their arrangements. They would enter Cyril’s underground drug factory to carry out the rescue.","He felt that every step he took was quite cautious and careful, but... why did he feel that something was wrong?","What went wrong?","Why did he have a strong feeling that the people they wanted to lure out were already here?","But what about the people from that country?","Why couldn’t he find them? There wasn’t even a trace of them.","China was still developing. They needed talents. They wouldn’t give up the chance to let their people return to their country to serve. They would definitely take action.","But why wasn’t there any movement?","Or were they already here and they didn’t notice?","Someone knocked on the door. Then, the person swiped his card and came in. He saw Noah sitting on the balcony. The person walked to the balcony and saluted. \"Colonel, everything has been arranged. It’s just that she keeps clamoring to see her child.\"","\"Tell her that the child is in a very safe place. After our matter is over, she’ll see her child. If she continues to make a fuss, say that the child will be in danger.\"","\"Yes, colonel.\" The man who came in retreated and told Alice what Noah said."]},{"number":5343,"title":"Chapter 5343: Disgusting Scheme","paragraphs":["The hotel that Noah and the rest were staying in was a joint venture hotel. According to the country’s star ranking, it was a five-star hotel. However, Noah didn’t choose to stay in the presidential suite. Instead, he chose a room with only one room and a small balcony.","The room was small. If there was any movement, he could hear it immediately.","A huge room like the presidential suite made it difficult to notice anything outside.","He naturally had his own plans for arranging for Xia Jinyuan and the rest to stay in the hotel’s presidential suites.","The sound of a lock was heard from the closed room. Noah, who had his head lowered, held the crystal glass. He moved his wrist slightly, and the bright red wine in the glass swirled along the walls of the glass.","\"Have they really come? Or do they really not know?\" he muttered to himself as he drank half a glass of red wine in one gulp. There was a cold and hard look in his green and brown eyes.","He didn’t believe that he couldn’t find people from a poor country!","According to the plan, they wanted to use Alice to warn China that they were the world’s largest country. It was best for them to be obedient at any time. They wanted to let China know the strength of the world’s largest country. From then on, China would lower their heads.","In the future, as long as China encountered something related to their country’s interests, they had to give way to the world’s largest country.","If China was disobedient, the largest country would definitely suppress and contain them in all aspects.","It was a joke that a country that they had never cared about and even looked down upon was actually starting to poach people!","However, they had been waiting for so long. Alice had been in Molaban for so long too. She had even encountered a kidnapping. Why didn’t the people from that country do anything?","Why did Cyril, who dared to kill the police commissioner in Molaban, kidnap Alice? What was their purpose?","A series of questions kept circling in Noah’s mind. The questions were like an invisible net that was thrown on him, making him feel suffocated.","He had a headache and needed to rest.","Noah, who had no clue at all, got up from the lounge chair on the balcony. When he returned to his room, he looked at the comfortable bed. No, he wasn’t sleepy. He should go out and let his mind relax.","Noah left the room and went to a bar to relax.","In the hospital, Ye Jian looked at the man beside her who always appeared calm and strong, but the expression on his face was becoming more and more solemn. She silently stretched out her hand and firmly grasped the slender fingers of the man in deep thought, as if telling him that no matter when and where, she would be by his side silently supporting and assisting him.","The gentleness in her eyes made Xia Jinyuan look up from his deep thoughts. He tilted his head and looked at the woman who had always been silently accompanying him no matter what crisis he was in. Seeing the tolerant gentleness in her eyes, he suddenly smiled. He stretched out his slender fingers and touched Ye Jian’s soft hair quietly. It wasn’t long, but it was so soft that he felt relaxed.","When he was with her, no matter what emergency he encountered and no matter what dangerous environment he was in, she would always bring him peace.","\"I’m fine. I’m just thinking about where we can find a breakthrough point later.\" His deep voice was slow and gentle. Xia Jinyuan leaned over and kissed Ye Jian’s forehead lightly. \"Are you sleepy? Do you want to sleep in my arms?\""]},{"number":5344,"title":"Chapter 5344: Wind And Rain Together","paragraphs":["A few hours had passed. It would be dawn soon.","Ye Jian shook her head gently to show that she wasn’t sleepy. She didn’t say anything. She just tightened her grip on Xia Jinyuan.","\"If you don’t want to sleep, then...\" Xia Jinyuan patted his shoulder. His voice became softer. \"Come, lean on my shoulder and rest for a while. T6 should be out soon.\"","On the surface, T6 only seemed to have an injury on the back of his head. However, after inspection, the powerful airflow had caused two of his ribs to break. There was also a steel bar that looked like a nail stabbed into his left waist. At that time, they didn’t notice any blood because the steel bar was wrapped in flesh. Only a small amount of blood seeped out. Those two injuries needed more time to be treated.","Fortunately, there was nothing wrong with his skull. The doctor said that there might be a slight concussion. He would only know when he woke up.","After nearly two hours of treatment, T6 was finally pushed out of the operating room. Although he was still unconscious, the moment T6 was pushed out, everyone guarding the door heaved a sigh of relief. As long as he was still alive, they would take revenge sooner or later.","After understanding T6’s situation in detail from the doctor, Xia Jinyuan turned around and said to Ye Jian, Z7, and G3, \"T will probably need some time to wake up. Ye Jian and I will stay here to take care of him. G and Z, go to the hotel that Will booked for us. Remember what I said before. Keep an eye on the people in the hotel. Maybe we can find something from them.\"","For instance, Noah’s identity.","Z7 looked at his comrade who was lying motionless on the bed. He pursed his lips and nodded. \"Okay, remember to inform us when you wake up. G and I will keep an eye on the hotel. We’ll leave first. Be careful.\"","They were still very cautious in the ward that was randomly chosen and didn’t say their real codenames.","K7 didn’t join in the conversation. He stood by the bed and picked up the medical record to check on T6’s surgery and the medicine used for T6’s intravenous drip.","G3 patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder and looked at K7 who hadn’t moved. \"K, let’s go back to the hotel to rest. We’ll come back later.\"","K7 put down the medical record clip. When he passed by Xia Jinyuan, he nodded slightly before leaving the ward.","They thought that last night’s fight was just an appetizer, and the real big action was still to come. They needed to get enough rest to deal with the increasingly complicated situation.","\"You can rest for a while now. I’ll watch over T.\" After his comrades left, Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian’s hand and sat on the only couch in the ward. For safety, T6’s ward was a single room.","Ye Jian sat down and shook her head. Although she hadn’t slept for the entire night, she didn’t look tired. \"I don’t want to sleep. Have a rest. I’ll keep an eye on her.\"","\"Let’s go together.\" Xia Jinyuan, who wasn’t sleepy either, placed his arm around Ye Jian’s shoulder and let her rest her head on his shoulder. His lips seemed to move slightly. \"We have to think of a way to inform the embassy. We have to be more careful when rescuing the scientist. He’s waiting for our country to save him.\"","Ye Jian closed her eyes and yawned. She raised her hand to cover her lips. \"We’re all being watched. G3 and the rest must be the same. The only person who can inform the embassy is V8. Let V8 know.\"","She put down her hand and finished speaking.","Currently, only V8 was suitable to inform the embassy. The less they acted, the safer it would be.","Time passed quietly, but to the people waiting, it was indeed a long time. The two of them leaned against each other and waited for T6 to wake up."]},{"number":5345,"title":"Chapter 5345: Cut Off","paragraphs":["The expressions on both of their faces were not very good, and each one was more solemn than the other, especially when they were not talking. They were so solemn that it seemed as if even the air around them was tense.","T6, who was covered with a white blanket, lay motionless on the bed. If one didn’t look carefully, one would almost think that he wasn’t even breathing.","Looking at T6 like this, another image kept flashing past Xia Jinyuan’s mind.","One winter, his comrade lay on the bed motionlessly as if he had fallen asleep. Xia Jinyuan watched from afar and didn’t even have the courage to take steps.","That winter, he lost his comrade, J5, forever. Time couldn’t be reversed, and his life couldn’t be extended. His comrade fell on the battlefield and never returned.","This was the pain of having your heart broken.","T6 was on the same bed and under the same white blanket. When Xia Jinyuan recalled the past, the pain was still like getting his flesh cut.","Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian tightly.","He thought of J5, and Ye Jian thought of J5 too. When she thought of the scene that made her feel like the world was collapsing, the pain in her heart continued.","The word ’sacrifice’ was followed by the sorrow of his comrades.","The comrade who once fought side by side with her, laughed and talked with her, went through hardships together, and shared blessings with her had fallen. From then on, they would never be able to hear each other’s voices again. Those who had never experienced this pain could not understand it.","After the accident, she met J5 at the airport. He was lying motionlessly. His entire body was cold and without any warmth. His life came to an abrupt end in his prime. When she covered J5 with the bright red flag, tears fell like a broken dam.","If... If J5 was lucky enough to be reborn like her, how good would that be?","There were tears at the corners of her eyes. Ye Jian raised her hand and wiped her tears. She looked at T6 who was lying on the bed motionlessly. Ye Jian smiled slightly. Her smile was like peach blossoms blooming in spring. It was so bright that it was intoxicating.","It was good. It was really good.","She was waiting for T6 to wake up. She was waiting for T6 to continue fighting alongside her and continue to share blessings and hardships.","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand to wipe her tears. He looked over and saw that her eyes were red. Xia Jinyuan pulled her into his arms. \"Why are you crying?\"","He asked gently.","\"I remembered some past events,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. \"I couldn’t help but cry. Later, I thought of some happy things and couldn’t help but laugh.\"","Sometimes, the two of them didn’t need to explain too much to understand each other’s thoughts. As soon as Ye Jian opened her mouth, Xia Jinyuan knew what she was thinking.","\"We’ll all be fine. We’ll all be fine...\" He tilted his head and lowered his head to kiss her hair.","There was nothing else to say. They would all be fine, but... who knew what would happen?","Sometimes, they couldn’t really be fine just because they said so.","In a modern war, there was a possibility of sacrifice on the battlefield every second. They, who had always lived in a rain of guns, wanted to be fine. But in reality, they were all prepared to sacrifice at any time.","As a member of the brigade, he was the same.","Ye Jian was the same too.","They would work hard. If they were really sacrificed, it would be worth it to have such a group of comrades."]},{"number":5346,"title":"Chapter 5346: This Man Is Scheming","paragraphs":["T6 woke up one and a half hours after he came out of the operating room. At that time, the two of them were leaning against each other on the couch. Even though they were secretly exchanging glances, they never looked away from T6. T6 was so small that even if he moved his fingers, the two of them would be able to notice him immediately.","Moreover, T6, who had woken up from the anesthesia, made a sound from his throat. Although he only grunted twice, it was enough for the two people who had been staring at him to hear it.","At the same time, he stood up and rushed forward. Xia Jinyuan stared at T6’s face and didn’t say anything. He waited for his comrade to open his eyes.","Ye Jian even held her breath. Perhaps T6 was about to wake up. She relaxed and whispered, \"Do you think he’ll lose his memory? His head was knocked on. There’s a possibility of him losing his memory. He might open his eyes and not recognize us.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"No, it’ll only be possible if he was severely injured. He was only hit once, and his skull wasn’t even injured. He won’t lose his memory.\"","\"That’s not necessarily true. If he was unlucky enough to be hit in the back of the head by a car part, he might also be unlucky enough to lose his memory,\" Ye Jian muttered softly while waiting for T6 to wake up. \"He might even hit his head and lose his ability to speak in the future.\"","Xia Jinyuan was rendered speechless. This time, he really didn’t know what to say.","After a few seconds, Xia Jinyuan said to Ye Jian, \"How much do you hope that he’ll lose his memory and not know how to speak? You’re thinking too much.\"","Ye Jian indeed seemed to be thinking too much. She smiled. \"It’s mainly because the process of him waking up is taking too long. I can’t help but think too much.\"","\"Then I’ll confirm it for you later,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a headache. It wasn’t good for his woman to think too much.","Ye Jian was afraid that he would really confirm it, so she hurriedly shook her head. \"No, no.\"","\"It’s better to confirm it. I’m a little worried.\"","\"Shall I ask later?\" Ye Jian replied carefully.","Xia Jinyuan nodded solemnly. They had to ask properly.","T6 hummed in his throat again, but he still didn’t open his eyes. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t wait anymore. He pinched T6’s throat. \"Brother, it’s time for you to wake up. Don’t f*cking scare me.","\"My baby said that you might lose your memory if you get hit by the back of your head. Open your eyes and see if you can recognize me.\"","His actions were violent and her tone was rough, but the worry in his voice was sincere.","Only Xia Jinyuan could do something so impressive and awesome like pinching someone while their consciousness was still recovering.","Ye Jian couldn’t bear to look at him. \"Stop pinching. If you continue, he’ll get new injuries.\"","\"His skin is thick. It’s not that tender. Since he can’t wake up, he needs to rely on some external strength.\" Xia Jinyuan pinched him again. Then, T6 finally won the anesthesia and opened his eyes with difficulty.","Before he was fully awake, Xia Jinyuan immediately retracted his hand and gently held T6’s hand. He said in a soft voice, \"I’m your captain. Can you hear me now? You haven’t lost your memory, right?\"","That voice was soft and gentle. Ye Jian felt goosebumps all over her body.","In order to hide his actions just now, Captain Xia played a trick.","How evil!","T6 opened his eyes with difficulty and blinked. He looked at Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, who were standing beside him. After a while, he cursed, \"Damn it, am I in the hospital?\"","After he finished speaking, he felt dizzy and even wanted to vomit. He blurted out, \"I’m not pregnant, right?\"","\"Tell me if you know us first,\" Xia Jinyuan asked. In order to reassure his girlfriend, he had to confirm that T6 had not lost his memory."]},{"number":5347,"title":"Chapter 5347: I’m Good","paragraphs":["T6 endured the urge to vomit and looked at Xia Jinyuan as if he were looking at an idiot. \"I was the one who got hit in the head, not you.\"","Xia Jinyuan actually asked him if he knew them?","Was his brain damaged?","\"He didn’t lose his memory.\" Xia Jinyuan turned his head and told Ye Jian. Then, he said, \"It’s good that you woke up. Can you talk normally?\"","’I’m sorry, brother. It’s not that I’m cursing you, but my girlfriend is too worried about you.’","The veins on T6’s forehead twitched a few times. He gritted his teeth and said in a hoarse voice, \"I’m doing well. I can speak, and I didn’t lose my memory. I just want to vomit. I’m probably pregnant with a fat boy.\"","F*ck, how much did they want him to lose his memory and lose his voice?","Xia Jinyuan turned to look at Ye Jian. \"Are you relieved? He just thinks that he’s pregnant with a fat boy.\"","Ye Jian, who was nodding fervently, replied quickly, \"I’m relieved.\"","With this confirmation, she could see the ferocity in T6’s eyes.","He wanted to vomit, felt dizzy, and had a slight concussion.","T6 wanted to kick his comrade out of his sight. \"Should I just get up and hit my head or something? Everyone expects me to lose my memory and my voice!\"","\"We’re concerned about you. Don’t look like you’re bearing a heavy burden.\" Xia Jinyuan glanced at him and signaled Ye Jian to take a look at the door.","They knew there had to be someone walking around outside after hearing their voices.","Ye Jian nodded. She pretended that she couldn’t help but cry when T6 woke up and ran to the door of the ward. The moment the door opened, a figure walked about a meter away.","Ye Jian rushed from the bedside to the door of the ward, and then opened the door to go out, but the figure had only walked away about one meter.","He must’ve been standing outside.","Ye Jian, who was covering her face and pretending to cry, sneered. Then, she did something that matched her current identity. She raised her leg and kicked the soft handrail on the wall as if she were venting.","Since she was causing damage to the hospital’s public facilities, she would have to pay for it.","Will had sent a suitcase full of money. It was enough to compensate!","As the man left, he heard the knocking sounds behind him. He turned his head secretly and looked over. In the end, he frowned.","If she didn’t enter the ward, he wouldn’t have a chance to get close.","In the ward, Xia Jinyuan asked in a low voice, \"How much do you remember about the attack? Did you see the person who attacked you?\"","T6’s throat was itchy, and he had a headache. \"Brother, can you pour me a glass of water first? I choked on smoke before. Talking to you now hurts like a knife.\"","Xia Jinyuan looked at him expressionlessly and got up to pour a glass of water.","T6 couldn’t get up. The hospital was very humane as they added a straw to the water cup used by patients. T6 drank most of the water with the straw. The pain in his throat was relieved, and his throat was moistened. He replied in a tight voice, \"I have a deep impression of it, but everything happened too suddenly at that time.","\"When V and B were talking, we slowed down. However, when we turned a corner, Alice said that she wanted to get out of the truck and settle her physiological needs. V parked the truck and saw Will and Noah getting out. He and I realized that something was wrong and quickly got out too.\"","A woman had to get out of the truck to solve her physiological needs. Was it normal for two men to get out of the truck with her?","That was too abnormal!","V8 and T6, who were in the truck, exchanged a look and immediately got out together."]},{"number":5348,"title":"Chapter 5348: Scheme Within Scheme","paragraphs":["T6, who was injured in the back of his head and had broken ribs, was lying on a special pillow. He suppressed the urge to vomit and told Xia Jinyuan how they were attacked. Ye Jian was still venting her emotions outside so that the people watching didn’t have a chance to get close.","T6, who had just woken up, didn’t look weak after being injured. His handsome face was filled with the tenacity of a soldier.","He controlled the pace of his words, and his emotions were very calm. This way, he could conserve his energy better. \"V8 used the excuse that he also needed to solve his physiological needs to get out of the truck. I wanted to keep an eye on them to see if they were up to any cheap tricks, so I waited a while before getting out.","\"As soon as I got out of the truck, I heard a very familiar sound. I didn’t think about anything and ran away. When I looked back, the cannonball had approached the car!","\"The left front wheel of the car was hit by a cannonball. Then, the car overturned. I was f*cking unlucky. The back of my head was hit, so I was half a beat slower. Then, I fainted from the shockwave. I vaguely saw a few men in black carrying Alice away.\"","In other words, the truck stopped because Alice mentioned that she needed to solve her physiological needs. A woman who had just escaped death should be filled with fear deep in her heart. Even if it was an emergency, she should only want to escape as soon as possible and not say that she wanted to get out of the truck...","Xia Jinyuan was deep in thought. \"Do you remember anything else?\"","\"No.\" T6 thought for a moment and felt that he shouldn’t have missed any other clues, but he wasn’t sure. \"I’m still a little confused. Let me think about it.\"","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the cup beside him, then picked it up and put the straw to T6’s mouth, \"Drink some water.\"","T6 took a few sips of water and closed his eyes to recall the situation. Suddenly, he opened his eyes and said in a low voice, \"Alice, I heard Alice’s voice at that time. Noah said something to her, but I couldn’t hear what she said. From her tone, I could tell that Alice was very angry, but...\"","T6 stopped talking again. He was injured in the head and had a slight concussion. As he recalled the situation, he felt more nauseous. The more he recalled, the more he wanted to vomit.","Xia Jinyuan could tell that he was uncomfortable. He immediately raised his hand and massaged his temples.","\"But she wasn’t afraid. That’s very strange.\" T6 finished speaking. His forehead was covered in sweat.","Xia Jinyuan narrowed his dark eyes. This was interesting.","Alice, who should have been so afraid, suggested getting out of the truck. Then, she wasn’t afraid when the truck was attacked. Instead, she was angry at Noah. In that case, could it be guessed that Alice actually knew Noah?","While Xia Jinyuan was thinking, Ye Jian, who was outside, finally stopped acting crazy. She called G3, who had returned to the hotel.","G3 had been waiting for T6 to wake up. When he saw Ye Jian’s call, he picked it up immediately. \"He’s awake? Is everything okay?\"","\"Yes, he just woke up. He’s in good condition. Besides a slight concussion, there’s nothing wrong. You don’t have to worry,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. Her voice was loud enough for the people hiding in the dark to hear. \"Have you reached the hotel? Don’t forget to save a room for us!\"","After she finished speaking loudly, she turned around and lowered her voice. \"There are people keeping an eye on the hospital.\"","G3 heaved a sigh of relief and said in a light-hearted tone, \"We can finally sleep. Tell T that he should give us half his pay for making us worry about him.\""]},{"number":5349,"title":"Chapter 5349: Complicated People","paragraphs":["G3, who was speaking briskly, was also being stared at by the people in the hotel. From the moment the three of them entered the hotel, their every move was watched by others. They couldn’t escape even in the suite.","Z7 sent a message and teased them. Did they install surveillance cameras in the bathroom so that they could be monitored from all angles? That was really possible.","G3 replied, \"We’re the same.\" Ye Jian immediately understood what he meant.","\"If you’re not afraid that he’ll fight you to death, you can raise your opinion.\" Ye Jian laughed. At the same time, the eavesdropper dialed a number and reported the situation in the hospital to Noah.","In the ward, Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes and said slowly, \"It looks like our guess is in the right direction. We didn’t find the wrong breakthrough point. We only missed a very important person.\"","He spoke in a low voice. When he finished speaking, his voice was as sharp as a blade.","They had thought of every detail, but they missed one person.","That was because this person was the victim and an important person they needed to save. How could they suspect her?","What role did Alice play in the entire incident?’","\"Have a good rest. It’ll take at least three days for your concussion to get better. I’ll give you a week off. We have time. There’s no hurry. Take your time.\"","Xia Jinyuan tucked in the corner of T6’s quilt and told him and Ye Jian’s previous guess. \"The hotel might be our breakthrough point. As for you, focus on recuperating. After you’re discharged from the hospital in a few days, your activities will only be within the hotel. Keep a close eye on the hotel, but be careful to hide well and don’t alert the enemy.\"","Outside, Ye Jian, who was on the phone, looked at the man who was still talking. She had no intention of going in. She knew that he was watching outside and that Xia Jinyuan was still talking. When T6 heard that his activities were limited to the hotel, he was anxious to say something.","Xia Jinyuan said calmly, \"You have to find the person who hurt you. As for me, I suggest you stop thinking about anything now. Take a good rest and try to recover and be discharged from the hospital as soon as possible. You should avenge yourself and feel better!","\"We need to keep a close eye on the hotel. We just happen to be short of someone who can’t leave the hotel at any time. Your injury happened just in time. I’ll leave the hotel matters to you. I’ll handle the outside matters. We should fight side by side. No one can do without the other.\"","T6 nodded when he heard this. He had used too much of his brain just now, so he was a little dizzy now. T6 slowly closed his eyes. The moment he closed his eyes, a hint of coldness flashed past them.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian also rested together. They had not slept all night. Now that T6 had woken up, the two of them could have a relaxing night’s sleep.","At night, the two of them still hadn’t returned to the hotel. G3 and the rest were keeping an eye on the hotel, and V8 was hidden in the dark. The two didn’t need to rush back to the hotel, so they simply accompanied T6 to the hospital for a quiet night.","The hospital was quiet in the early morning. When the first ray of light passed through the morning fog, Xia Jinyuan and the rest welcomed a warm morning.","Will arrived at the hospital early in the morning. First, he greeted T6 apologetically and took good care of him. T6 heard him chattering endlessly and wanted to chase him away.","Ye Jian chased him away impatiently. \"Hey, can you stop talking? He needs to rest!\"","Seeing that she was about to flare up again, Xia Jinyuan pulled Will out of the ward in time."]},{"number":5350,"title":"Chapter 5350: Play With You Until The End","paragraphs":["Standing at the end of the corridor, Xia Jinyuan took out a cigarette and passed it to Will. Then, he lit the cigarette on his mouth and took a deep breath. With a cold expression, he asked, \"48 hours have passed. Is there any news about what happened last night? What about Cyril? Did he do anything?\"","Will took the cigarette and took out his lighter to light it. He took a deep puff and slowly exhaled the smoke from his mouth.","\"There’s no news of our attack last night. Yesterday, I specially went to the location of the incident to take a look. The destroyed cars have already been cleared. Even the tarmac was rolled over again.","\"We raided his underground factory and rescued Alice, but nothing happened. The news of his drug factory’s destruction was even reported in the local newspaper. It can be said that all drug dealers in Molaban know that Cyril’s drug factory was destroyed by a group of people.","\"I heard that Cyril rushed to the underground factory the night before yesterday. He was so angry that he killed all the men in charge of guarding the factory last night. It’s said that he mobilized more than 50 people from other places. He said that even if he had to turn everything upside down, he would find the people who destroyed his underground factory the night before and hang them for everyone to see.","\"Q, time is tight and we’re in danger. Cyril is a ruthless bastard. He said that he’ll find us and continue investigating.","\"But you haven’t found Alice Cheng. You still need to stay here. Q, for your safety, I think you need to go and find my friend immediately and save her before you can leave Molaban.\"","Will’s words contained his own intent as well as Noah’s.","The eavesdropper saw that Will was obedient and cooperative, so he sent a message to Noah on his cell phone.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t express his stance on the spot. Will, who was afraid that the plan wouldn’t work, was so nervous that he took a puff of his cigarette. \"Q, you can’t go back on your word. You’re a mercenary. The work you do is equally dangerous. The fees I offer are high enough because I believe in your ability.","\"If you don’t act now, it’ll be disadvantageous to you if Cyril finds any clues!\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything else. He looked at the people coming and going in the hospital corridor and smoked quietly. No one knew what he was thinking. When the last bit burned out, Xia Jinyuan said calmly, \"Mr. Will, you’re right. We’ve been doing the most dangerous work. I can promise you to save your friend, but...\"","Greed appeared in his eyes. \"We’ll raise our fees by half again. I think we’ll work harder to rescue your friend if you agree to that.\"","\"Okay, no problem. Money is not a problem!\" Will was afraid that he would go back on his word, so he immediately nodded and agreed. He even said, \"I can pay you half of the fees immediately. Wait for me. I’ll withdraw the money immediately!\"","After he finished speaking, he quickly turned around and left.","Money, money, money. These mercenaries needed money, so he would give it to them. As long as he, his family, and Alice were fine, he would agree to all the conditions of these mercenaries!","Xia Jinyuan stood at the same spot and looked at Will’s back. He extinguished the cigarette in his hand and walked back to the ward.","Since Will was so anxious, he naturally had to cooperate.","Will, who was leaving in front, was suddenly pulled into a ward at lightning speed."]},{"number":5351,"title":"Chapter 5351: Invasion","paragraphs":["Will, who was suddenly pulled back, struggled instinctively. Suddenly, he thought of something. He raised his hand and struggled, but he was too weak to put his arm down. He allowed himself to be pulled into the ward.","The person who entered the ward was a man in a hospital gown and a disposable mask. When he pulled Will in, he pulled down the mask that hid his true face. He stared at Will with his deep eyes that were unique to Westerners. \"How did he answer you?\"","\"They’ll rescue my friend. Now, I need to go to the bank and take out half of the fees to give to them!\" Will’s tone was very cold. \"They’re a group of people who will do anything for money. I just said that I’ll immediately hand them half the fees and asked them to wait for me at the hospital.","\"I’ve already deceived them. Are you sure you want to continue delaying my time? If they regret it, please communicate with them yourself!\"","Alice was in the hands of these guys, and they still needed to keep Alice to lure out the people they wanted to lure out. He believed that his friend would be fine for the time being. He, who had been bullied and had not ensured his negotiating advantage, could finally vent his dissatisfaction.","Will crossed his arms and looked at the Western man who stayed in the hospital to monitor the mercenaries with a cold expression.","The man didn’t expect Will, who had been unable to raise his head in front of them, to suddenly talk back. He was a little unaccustomed to it and was stunned for a moment. He reprimanded in a cold tone, \"Mr. Will, please pay attention to your tone! If you anger us, you won’t have a good ending.","\"Also, think about your friend, Alice. She’s your childhood friend. She even secretly used all her family’s savings to help you tide over your difficulties. She helped you so generously. Do you want her to die for you?\"","Hearing Alice’s name being mentioned, Will felt as if someone was grabbing his life. His facial features twisted violently. \"Really? Isn’t this the time when you need Alice Cheng the most?","\"You need to use her to lure out the people you want to lure out. If Alice dies, your plan will fail. Haha, will you be able to report back?\"","His gaze turned extremely ferocious. He had had enough! Ever since this group of damned fellows appeared, his life had become extremely bad!","His wife, daughter, and son were being monitored by surveillance cameras. Even if his son said something to his schoolmates, they would know!","His company was invaded by these damned people, and his personal life was completely controlled by them. Now... Damn it! Damn it! Now, he was like an invisible person. He didn’t have any privacy in front of these bastards! No privacy at all!","And his best friend, Alice, had been caught and was being used by them.","Damn these bastards! When would these damned bastards get lost?!","Why were they using Alice?","Who were they?","Why did they catch Alice? Was it because of Alice’s husband? Who did they want to lure out through Alice?","These people had suddenly appeared in his life. Now, they were everywhere. They were like dust in the air. He knew that they existed, but he couldn’t chase them away. He could only watch as they invaded his life.","Perhaps Will’s words had touched the man’s nerves. The man, whose eyes were instantly filled with killing intent, suddenly made a move and grabbed Will’s neck fiercely. His expression was especially fierce. \"Watch your mouth. There are some things you shouldn’t say because it’ll kill you.\""]},{"number":5352,"title":"Chapter 5352: Pain","paragraphs":["Will, who was suddenly strangled, was surprisingly calm. He was already used to such threats.","What hadn’t he experienced in Molaban?","Someone had pointed a gun at his head, chased him with a gun, and even locked him up with only one sip of water every day. Haha, he had experienced everything!","It was all because of these people!","Will, who was very calm, looked at the guy who was threatening him with cold eyes. He was sure that these bastards wouldn’t kill him now.","Will’s gaze made the Western man, who was pretending to be a patient, furious. He grabbed Will’s neck forcefully until Will’s eyes started rolling up. When he saw Will starting to struggle with all his might, the man’s face revealed a hint of satisfaction.","\"Remember, don’t provoke us. Don’t say anything in front of those mercenaries! If not...\"","Will, who was struggling, grabbed the man’s hand tightly. He forced his voice out of his throat with difficulty. \"What... can you do now... besides... threatening... me?!","\"What do you want? What do you want...\"","The Western man let go, and Will’s neck was freed. Will, who was coughing heavily, heard him say coldly, \"You can only cooperate with us. Only by cooperating with us will you survive. Your wife, daughter, and son will survive too.","\"Did you know? Yesterday, the new dance teacher from the school praised your daughter. Mr. Will, you should be happy that your daughter was praised.\"","Will, whose gaze turned even more ferocious, was so angry that his entire body trembled. He felt as if he was wearing thin clothes and standing in the cold Siberian wind. His entire body was cold.","\"You... You...\"","\"I’m taking up your time. Alright, you can go to the bank now to get the money and satisfy the mercenaries’ request.\" Seeing that Will was overcome with fear, the Western man was finally satisfied. He opened the ward door voluntarily. \"Please, Mr. Will.\"","Will was so distraught that he didn’t know how he left the ward. He only knew that this group of people was so powerful that they even planted teachers in his daughter’s school.","Who were they?","Who were they?","What was she trying to do?","What were they trying to do?","From the moment these people appeared, Will had been wondering who they were and why they were here. He wondered if they were here for Alice’s husband.","Alice was kidnapped when she brought her child to Molaban for a holiday. Hence, he kept contacting Alice’s husband. Unfortunately, he couldn’t contact him because Alice’s husband’s profession was very special. Even as his wife, she couldn’t contact him. As a friend, he couldn’t contact him either.","Alice was kidnapped, but he couldn’t contact her husband. As a friend, he had to think of a way himself. The bodyguard he hired, Noah, suggested that he could contact mercenaries...","Everything started to change here.","Noah was no longer his bodyguard, his life was no longer peaceful, and everything was in chaos.","It was so chaotic that even his daughter, who was in school, wasn’t safe. The teachers who took care of his daughter were all planted by them...","Will, who was sitting in the car, covered his face with his hands. Tears of pain and helplessness flowed out.","He really felt that he had no one to rely on other than the mercenaries he hired. If those damned fellows threatened him again..."]},{"number":5353,"title":"Chapter 5353: Luxury Days","paragraphs":["Will, who was covering his face and crying, had a twisted facial expression. Crazy hatred appeared in his eyes. He would definitely pay those powerful mercenaries to kill these guys!","He would definitely do it. He would definitely do it!","The black car drove away from the hospital and headed straight for the bank. The driver glanced at his boss through the rearview mirror and immediately tightened his grip on the steering wheel.","His boss... seemed to be crying?","In the hospital, Ye Jian sat at the door of the ward and played with a standalone game console that she got from somewhere. From time to time, she would curse. The sound of the game made the Western man who was pretending to be a patient get a headache.","Why did this woman like to play games? Why was she sitting at the door of the ward to play games?","He took out a small black metal object from his pocket. The Western man’s expression turned serious. The wiretap had always been in his hands. He hadn’t found a chance to put it in the ward.","He had to put it in the ward as soon as possible.","Listening to the sounds of the game, the Western man sat back on the bed and started thinking of a way. The ward door opened, and a doctor in a white coat came in. The ward door closed again, shutting off all sound.","Ye Jian, who was playing games outside, looked ahead. She retracted her gaze indifferently and continued her job—disrupting vision and standing guard.","In the past few days, she had completely split apart her old self and rebuilt a new version of herself. Even Captain Xia said he no longer recognized her.","She didn’t want this to happen either! But he was the one who arranged such a character for her.","However, it was easier to do things because of this character. There would never be any problems with Captain Xia’s strategic arrangements.","In the ward, Xia Jinyuan was talking to T6, who was getting better. \"The situation outside is quite unfavorable to us right now. I’m worried that Cyril will follow up on the attack on you yesterday and come to the hospital. So, if it’s nothing serious, you’ll be discharged from the hospital tomorrow. Get some medical supplies from the infirmary and then return to the hotel to meet up with G, Z, and K.\"","They were all special forces soldiers on the frontline of combat. As long as they didn’t die, all their injuries were considered minor. As long as they could still move, they would move.","Hearing this, T6, who had a serious and cold expression, raised his right hand and pulled out the needle that was transmitting liquid.","He sat up slowly. \"I know my body best. This injury is nothing. Even if you hadn’t told me, I was planning to be discharged today.\"","There was no reason for him to stay in the hospital and enjoy himself while his comrades charged in front.","\"K is still in the hotel, right? He’s a talent in this area. He’ll take care of the necessary medicine. Go and settle the discharge procedures now. I’ve been wanting to be discharged for a long time! Lying down, sleeping, and not working—such days are too decadent. It’s not suitable for me.\"","He moved too quickly and had already pulled out the needle. Xia Jinyuan, who was planning to have him be discharged tomorrow, stared at the needle that was still dripping with medicine. Then, he raised his head and looked at the IV drip. \"Couldn’t you pull it out after you were done?\"","T6, who was holding the needle and pressing the needle hole on the back of his hand, looked up and saw that on the hook where the IV bottle was hung, there was one bottle currently being infused and two new bottles waiting to be infused.","Xia Jinyuan patted T6’s shoulder and shook his head speechlessly.","T6 did not know what to say. Damn, he seemed to have been treated as an idiot by the captain again! He just wanted to show his determination and was a little impulsive!","\"Lie down. I’ll get a nurse.\" Seeing that he was still in a daze, Xia Jinyuan reached out and pushed his chest lightly. T6 lay back obediently."]},{"number":5354,"title":"Chapter 5354 - 5355: Stop Kissing!","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was still outside playing games when Xia Jinyuan emerged from the sliding door, just in time to hear his usually civilized girlfriend swear, something akin to the Chinese \"Damn it!\"","Xia Jinyuan: \"...\"","The door opened halfway, and Lieutenant Colonel Xia paused in his movement, wiping his face before swinging the door fully open and stepping out.","For the entire mission, to keep the hospital snitches at bay, and to make her character and temperament more vivid and three-dimensional, his girl really put in the effort.","She performed so convincingly that he believed her.","Good, very strong.","Ye Jian looked up at the man coming out and stood up, \"Done?\"","\"He pulled out his IV. I’m going to find a nurse. You go check on that idiot,\" Xia Jinyuan leaned in, kissing Ye Jian naturally, \"We’re being discharged this afternoon, and we’ve got a scene to perform.\"","After the kiss, the conversation was over.","Ye Jian tiptoed and landed a kiss on his clean-shaven jaw, \"That was quick. Why not stay a few more days?\"","\"The situation outside has changed; we need to be preemptive. At the hotel, we have Noah’s people. If we run into Cyril’s people, we have backup. But in the hospital, if we encounter Cyril’s people, it’s just the three of us against them, which is a disadvantage.\"","Knowing that Cyril was actively searching for someone, Xia Jinyuan had thought of using Noah’s hand for protection, and a hotel, such a good place, shouldn’t go to waste.","With a barely concealed smirk, Ye Jian’s lips curved slightly, \"Alright, I got it. Go do what you need to.\"","The two exchanged kisses at the entrance to the open hospital room—one went off to find a nurse, the other headed into the ward.","T6 lay on the bed, expressionless, a silent spectator to the whole scene.","Ha, he was a married man; their display of affection in front of him wasn’t going to get a rise out of him.","Damn!","He missed his wife!","Seeing the expressionless T6, Ye Jian knew exactly what he was thinking and coughed awkwardly, convincing herself that their kisses were purely for communication purposes!","After mentally reassuring herself several times, Ye Jian, with her thin face finally not feeling so hot, sat beside the bed and spoke softly, \"Are you sure you’re okay? Now is not the time to be stubborn and reckless.\"","T6, who continued to be expressionless, replied, \"I’m lying here, sleeping, and every day I see you two acting lovey-dovey. If I don’t get discharged, I’m going to have a heart attack.\"","\"Here, let me prove I can be discharged. Don’t help me,\" T6 said, as he propped himself up with his arms, a slow but smooth action.","Ye Jian felt somewhat reassured.","The main issue was T6’s broken ribs. The wound on the back of his head wasn’t as serious; it wasn’t even bandaged, just covered with a square gauze pad taped down, invisible from the front.","T6 didn’t immediately stand up after placing his feet on the floor, but instead took a moment to catch his breath before rising.","Having not left the bed for two days, the sensation of his feet hitting the floor excited T6 so much that he nearly stumbled as if he was about to fall.","Quick to react, Ye Jian’s heart skipped a beat as she promptly steadied him. It was a good thing she was prepared, or else if he had fallen, his ribs would have been in trouble again.","\"Pretending! Keep on pretending! You can’t even stand properly, and you still want to be discharged?\" Ye Jian feigned anger, \"Do you want to hurt yourself again? Turn a minor injury into a serious one?\"","The excited T6 felt even more like crying, \"I’m really not being reckless. It’s excitement, really, no lies! Come on, let go of me, I’ll walk and show you!\"","Ye Jian was half-convinced, but also considering the situation outside, she slowly released her grip, \"Stand firm, I’m letting go now. If you can walk, then walk, but absolutely do not force yourself.\"","She cautioned him again and again, ready to support him at any moment."]},{"number":5355,"title":"Chapter 5355 - 5356: They Who Always Move Forward (New Year Monthly Ticket Go)","paragraphs":["T6’s injuries were all on the upper body, so as long as he walked at a slower pace, there wouldn’t be a problem. He was well aware of his condition and knew walking was definitely possible, but the speed shouldn’t be too fast.","After walking slowly for a few steps and then turning a circle in the hospital room, he looked good—his steps were steady, complexion normal, breathing stable. Everything indicated that he was indeed able to get out of bed and walk, meaning he could be discharged.","For them, being able to walk was the criterion for discharge.","Being injured and spending days in the hospital just eating and sleeping was too luxurious for them. As long as they could stand up and walk, there would be no problems whatsoever.","Outside the ward, a patient wearing a mask walked by. He seemed to casually turn his head for a glance inside the room, gripping the listening device in his palm as he passed by the ward again.","A cold look flashed through Ye Jian’s eyes as she kept watch on the outside from the corners of her eyes.","After walking around, T6 didn’t overexert himself. He sat back on the bed and told Ye Jian, who was worried about him, with a solemn face, \"We are brothers who would trade lives for each other. The situation is complicated now, and I don’t want to drag you all down because of my injuries, nor do I want to waste time together idly.\"","Ye Jian didn’t say anything more. To her comrades with whom she’d trade lives, if she had been in T6’s place, she would have made the same choice, \"Mhm, I got it. You should get some rest.\"","She helped T6 lie back down slowly, glanced at the unfinished IV drip, and couldn’t help but smirk, \"You’re still as impulsive as before, not even checking if the IV is finished before you pull out the needle.\"","Assisting K7 to sit down on the bed, she said, \"The flies outside are pretty annoying. I might as well leave the door open, let them have their fill of looking.\"","All the necessary talking and planning had been done; let them look however they wanted.","T6 was always someone who enjoyed watching the excitement and didn’t mind the trouble, so hearing this, he said cheerfully, \"Why don’t we play a trick on him?\"","\"No tricks,\" Ye Jian smiled as she declined, \"Let’s not have any unnecessary complications.\"","Having said that, she brazenly opened the ward door.","Before even getting back to the bed, she heard her man’s voice get louder as he walked towards the room, clearly speaking on purpose for the guy still roaming the hallway to hear.","\"Discharged this afternoon. You guys wait for us quietly at the hotel. That’s right! I’m sick of the hospital. Once we’re at the hotel, we can even drink together!\"","The patrolling whistle heard this and loosened the grip in his pocket.","Discharged and heading to a hotel?","A look of joy crossed his face as he coughed quietly, leaning on the handrails and shuffling step by step past Xia Jinyuan.","This bunch had had enough of the hospital, and so had he.","T6 looked at Xia Jinyuan walking in and then at the hefty item in his hands, and the corners of his mouth twitched fiercely.","A wheelchair!","He’d brought in a wheelchair!","Ye Jian turned her head, trying to hide the uncontainable laughter on her face from the grimacing T6.","Xia Jinyuan replied nonchalantly, \"It’s a good thing; I’m sure you won’t refuse it. Of course, you can’t refuse it because it’s not ’borrowed’—I just bought it from the hospital.\"","The nurse who came in with him was a local Molaban girl with brown-black hair and high cheekbones, and she was quite beautiful.","T6, his mouth twitching, glared at Xia Jinyuan. The next second, he wolf-whistled at the nurse, \"Hey beautiful, we meet again.\"","The attractive nurse raised an eyebrow, \"Yes, we meet again. But I think you’ll be leaving soon, so get discharged quickly!\"","It was everything but saying \"get out\" of the hospital.","Feigning regret, T6 sighed deeply, \"Ah, I didn’t expect to be discharged so soon. Beautiful, let’s exchange numbers, and we can keep in touch by phone later on.\""]},{"number":5356,"title":"Chapter 5356 - 5357: Disguise","paragraphs":["T6’s manner of speaking mimicked that of a street thug flirting with a respectable woman, there was no flaw in his gaze, tone, or demeanor.","Due to the unique nature of their assignments, the Special Forces of the Snow Region Brigade had to master role-playing, which to them was a form of disguise.","In this mission, T6 played a jester who loved to provoke women and was generous with them. It was a flaw, one that made people disdain him from the bottom of their hearts and unconsciously let down their guard.","It could be said that the characters played by each person in the Snow Region Brigade had different flaws, and it was these flaws that effectively disguised them all, deceiving the watchers hidden in the shadows, thus protecting themselves.","The open door of the hospital room exposed all of T6’s flirting with the nurse, and a \"patient\" walking outside flashed a look of disgust, retreating to his own room along the wall.","The beautiful nurse who was harassed by T6 during each dressing change kept a smiling face and just pricked him a couple of more times while reinserting the needle. Before leaving with the medical tray, she said an English word to T6.","The translation of which was \"Scram.\"","Ye Jian burst out with a heartless \"Ha ha\" laughter, and Xia Jinyuan cheerfully egged him on, \"Go on, buddy, show your skills and get her. If charm doesn’t work, you can always use money.\"","\"Mr. Will is quite sincere, he even paid half of the next commission in advance. Buddy, you have a lot of money to splurge now.\"","The laughter from the hospital bed grew louder, while a Western man in the nearby room relayed the latest news he had just learned to Noah.","Upon hearing it, Noah couldn’t help but reveal a self-assured smile, confident that everything was under their control. They would head back to their hotel, which made it even more convenient to monitor their every move.","That afternoon, K7 rushed to the hospital, ostensibly to discharge T6, but in reality, he meticulously checked all the essentials prescribed by the hospital. Bearing in mind that T6 wouldn’t stay put easily and, given the circumstances, wasn’t allowed to either, he spent a bit of money to secretly enlist the doctor’s help and procured some additional medicines like anti-inflammatories and hemostats.","Xia Jinyuan wheeled the wheelchair to the bedside, and amidst gritted teeth, T6, with \"trembling\" arms and legs, sat down on the wheelchair. Soon after, K7 walked in with bags of medicines. Before he even reached the bed, Xia Jinyuan waved his hand and said, \"All the procedures are completed, take the medications, let’s check out!\"","After a two-day hospital stay, T6, facing the setting sun, wheeled out of the hospital. Later, after their mission and back in their country, he boasted to his comrades, \"The biggest damn thing I ever did in my life was having Queen Q push my wheelchair.\"","He kept bragging about it for many, many years after he had retired, pointing to Xia Jinyuan, who by then had become a lieutenant general frequently appearing on state military news channels, telling his son, \"See that, that’s General Xia, he once pushed my wheelchair!\"","His son of course believed his dad since he had seen a photo of his father serving as a soldier alongside General Xia from back then.","More importantly, he had recently shaken hands with General Xia in the military and asked about his father, who spent his days unsuccessfully tending to plants at home, and reminded him to remember to bring his dad to the capital city when he was free.","At that time, T6 didn’t realize that Xia Jinyuan pushing his wheelchair would turn into the highest caliber story he’d boast about later. Meanwhile, T6 sat in the wheelchair, disdaining it utterly.","\"Damn it, making me look like a cripple. The first thing I’ll do when I get back is smash it!\" He grumbled all the way to the car."]},{"number":5357,"title":"Chapter 5357 - 5358: First Update of the New Year, Asking for Monthly Votes!","paragraphs":["Ye Jian laughed so much her stomach hurt as she sat in a wheelchair, feeling it as a stain on his life.","Because, nearly every comrade from the Snow Region Brigade had been hospitalized, but none had ever left the hospital in a wheelchair as T6 did, which is why T6 \"hated it to the bone.\"","Hold on, comrade!","When bearing humiliation and burden, one must endure, never to fall short at the last moment.","Pushing the wheelchair, Xia Jinyuan’s forehead veins nearly burst from holding back his anger. Just as they exited the hospital building, there was a downward slope. As T6 kept complaining about smashing the wheelchair, an increasingly intolerant Xia Jinyuan coldly threatened, \"If you keep spouting nonsense, I’ll let you slide down this path right now.\"","After saying that, he really let go.","The wheelchair truly started to slide forward, and T6 shouted loudly. Xia Jinyuan quickly grabbed the wheelchair’s armrest. With such a \"threat,\" T6 finally kept quiet and said no more.","Meanwhile, K7, fiddling with medication, walked alongside, keeping a watchful eye on their surroundings.","Upon leaving the hospital, they immediately hailed a taxi. Mr. Will, who had delivered half of the payment that morning, knew of T6’s discharge in the afternoon and promptly offered to have a special car pick him up, but Xia Jinyuan declined.","The group of four took just one taxi directly to the hotel.","The cab driver was a very talkative man from Molaban. As the car passed a street, he looked around and chatted with the passengers, \"You guys are tourists, right? You should be a little careful around here. There’s a powerful person in this area; his factory was sabotaged, and now his people are everywhere.\"","\"There was a shootout just this noon, and it was on the outskirts. It has made everyone very cautious and worried about troubles.\"","Continuing, the driver sighed deeply, \"In our country, drug prohibition is truly challenging. They dare to kill even the police and the mayor; our government simply cannot stop them.\"","After speaking, he suddenly turned his head to look at the passengers who just boarded the car, only giving an address and speaking simple English about their destination, then shrugged and chuckled to himself, \"You probably didn’t understand a word I just said, heh, I dare to speak only in front of you.\"","T6 grinned, sorry brother, he understood it all.","Thus, he translated it into English for his comrades in the car. Ye Jian was silent for a while before speaking up in English, \"In countries where drug prohibition is difficult, they are also those where the most citizens are murdered by drug dealers.\"","\"Walking on the street, anyone could be shot in the head. Entering a supermarket, you might suddenly experience a knife piercing through your back and chest, and some are even more brutal — their heads are chopped off, wrapped in white plastic, and hung at the doors of the victims’ houses.\"","\"Talking about drug prohibition in Molaban is akin to making a date with death.\"","This country is swamped with drugs and firearms. Some public officials even exploit their positions to ease the way for drug dealers and even act as informers. Anytime there is an anti-drug operation, the drug dealers are immediately informed. Their madness runs so deep that they devise plans within plans, reversing the situation to ultimately gun down the very police who came to enforce the drug laws.","The malign power in Molaban has reached such heights that those who dare to speak about drug prohibition can easily be killed.","When the car arrived at the hotel, the sun had completely withdrawn its last rays, with dusk thickening, casting a grayish-blue glow over the city that was about to embrace the night.","The hotel was luxurious, with expensive crystal lamps emitting dazzling light, making the whole lobby glittering and radiant. Yet, the hotel wasn’t very large, certainly not comparable to the ultra-five-star hotels back in their home country, consisting of a four-story lobby and club at the front, and a hotel garden at the back. The semi-circular hotel enveloped the garden, complemented by the garden at the front, rendering the entire hotel’s design a circular layout.","It was also a layout very convenient for surveillance."]},{"number":5358,"title":"Chapter 5358 - 5359: What Happened to the Comradeship?","paragraphs":["G3 and Z7 were waiting at the hotel entrance early on, with Ye Jian being the first to get off the car, followed by Xia Jinyuan, and then K7.","After getting out of the car, Xia Jinyuan opened the trunk of the taxi and took out the folded wheelchair, pushing it to stand before the two comrades who were helping T6 out of the car.","T6, once again swallowing his pride, settled into the wheelchair, to the boisterous laughter of G3 and Z7, who erupted with a \"haha\".","T6 felt that the bond with his comrades had reached its end.","This time G3 took over pushing the wheelchair. After taking charge, he whispered something into T6’s ear, which left T6 twisting his face into a foolish grin.","G3 said, \"Brother, welcome back to the squad!\"","Z7 and White Crane extended their hands and shook T6’s hand briefly, then patted his shoulder. No words were necessary; everything was understood. Sometimes, it’s just one action or one phrase that says it all.","V8 was absent. Xia Jinyuan informed Mr. Will that V8 had gone out to scout the situation, thereby Noah also knew that one of the mercenaries had not returned.","The group of seven moving from the hotel entrance to the elevator was closely surveilled by Noah, who saw everything clearly. They all entered Z7’s room; with eight people across four rooms, only Z7 and T6’s room was the safest, secured technically by Z7. Noah could see them enter the room and even their precise positions within. But what he was watching were scenes dynamically processed by Z7 based on the real footage.","K7 carefully placed the medical supplies he brought back from the hospital on the living room table, glanced in the direction where T6 was seated, and silently went to stand by his comrade, which was also captured in Noah’s view.","Next, Noah watched as the eight mercenaries decided to celebrate with drinks—red wine, champagne, whiskey—they had it all. Eventually, all seven, including the injured T6, drank and swayed drunkenly.","After two hours of vigilance, Noah massaged his brow and instructed those around him, \"Keep a close watch on them; tell me when they wake up.\"","A gaggle of drunkards, an utter headache for him to behold.","With the scene frozen there, Xia Jinyuan pulled out a tissue to wipe off some spilled drink from his body and inquired of his comrades left in the hotel, \"Any movement from those targets here at the hotel?\"","Z7 spread his hands and said, \"Nothing! These guys are on high alert. I’ve been observing them for several days and haven’t seen them slip up once.\"","Hearing Z7’s response, Xia Jinyuan simply remarked, \"We’ll wait. The more careful they are, the more significant their issue is. Our main task now is to keep them under strict surveillance.\"","He then relayed the intelligence Mr. Will had brought about the situation outside to his comrades, causing the faces of G3 and the others to darken. Xia Jinyuan hadn’t specified over the phone why T6 had been discharged. Only now they realized how complex the external situation was, and how brazen Cyril had become.","\"Molaban’s criminal underworld is infamous worldwide. If the government makes a move on the first day of the month, they’d dare go further on the tenth or the fifteenth. If the government touches them a little, they’d dare to retaliate tenfold,\" T6 shared what he had learned from the taxi driver, adding, \"Cyril is one of Molaban’s notorious figures, and I have no doubt about his ability to trace us.\"","\"Staying in the hospital was safer; moving back to the hotel with Noah’s men around was even safer.\"","Z7 frowned, \"If Cyril really does trace us, Noah can choose to be a spectator without having to intervene.\""]},{"number":5359,"title":"Chapter 5359 - 5360: Overall Control","paragraphs":["Z7 pointed out the critical issue, and G3, T6, K7, and White Crane all turned their gaze toward Xia Jinyuan, also glancing at Ye Jian. Their instincts told them that the two of them must have already come up with countermeasures for the key points raised by Z7.","King Q had full control over the overall strategy of combat, while Azure Bird was meticulous to the extreme, capable of considering details that King Q might have overlooked. The two of them working together created seamless operations plans that often didn’t need any input from their comrades.","Understanding each other too well, Xia Jinyuan smiled at Ye Jian, gesturing for her to come forward and speak.","With a smile on her face, Ye Jian began, \"So, we also need to let Cyril know that we are in contact with Mr. Will and are aware of Noah’s existence. As for how to let Cyril know about Noah, we can use Mr. Will’s help.\" She slowly revealed the plan she and Xia Jinyuan had discussed, \"We have discovered that Mr. Will does not trust Noah; in fact, he could be described as detesting him.\"","\"We can use this to our advantage, pulling Mr. Will to our side and then collaborating with him. Of course, before cooperating with Mr. Will, we first have to let him know that we’re at odds with Noah’s people.\"","Otherwise, what reason would Mr. Will have to believe that we would help eliminate Noah?","Besides, we need to rescue Alice Cheng, who may fall into Noah’s hands. Certainly, Mr. Will would be delighted to see Noah taken down through us.","As the plan was laid out, the comrades all nodded in agreement. Indeed, this was a perfect ploy for a double-cross!","\"Which side does Noah represent, exactly?\" T6 asked. He had missed some of the discussions due to being unconscious and, suffering from a slight concussion, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian had not told him about the few points his comrades had guessed while he was in surgery.","This included which side Noah represented.","\"Noah is a soldier, so there’s a ninety percent chance he’s with the country that is imprisoning the scientists.\" Xia Jinyuan said indifferently: \"Based on the fact that T6 heard Alice Cheng’s voice without fear but anger before he lost consciousness and was abducted again, I suspect that Alice Cheng is familiar with Noah.\"","In order to show the surveillance team that he was drinking, and actually getting drunk, Xia Jinyuan had indeed consumed a few drinks. Now, slightly affected by the alcohol, his jade-like handsome face was tinged with a trace of flush, making his already beautiful appearance even more stunning than a woman’s.","He was beautiful indeed, with an expression that was not very pleasant, his brows exuding a chill that made it clear that despite his good looks, people didn’t dare to stare at him for too long.","Ye Jian silently twisted open a bottle of mineral water provided by the hotel and quietly drank most of it. Others might have been scared off by the cool sharpness in his brows, but she, his girlfriend, was not afraid, and therefore, accidentally got zapped by his good looks once again.","After drinking half a bottle of water, Ye Jian listened as he continued the discussion. Xia Jinyuan did not notice Ye Jian’s brief lapse in composure as he expressed his suspicions and linked all the clues, sharing them with everyone present.","\"I suspect that Alice Cheng herself is a decoy. How could she escape from that country’s surveillance to Melbourne with her son? It’s unlikely she has that much ability, especially since it was their own agents keeping watch over her. How could they possibly let her escape with the child?\"","Having said only the introduction, everyone felt a chill run through them.","Yes, that was the biggest question!","\"If she doesn’t have that level of ability, then there’s only one assumption: that the country intentionally let her go and arranged for her to come to Melbourne.\"","Huh? They let her come to Melbourne on purpose?","That was somewhat unclear. Ye Jian also slightly furrowed her brows."]},{"number":5360,"title":"Chapter 5360 - 5361: Overwhelming in Intelligence","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan had worked out some clues but hadn’t shared them with Ye Jian because he was still refining his thoughts. It wasn’t until he heard the cab driver talk about the chaos in Molaban, where criminal forces boldly opposed the government, that several previously disconnected leads in his mind clicked into place.","\"Molaban is chaotic and anything is possible there, but it’s not as chaotic as a war-torn country. There is some order amid chaos. Plus, with Alice Cheng’s good friend Mr. Will in Molaban, sending her there turned out to be the best choice.\"","\"You must be wondering why Molaban is considered the best choice.\"","His comrades nodded. T6’s eyes shone with a childlike eagerness to learn, while Ye Jian appeared pensive. Why, indeed?","The main reason was the \"chaos\".","\"In a country overrun with firearms and rampant with evil forces, even if some external authorities intervene, they wouldn’t draw attention. For example, if Noah’s group enters Molaban and one day they suddenly pull out guns, it certainly wouldn’t make headlines there. For instance, the country that needs to rescue the scientist’s wife and son would surely intervene secretly, hoping to secure the scientist’s undivided loyalty by rescuing his family without much fanfare, possibly under disguise.\"","Then, everyone understood!","Exactly!","Molaban was the perfect place for shooting and kidnapping!","\"Now that Noah’s identity is essentially confirmed, it makes it easier to direct Cyril’s attention onto Noah, leading him to believe that Noah’s men are sabotaging his underground factory. And we appear as Noah’s people,\" G3 said with a smile on his face, slowly explaining, \"So, how does Cyril come to think we are Noah’s men? That will require Mr. Will’s involvement.\"","\"Exactly.\" Xia Jinyuan, with a faint cold smile, glanced towards a hidden probe in the room, his smile growing colder, \"Using Alice Cheng lured us into the trap, also indicating that the country detaining the scientist is unsure whether our country is aware of this situation.\"","\"Moreover, they are quite confident in their own strength, believing that if their people confront ours in Molaban, their country’s forces will undoubtedly triumph, and our country will face a massive defeat.\"","\"If our country loses badly, they can immediately inform the detained scientist that a country unable to rescue even his own wife and children isn’t worth serving. Internationally, they could then use this as leverage to restrain our country’s rise. Keep in mind, this country has always been wary of our country’s rise.\"","With that, the entire strategy was clear!","Now fully enlightened, Ye Jian raised her hand and said, \"Excuse me, I’d like to add two points regarding Alice Cheng.\"","Xia Jinyuan raised an eyebrow, indicating for her to continue.","There were indeed significant doubts about Alice Cheng’s situation, and his Little Fox had probably already guessed them.","\"Regarding why Alice Cheng would comply with that country’s arrangement, I suspect two reasons,\" Ye Jian spoke calmly, her thoughts clear, \"First, she might be cooperating because of her child, and second, she herself could be an undercover agent planted by that country beside the scientist. The scientist had not told anyone about his desire to return to his homeland, only mentioning to his wife about going on a vacation. Considering the scientist hadn’t taken his family on a vacation for six years and, suddenly after the success of his project, mentioned traveling, his wife became suspicious and reported it to her superiors, which led to the scientist being detained the night before their departure.\""]},{"number":5361,"title":"Chapter 5361 - 5362: The Tacit Understanding Between Comrades","paragraphs":["Combining what Xia Jinyuan had said with her own suspicions, Ye Jian was able to articulate her thoughts as she just had.","T6 wiped his face and turned to look at Z7, \"Brother, is there a surveillance camera in the restroom?\"","\"No, there’s not a problem.\" Z7 thought he needed to use the restroom, \"Do you need help getting up?\" He stepped forward to help him stand.","\"No, don’t need it.\" T6 declined, he just needed to splash some water on his face to wake himself up.","With the same brain, why was there such a big difference?","In the future, his and An Jiaxin’s kids must hang out with the children of Q King and Azure Bird, ’near ink black, near red vermilion,’ they should be able to catch some smarts!","T6 slowly got up and washed his face in the restroom, then slowly sat back down, just when everyone was about ready to disperse.","Z7 sent their problems back to the country via email, then cleared all traces cleanly. After they left the meeting, they went on to prepare the next step of the operational plan. The domestic team received Z7’s email, and after decryption, a complete email appeared on Commander Xia’s desk.","In his hands, Commander Xia didn’t just hold one email but another as well, both delivered by Major General Yang, one hour apart.","After reading, Commander Xia, although very worried about the soldiers on diplomatic missions to the two countries, still had a smile on his face.","The Special Forces of the Snow Region Brigade had never disappointed anyone.","Outstanding ability, superior intellect, and their execution capacity have surprised people time and again.","\"They’ve all thought of the same issue, the same point, even their suspicions are similar, all talents, all talents indeed,\" Commander Xia exclaimed with emotion, having them is truly a fortune for the country!","Major General Yang had seen both emails, and he felt proud of his soldiers, \"They are a group of young people who would lay down their lives and shed blood, their rare tacit understanding allows them to maintain a high level of coordination even when operating in different countries.\"","\"We can now be fairly certain that Alice is an undercover placed beside the scientist by that nation. It was due to the betrayal by someone close that the scientist’s plan to return to the country failed. However, the rescue mission for Alice Cheng must still continue, Xia Jinyuan’s team must hold a portion of that country’s attention to facilitate the operation of the other team.\"","\"Only after the scientist is secretly rescued can Xia Jinyuan’s team proceed to save Alice Cheng. Consequently, the danger for their group will also increase significantly.\"","Once the nation realizes the scientist has been rescued, they will surely detain Alice Cheng to force the scientist to show himself, which means Xia Jinyuan’s team’s rescue mission will undoubtedly be fraught with difficulties and dangers.","The best course of action is to rescue the scientist without the nation realizing it and immediately proceed to save Alice Cheng on their end.","Coordination between the two sides is necessary for a successful link-up.","Major General Yang thought for a moment, then solemnly said, \"Connecting the two sides is not difficult, the real challenge is when the other group will be able to rescue the scientist. Xia Jinyuan’s team has a lower difficulty in their rescue mission; their challenge lies in how to prolong the rescue time.\"","After all, there is a Mr. Will involved, an important person who can allow Xia Jinyuan’s team to continue staying in Molaban under the guise of mercenaries.","Commander Xia did not see it as a great difficulty, \"Cyril, let him out to cause trouble, which can help their team extend the rescue time. Inform them, before receiving the news that the other group has rescued the scientist, to first go easy while dealing with Cyril!\""]},{"number":5362,"title":"Chapter 5362 - 5363: Tit for Tat","paragraphs":["The Chinese side’s operational capability has always been strong, and Commander Xia governs the military with strict discipline, dealing with matters decisively and rapidly, so the decision was swiftly handed over to Major General Yang to arrange.","\"Yes! I’ll notify them immediately!\" Considering the plan feasible, Major General Yang immediately contacted the embassy, and through the embassy got in touch with Xia Jinyuan, and also informed him of the contact method for another team on a mission.","At that moment, Xia Jinyuan had just finished his shower.","Ye Jian wasn’t in the room; she had gone for a swim in the hotel’s pool and had only come out after taking a shower in the changing room. There was no help for it—Noah’s team was so unscrupulous that they even installed surveillance in the presidential suite she shared with Xia Jinyuan!","Z7 said their only conscience was that they only caught the upper body; the lower body was not visible.","They could, but not Ye Jian!","When Ye Jian came out of the swimming area, with two blankets tossed over, it appeared as if a man was on top and a woman below, moving up and down, performing indescribable acts, which gave the guys who monitored them around the clock such a thrill that they howled with excitement. In the end, for the soldiers of that country, finding one or two Molaban ladies to bring to the hotel was no big deal.","In reality, Xia Jinyuan wasn’t doing anything unspeakable; he was using the cover under the blanket to exercise in an unusual way, while also conveying all the details about the other team to Ye Jian.","His Little Fox had a very smart head on her shoulders, and their collaboration, a deep synergy that reached into the depths of their souls, made Xia Jinyuan truly feel his soul shivering from her influence, every time he saw her mention a detail he had thought of.","Logically, a ten-minute conversation would have sufficed, but Ye Jian stubbornly watched him from under the blanket for almost an hour before coming out.","The reason was unknown to Ye Jian.","But as a man, Comrade Xia was quite clear.","Although they hid under the blanket for another purpose, the group watching them would only think they were engaging in a loving activity between a man and a woman. Therefore, as a man, he definitely couldn’t afford to lose face over this!","After an hour, the man’s dignity was preserved!","The few guys monitoring them waited until Xia Jinyuan showed his head and then turned off the lights. Each of them felt a bit disappointed and didn’t insist on getting closer to the screen to watch anymore.","The next day, Xia Jinyuan informed his comrades of the other team’s situation in the gym, using the music in the fitness area as a cover for their secret communication until Mr. Will came over.","Mr. Will, also under surveillance, appeared so worn out that he seemed to be in poor spirits. Sitting in the restaurant, he occasionally rubbed his temples to ease his headache. \"Have your comrades found any clues? Days have passed, and there’s still not a word from my friend.\"","Xia Jinyuan sliced a piece of steak and ate it slowly. After finishing the small piece, he set down the knife and, after scanning his surroundings, whispered to Mr. Will, \"Mr. Will, are you sure Cyril hasn’t found us? But since we entered the hotel yesterday, I’ve had the feeling that someone has been watching us in secret. I even feel it in our room!\"","\"Wasn’t it you who booked the hotel for us? Do you not have any such feelings? Have you not noticed anything odd?\"","As Mr. Will’s knife slid to the side while cutting the steak, the blade scraped across the ceramic plate, emitting a shrill and grating sound. He steadied his nerves and inquired, \"What feelings? What situations? I don’t understand at all what you’re trying to say.\"","They surely must have noticed Noah, God, these mercenaries were truly formidable—to have sensed someone surveilling them from the moment they entered the hotel.","For some reason, Mr. Will suddenly became very excited."]},{"number":5363,"title":"Chapter 5363 - 5364: Who is More Powerful","paragraphs":["Mr. Will was too excited, although he hid it well, and even his expression had become more serious than before, Xia Jinyuan did not miss the sudden spark in his eyes.","As Xia Jinyuan cut his steak, he bowed his head, carefully cutting small pieces for himself. Only then did Mr. Will realize that the mercenary sitting across from him was actually quite handsome.","\"Which country are you from?\" Mr. Will couldn’t help asking, \"Why are you so skilled?\"","Their profiles did not display their nationalities, only their battlefield experience and what they had done. Mr. Will actually knew very little about mercenaries.","Xia Jinyuan looked up, revealing a bloodthirsty, cruel smile, \"Because I’ve killed many, which is why I am so capable, and why I want to earn more and more money.\"","\"Is Mr. Will doubting that we won’t be able to rescue Alice Cheng next?\"","Not wanting to keep the topic on himself, he knew the best way was to shift it to the other party’s pressing concerns.","Mr. Will immediately shook his head, \"No, no, no, I absolutely am not. I just...\"","He raised a hand, his fist resting against his chin as he pondered.","A few minutes later, Mr. Will said in a low tone, \"Thinking about it, it would indeed be worthwhile to investigate the hotel where you are staying, perhaps Cyril has been watching you already, and you just haven’t noticed. I’ll have someone look into this hotel’s situation, see if they can find anything?\"","\"Good! That’s settled then. We’ll proceed from both ends, and contact each other by phone as soon as there’s any news,\" Xia Jinyuan said.","Mr. Will, looking very cautious, scanned behind Xia Jinyuan, his expression slightly darkening as he glanced toward the restaurant entrance, a shadow of gloom passing through his eyes as he returned to cutting his steak, \"Then I should leave now to avoid Cyril seeing that I’m with you.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded, \"OK, we will also contact Mr. Will as soon as we have any information.\"","The sound of a dining chair being gently pulled back was heard, Mr. Will’s tall figure striding away, his back exuding a trace of slight anger. Of course, this anger was not directed at Xia Jinyuan, but rather at the Caucasian man who rose after him.","Lifting a glass filled with lemon water, Xia Jinyuan, while drinking, narrowed his eyes slightly, watching silently with a cool, shallow smile as the Caucasian man followed Mr. Will’s departure.","Who had Alice Cheng?","Absolutely in Noah’s hands.","The country behind Noah was currently anxious to lure the Chinese out, hoping they would fall into their trap.","Checking the time, there was still half an hour before the meeting at the embassy. Xia Jinyuan simply ordered another steak for himself; he had been burning a lot of energy lately and needed to replenish his protein and sustain good nutrition.","He wondered if Little Fox, who had stayed at the hotel playing video games, had had lunch yet. She probably had, as he had told her to eat whatever she wanted and if she was bored, she could visit the nearby mall.","Now, their group was part of the assistance team, waiting for the latest news from another team tasked with rescuing the scientist before they could proceed with their actions.","Pulling out his phone, Xia Jinyuan sent a text to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, just getting into a car, heard the text notification, pulled out her phone to check it, and with a slight smile, she texted back, \"Not bad, shook off two tails.\"","Since leaving the hotel, Ye Jian had been walking along the street, attentively observing her surroundings as she did in her past life, ready to flee immediately if necessary; the habit remained till today."]},{"number":5364,"title":"Chapter 5364 - 5365: Very Chaotic","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan laughed upon seeing her text message, not even bothering to ask where she was; he was sure she was outside, otherwise, how could she have shaken off her two tails?","\"Now you might have irritated them, be careful they might send four more after you.\"","He and Ye Jian rarely exchanged text messages. Usually, when Ye Jian sent him a message, by the time he saw it, a considerable amount of time had passed, and it was perfectly normal for it to be several days or even months.","When he texted Ye Jian, he wouldn’t immediately wait for a reply. Generally, it would take about a week to receive her response, as military school discipline was strict, and students were not allowed to have cell phones.","The longest they had ever spent together during their years of courtship was last year when they were both in the same unit, one training male soldiers and the other female soldiers, able to see each other every day.","Although it was only for half a year, they were both very content.","Time with Shi Jian was all too short, and being together was not easy; they cherished every single minute and second.","Ye Jian immediately replied to his text, the corners of her eyes softening into a gentle smile, \"Then that’s perfect, let all their attention turn to me, and you will be safe.\"","During the day, the Special Forces from the Snow Region Brigade acted separately to create an opportunity for Xia Jinyuan to meet with the embassy staff, effectively dispersing the attention of the other party.","Xia Jinyuan smiled, taking sips of water while replying, \"After you meet up, send me the address so I can join you to enjoy the Molaban scenery. Despite the chaos in public security, the scenery isn’t bad.\"","While he leisurely continued texting, those surveilling him had no way to continue their task.","After sitting for another five minutes, he noticed the waiter serving another steak to the person keeping watch, who clenched his jaw and, expressionless, rose to leave and pay the bill.","He finally understood why the colonels had mentioned that these mercenaries, though they looked like Chinese people, were not actually sent by the Chinese.","China was a poor but cunning nation; how could they possibly dispatch people who appeared very foolish despite having strong combat abilities?","Half an hour later, Xia Jinyuan received a message from the embassy. After paying his bill and waiting a bit at the restaurant entrance, he got into a taxi.","The driver was no stranger; he was an embassy staff member who had greeted them upon their arrival in Molaban, coming from a scout background.","The embassy surely knew whether there was any news of Cyril, any minor actions from the adversaries, or contact with the local police; Xia Jinyuan, eager to set Cyril and Noah against each other, first needed to know Cyril’s movements.","\"Cyril is a ruthless and vengeful person, ready to exact a hundredfold revenge for the slightest offense. There was a report a few days ago of disruptions at his underground factory; we guessed it was your doing. The following day, we contacted the local police. Cyril didn’t first suspect another criminal power but the Molaban police,\" the scout-turned-embassy staff member explained.","After hearing this, Xia Jinyuan immediately understood why Cyril initially suspected the Molaban police.","This month, the president of Molaban was re-elected and began his speech with, \"I am still alive, and I can continue to stand here and fight against them.\" When the president said \"them,\" he was referring to criminal powers like Cyril’s.","Indeed, the president was lucky to be alive. Since the elections began in September, over a hundred political figures had been assassinated, including some close members of the president’s team. Senators and House members from both chambers felt their lives were threatened, and bodyguards accompanied them in long convoys whenever they went out.","Even so, their safety wasn’t 100% guaranteed.","\"And now? Does Cyril still suspect the police?\" Xia Jinyuan asked with a grave tone."]},{"number":5365,"title":"Chapter 5365 - 5366: No Way Out","paragraphs":["The staff member’s jawline was taut as he spoke. He had been working in Molaban for four years, the same four years when hostile drug cartels in Molaban experienced explosive growth. The sitting president had hoped to take advantage of the infighting among these cartels by deploying the army to the border to strike against the drug cartels, but instead of achieving the desired effect, it only added fuel to the fire, causing civilians to continuously lose their lives in the conflicts.","They didn’t clash directly with Molaban’s army but employed other brutal methods to counteract Molaban’s military force, making the president recognize the difficulty and back off, interfering less with the matters between the drug cartels.","By the second half of last year, whether it was an agreement among the various drug cartels, they shifted their internal war to focus specifically on combating the government, plunging Molaban once again into panic.","These drug dealers were ruthless. As long as they believed someone was detrimental to their interests, they would not give them a chance to explain and would kill them without a second word.","This was why the staff member repeatedly reminded Xia Jinyuan and his team to be cautious about their safety.","Once Cyril discovered even a hint that his underground factory had been tampered with, he would retaliate like a madman, marking all suspects for death. With just a bit of knowledge, it would surely lead to another bout of bloodshed.","And the police on that side were simply not going to intervene, or rather, they preferred to see this kind of infighting, leveraging the discord between drug dealers to defeat one side, which undoubtedly relieved the police of one more cancer. Therefore, the police were naturally happy to see such situations unfold.","\"Your identities are special now, having entered Molaban through illegal means. Once discovered by Cyril, you’ll face a dire situation with no way back and no support ahead. Even if our own country knows you are in danger, they can’t send support. And on our end...\"","The staff member, a former scout from the country’s Special Forces, knew the identity of the young man he was speaking with. They were here under identities equivalent to \"Death Soldiers.\" In the end, they could not reveal their identities, even if they were once covered in glory. The dead among them were merely illegal mercenaries.","The Molaban police would never confront Cyril’s drug cartel for an illegal mercenary.","The grim-faced Xia Jinyuan responded, \"Alright, we’ll be careful. If you hear anything about Cyril’s movements on your end, I hope you can inform us in time.\"","Facing a powerful drug cartel that not even a country’s police dare confront head-on, the eight of them were naturally even more cautious.","That’s why he planned to divert Cyril’s attention towards Noah.","\"Furthermore...\" the staff member’s vehicle rolled over several speed bumps, pausing his speech momentarily until the vehicle resumed stable progress, then he continued, \"The scientist under house arrest specializes in nuclear energy research. Now, not only does our country know about this, but several terrorist organizations internationally are aware as well.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes suddenly darkened, \"How did the terrorist organizations come to know? When did this happen?\" There had been contact with the country the previous night, but no such serious news was conveyed. Could it be...","\"I only found out when I came here. This news must have spread last night or this morning. Now, not only do we need to find the scientist, but more and more terrorist organizations and hostile forces are also getting involved in this struggle.\""]},{"number":5366,"title":"Chapter 5366 - 5367: Calculating Against Each Other","paragraphs":["This sudden change was too abrupt, and not only had Xia Jinyuan not expected it, but even those back in the country hadn’t foreseen it.","How could it have been leaked?","With dark eyes, Xia Jinyuan pressed his lips tightly together, his thin lips drawn into a straight line, his expression as sharp as a knife’s edge, \"Have you traced where the information was leaked from?\"","\"We just received the news, and it will take some time to find out where the leak originated. Now, our biggest concern is for you. The involvement of these terrifying organizations, with substantial intelligence and arms capabilities, hostile forces, means that the opponents you face are no longer the few known ones; there could be even more lurking like serpents in the shadows, waiting for an opportunity.\"","\"The danger level for you all has skyrocketed overnight in a gushing surge. No one can predict what dangers you will encounter.\"","\"The incidents of the past few days have the ambassador extremely worried. Thankfully, no comrade has been sacrificed, but those who are injured should continue to rest for the time being. Do not underestimate Molaban and these drug traffickers like Cyril. They are many times more formidable than those in the Golden Triangle.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded. The reminder from the staffer was not incorrect, and the challenges they faced were increasing. They must rescue the scientist and bring him back to the country before the multiple forces get involved.","It was strange. This country had always liked to conduct various research secretly, often accusing other countries of nuclear weapons research on the international stage, yet they themselves had never ceased their nuclear weapons research; a typical mindset of ’do as I say, not as I do.’","Theoretically, they could not let the world know about their scientists working on nuclear directions. Once exposed, it would be akin to telling the whole world that they were engaging in nuclear research. Although the country often contradicted itself without embarrassment, nuclear research is something that every nation pays attention to. How could they possibly let such information leak?","Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyelids slightly, \"We will make proper arrangements on our end, please rest assured, Mr. Ambassador. As for Cyril’s movements...\"","Before he could finish, his phone in his pocket suddenly vibrated. The driver, ever so cautious, even stopped breathing and turned on the car radio, filling the car with a lively, upbeat song.","The caller was none other than Mr. Will, who had just met with Xia Jinyuan not long ago.","Mr. Will’s voice on the phone was very urgent, \"I have some news. A friend of mine called me, saying he has information about Alice Cheng. He is at the train station waiting for me, I am on my way there now, come join me!\"","Molaban has only one train station, and it is not a central station connecting to the national network but merely a starting point for commuter trains to nearby areas.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t need Mr. Will to give the details to know, \"Good, I’m on my way now.\"","\"OK, OK, as quickly as possible, please make sure to come as quickly as possible.\" Mr. Will urged anxiously and then quickly hung up the phone, placing his phone aside before turning to Noah who was sitting across from him, \"He’s already headed to the train station. Aren’t you going?\"","Noah, satisfied with Mr. Will’s cooperation and unfazed by his grim face, smiled politely, \"You just need to handle your own tasks. As for ours, you don’t need to know.\"","\"Alright, Mr. Will, we will now take you to the train station. Remember, you only need to cooperate with us, so you and your family won’t be in any danger. Go on, good luck.\""]},{"number":5367,"title":"Chapter 5367 - 5368: Something Big Happened","paragraphs":["Melbourne train station is located on the southeast side of the city center. The station’s interior space has been converted into a shopping center, making it one of the busiest places in Melbourne. Many tourists who visit Melbourne take pictures at the train station as a keepsake, unwittingly turning it into a landmark.","Every day, the place is packed with people, cramped and disorderly, which prompted the current government to allocate police forces to maintain order and ensure the normal operation of the train station as well as the safety of citizens and tourists.","However, for a city like Melbourne where everyone carries a gun, these measures are merely a drop in the bucket and far from sufficient. Violent incidents are frequent, and bloodshed continues unabated. Seeing little effectiveness, authorities later turn a blind eye, allowing things to take their own course, with some violent cases left unresolved.","Tourists are aware that the train station is a place of both prosperity and danger, but the danger is not enough to deter them. They know the risks, yet they still flock to the station.","Ye Jian, strolling through the pedestrian street of a foreign land, received a call from Xia Jinyuan. She answered with a smile curling at her lips but, upon hanging up, her expression turned serious, devoid of any hint of a smile.","She didn’t linger on the pedestrian street any longer, and immediately took a taxi to the direction of the train station.","The hotel they were staying at was not in the same direction as the train station, and the two who had moved separately weren’t in the same area either, but the time it took to get to the train station was roughly forty-five minutes for both.","Mr. Will arrived earlier than both of them. Xia Jinyuan did not actually arrive within the normal travel time. When Mr. Will suddenly asked him to go to the train station, Xia Jinyuan agreed with a \"Sure,\" but alarms were going off in his head.","Familiar with Melbourne, Xia Jinyuan told Ye Jian to meet at an address close to the train station. They would meet there before going to see Mr. Will together.","While still on the phone with Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan thought that he needed to contact V8, who had been closely watching them from the shadows, to ask if there was any situation. As it happened, right after he finished speaking with Ye Jian, V8’s call came through.","\"Damn it, finally got through!\"","As soon as the call connected, V8’s relieved voice could be heard, \"Q King, I’ve got a situation here! Noah pulled back all of the surveillance on you guys, and he even took away all the cameras from our rooms. There’s something fishy here! Why would he suddenly change his mind?\"","The intelligence from V8 was extremely timely!","Noah’s role was the same as his, both were in Melbourne for a mission. Thinking from Noah’s perspective, Xia Jinyuan surmised there were two possibilities.","The first: Noah suspected their identities.","The second: Noah did not suspect their identities.","Before checking into the hotel, Noah must have always been suspicious of their identities, hence the constant probing and assigning people to keep a comprehensive watch on them, including surveillance in the rooms.","In what situation would he stop watching them?","He would stop monitoring them if he no longer suspected their identities! Hence, he decided to pull back the surveillance and remove the cameras.","Why did he suddenly trust them?","Something must have happened that convinced Noah that they were indeed mercenaries and not Chinese operatives sent to rescue Alice Cheng.","Could it be...","Suddenly, Xia Jinyuan’s expression turned grim, and he immediately said to the driver with authority, \"Quick! Contact the ambassador and ask him to notify our home country immediately, there’s danger for another action team!\"","Hearing this, V8 on the other end of the phone jumped in shock, \"What’s going on? What’s going on? Why are you suddenly saying that another group is in danger?\"","What the hell is happening now?","He hadn’t said anything just now, had he?"]},{"number":5368,"title":"Chapter 5368 - 5369: Who is the Real Winner","paragraphs":["V8 was startled, and so was the driver; neither dared to delay. They immediately called the ambassador. Xia Jinyuan had not yet finished his conversation with V8. As soon as the driver’s mobile phone connected, he snatched it up and rattled off his speculations in rapid-fire succession.","The face of the ambassador who picked up the phone turned ashen, \"Alright, alright, I got it! Yes! Understood! Understood! Okay, I’m contacting our country now! You all must take care of yourselves! Make sure nothing goes wrong!\"","Xia Jinyuan responded with a single \"okay\" before hanging up the phone and returning it to the driver.","Under what circumstances would they no longer suspect their identities? It must be because they learned that the Chinese had already sent someone to rescue the scientist, hence, they believed that the Chinese would not send anyone else to rescue Alice Cheng.","Between a nuclear researcher and an ordinary housewife, which is more important?","Definitely the nuclear researcher!","Why would the host country release Alice Cheng to come to Melbourne? Because they needed to capture a Chinese person, and now that they have confirmed traces of the Chinese operatives within their own country, they can completely give up on Alice Cheng.","Alice Cheng was just bait, and now that they no longer need this bait, Noah and the others do not need to keep a strict watch on all their suspected targets anymore.","As for the scientist’s identity being suddenly exposed, it was likewise a maneuver by the host country. They have found the people sent by the Chinese for the rescue, and their goal has been achieved. To make matters more complicated for the Chinese, they’ve stirred up chaos.","After all, they still have the scientist in their hands. As long as they have the scientist, no matter how chaotic it gets outside, it does not relate to their country. Let the Chinese deal with it. Who asked the Chinese to send someone? Who asked the Chinese to hurry to save the scientist they hold?","Having listened to the entirety of V8’s report, Xia Jinyuan broke out in cold sweat, \"These damn bastards, such ruthlessness! No one could be more cunning than them in playing their cards so well!\"","Xia Jinyuan, beyond the flash of fierceness when the key point came to mind, was now eerily calm, \"They, of course, need to scheme for their own country, just like we all plan for our own country.\"","\"It’s just a matter of seeing who will be the winner in this game.\"","Xia Jinyuan felt there was nothing surprising about the actions of the host country. They naturally need to consider their own country’s interests, and therefore their intricate plots are to be expected.","Anger? Rage? There was no need.","What they were doing now was, aren’t they also one trap after another?","Perhaps the people from the host country are likewise cursing the Chinese for being sly.","\"Now that the hotel area is not under strict surveillance, you can move around a bit, but don’t show your face and continue to keep a close watch on Noah. Have G3 and Z7 rush to the train station while you and K7 stay at the hotel,\" Xia Jinyuan instructed V8 before ending the call.","What happened next was out of Xia Jinyuan’s control. The driver gripped the steering wheel with one hand and wiped the sudden sweat from his forehead with the other, \"They’re too cunning. With just a slight lapse on our part, we could be completely devoured by these bandits.\"","Xia Jinyuan, whose face was dark as a storm cloud, did not respond to the driver. His fingers unconsciously tapped on the seat a few times before he said to the driver, \"Brother, drop me off up ahead; I’ll take another car to go there.\"","\"I can take you there,\" the driver, probably sensing something serious, replied earnestly, \"We’re still some distance from the train station.\""]},{"number":5369,"title":"Chapter 5369 - 5370: Stay with You Until the End","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan sighed softly, \"No need, it’s not suitable for you to accompany me. Don’t worry, we handle such matters often, and there’s no danger. You go back to your work, leave the outside matters to us.\"","Since Noah was no longer closely monitoring them, Xia Jinyuan had to figure out how to shake off their eight-person group. How could he rid himself of them?","It was quite simple.","Exposing them directly to Cyril’s men would do the trick.","Just like they wanted to expose Noah to Cyril, it was the same principle: both sides calculating against each other, each with their own plans.","The staff could not persuade Xia Jinyuan otherwise, his role was merely to relay information, he could not directly participate in the entire event, despite his desire to help, he had to consider his own identity.","Before leaving, the staff repeatedly reminded Xia Jinyuan to pay attention to his safety and to prioritize his life at all times.","Because he knew, it was not easy for the country to train such a highly skilled group of Special Forces.","They were trained to serve the country, not to be sacrificed carelessly.","In the car, Xia Jinyuan shook hands firmly with the staff member then opened the door to exit. He entered a hat shop passing by and bought two identical hats before getting back into the car to meet up with Ye Jian at the designated location.","Since it was someone else’s car, Xia Jinyuan did not discuss the reasons for the change with Ye Jian inside the car. It was not until they met that he shared his suspicions with her.","Ye Jian took a while to recover from the shock, exhaling deeply before saying to Xia Jinyuan, \"If it hadn’t been for V8 reporting to you in time today, the other group of comrades would have likely all been killed in action.\"","The rogue nation renowned for scientific imprisonment has been involved in major wars over the past years, always as the aggressor.","They possess strong military power, an extensive intelligence network, and a group of exceptional soldiers, these facts are undeniable and must be acknowledged.","After speaking, Ye Jian’s eyes turned cold as she murmured, \"So, the time has come for Noah to dispose of us. It’s very likely he will use Cyril’s hand to eliminate us, Captain Xia, we’re probably about to face off with Cyril’s men next.\"","Xia Jinyuan had yet to reveal the news about the scientist’s leak, and that the withdrawal of all surveillance by Nero might impact them when Ye Jian had already thought ahead and spoke immediately.","The psychic synergy once again brought a smile to Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, dispelling the stern shadows between his handsome brows, \"Right! Mr. Will asked us to hurry to the train station, probably also the first step for Noah to let Cyril know of our existence.\"","\"Ahead lies a den of dragons and tigers; would you be willing to venture through it with me?\" He extended his hand to Ye Jian, and without any hesitation, she placed her hand in his, firmly grasping the hand of her beloved companion in battle, his handsome face harbored a deep smile.","Ye Jian said, \"For every dragon, a dragon tamer; for every tiger, a tiger tamer; I’ll accompany you till the end.\"","Because, they were not only lovers but also comrades who fought side by side.","At that time, Mr. Will had already been standing under the giant statue in the center of the train station square. He first saw Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian and greeted them while simultaneously notifying Noah in secrecy.","Noah, seeing the two mercenaries coming hand in hand, was not handsome but merely had a three-dimensional face that showed a regretful smile.","The pair, with their hats partially covering their faces, had already spotted Mr. Will and covertly exchanged glances with G3 and Z7 who had arrived at the train station.","G3 and Z7 had already spotted Noah."]},{"number":5370,"title":"Chapter 5370 - 5371: Calculating Against Each Other","paragraphs":["Mr. Will, who had already been waiting, saw Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian approaching. After greeting them, he did not head directly toward the two but made his way into the train station. He walked at a leisurely pace, making it clear he was waiting for the two to catch up.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian exchanged a quick glance and hurried to catch up to Mr. Will. After a brief moment, they reached his side, and Xia Jinyuan asked, \"What’s the situation? Where is the person?\"","\"Don’t know, he’s inside. We’ll find out once we see him,\" Mr. Will answered while walking, quickly scanning their surroundings. Suddenly, he quickened his stride and urged the two following him, \"Move faster, keep heading inside! Quick!\"","It seemed as if he was trying to shake someone off.","Ye Jian lightly squeezed Xia Jinyuan’s hand and whispered, \"Is he trying to lose Noah’s watchful eyes?\"","\"Possibly,\" Xia Jinyuan replied indifferently. \"He wants to save Alice Cheng and won’t cooperate with Noah for long.\"","\"If that’s the case, it will make our action much easier.\"","With such a crowd that they were brushing shoulders with others, Xia Jinyuan, initially holding Ye Jian’s hand, switched to wrapping an arm around her shoulders, \"If it wasn’t to make our action easier, Noah wouldn’t have let Mr. Will slip from their control so easily. Let’s see what Mr. Will has planned first.\"","Ye Jian nodded and leaned on Xia Jinyuan as they made their way through the crowd.","Within the throng of people, Noah watched Mr. Will suddenly quicken his pace and disappear from his line of sight. His expression first turned cold, and then he let out a low chuckle.","\"Mr. Will, you really are not honest.\"","Pressing his disguised earpiece, Noah heard his colleague speak coldly, \"He’s indeed in a rush to shake us off. Good thing the colonels were prepared.\"","\"He’s smart. Dealing with a clever person, we can’t be fooled by his temporary cooperation. We need to fully grasp all his motives to truly guard against all his possible moves.\"","With a faint smile, Noah looked at the train station entrance, the deadly intent in his blue-green eyes even chillier than the noise of the crowd. Amidst the hustle and bustle, he said something quietly, his voice drowned out and inaudible to anyone around him.","Yet, the cold, ruthless smile curling at his lips was more chilling than the murderous look in his eyes, enough to send shivers down one’s spine.","The three struggled to move forward through the bustling crowd, and after nearly 10 minutes, Mr. Will noticed his informant, an ordinary-looking local man from Molaban.","He was seated anxiously on a bench, looking around, glancing left and right, sweat rolling down his cheeks like raindrops. Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan, a cold glint in his eyes, whispered, \"Mr. Will, I have a bad feeling right now! Is there a problem here?\"","His voice was low and fierce, and he spoke close to Mr. Will, startling him as if his heart had suddenly lost its foundation and plummeted to the ground.","After a quick glance around, Mr. Will tried to keep his voice calm to hide any panic from the mercenaries nearby, swallowing before replying in a hushed tone, \"It does seem a bit off. You two stay here; I’ll go check it out alone.\"","\"Then be careful!\" Xia Jinyuan advised quietly, his eyes dark. He suddenly added, \"Mr. Will, we’re in a partnership. As long as you can name the price, we can handle any issue for you. Money, no issue for you; tasks, no issue for us.\"","At these words, Mr. Will’s gaze flicked as he clenched his fist, then slowly released it, \"I trust you guys, so please, trust me as well.\""]},{"number":5371,"title":"Chapter 5371 - 5372: Fearless (Monthly Tickets, Monthly Tickets)","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan nodded and, cradling Ye Jian’s shoulders, pointed to one of the columns in the train station’s main hall, adorned with a series of small, blurry mirrors, \"Ok, I hope we can continue to cooperate happily, we will wait for you here.\"","Mr. Will, glancing toward the direction of the column, nodded vigorously, cleared his way through the throng of passengers, and approached his informer.","He first looked around,","and asked in a low voice, \"Abei, how are you? What has happened?\"","Upon hearing Mr. Will’s question, Abei immediately broke into tears, \"Mr. Will, I’m sorry!\"","Seeing Abei suddenly apologize, Mr. Will’s sharp gaze quickly swept over the bustling crowd again, and suddenly, he spotted a bald old man in the crowd, running quickly in their direction.","This man was none other than the auctioneer from the auction house a few days ago, one of Cyril’s staff, Lao Fox!","He was surrounded by 7 or 8 heavily armed men.","A pale-faced Mr. Will, hearing Abei’s even more painful cries, did not blame Abei but instead, grabbed Abei and ran towards the large column where Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were.","\"Mr. Will, I’ve failed you, you should run! Don’t worry about me! Just run!\" Abei struggled, a young man barely in his twenties, threatened and now seeing Mr. Will not abandoning him, was overwhelmed with shame and guilt for his actions.","If he had been brave just moments before, confronting Cyril’s men directly, throwing his life away, he could have protected Mr. Will.","Mr. Will, running desperately, also had to firmly grasp Abei; he had absolutely no time to speak.","When they reached Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, he pushed the still crying Abei towards them, \"Take him and run, protect him well, I will draw away Lao Fox and his men.\"","Having said that, he ran in the opposite direction from Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","The two, suddenly accompanied by another person, watched Mr. Will dashing frantically. Abei, pushed next to strangers, was about to scream but was quickly silenced by Xia Jinyuan’s swift hand covering his mouth, \"Don’t speak! You will get Mr. Will killed!\"","The shout that had reached his throat was pushed back by the fierce tone in the stranger’s voice. Xia Jinyuan, who had performed tasks in Molaban, could speak the local language.","Abei stopped struggling, and only then did Xia Jinyuan let go of his hand.","\"Let’s go,\" he whispered to Ye Jian, and the trio moved towards the exit of the train station.","Before they had gone far, 5 or 6 armed men emerged from the front. They had not yet spotted their target, and with pistols in hand, they charged arrogantly into the crowd.","Seeing these men wielding guns, countless passengers and tourists hastily hid in nearby shops, not daring to confront these men directly.","Xia Jinyuan handed Abei over to Ye Jian and said sternly, \"You take him and walk the other way, I will deal with these men. We’ll meet at the hotel.\"","With that, he pulled out his pistol, fitted it with a silencer, and headed towards them.","Ye Jian grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s hand, not agreeing with his plan to draw them away alone, \"There’s no need, we can evacuate together.\"","\"Don’t worry, I will be back soon. Mr. Will can’t get into trouble; I need to lend him a hand now to fully gain his trust.\" He did not pull his hand away from Ye Jian because he knew his girl would give up willingly.","Ye Jian let go, \"Okay! I will wait for you to come back at the hotel!\""]},{"number":5372,"title":"Chapter 5372 - 5373: A Tooth for a Tooth","paragraphs":["As Captain, Xia Jinyuan had his combat deployments, and Mr. Will was a necessary collaborator, so even though Ye Jian knew that Xia Jinyuan’s departure was dangerous, she had to let go as a combatant carrying out the mission.","Outside, Noah saw people continually pouring out of the train station. With his hands in his pockets, his fingers brushed his lips, revealing a confident smile.","See there.","Those who disobey, how could they possibly meet a good end?","Mr. Will, from the moment you chose to betray, it was destined that you would not come to a good end.","\"Colonel, they are looking for Mr. Will, and also, Cyril’s men have not found the mercenaries who went in with him,\" a Caucasian male’s voice traveled through the comms to Noah’s ear, \"Do you need our help?\"","Noah issued a casual chuckle, \"Of course, these guys being out is dangerous, and since we now have time, we can totally deal with these dangers. Remember, disguise yourselves as Cyril’s subordinates and don’t let him find out.\"","\"These mercenaries aren’t as weak as you might think.\" Of course, compared to them, these guys were still a bit weaker.","\"Yes, colonel, we will definitely help Cyril properly,\" voices from the headset resonated with the same certainty and confidence, characteristic of the arrogance that soldiers from a superpower countries always seem to carry, believing they are stronger than others.","Inside the train station, Cyril’s subordinates didn’t start shooting straight away. In such a crowded place, even if Cyril was bold, he needed to be cautious.","If they really did that, he would face more enemies than he could handle.","Noah’s men entered the train station to look for Xia Jinyuan. On Ye Jian’s end, she was leading Abei out of the station. Without wireless communication devices but having a rendezvous point, during the retreat, Ye Jian constantly kept an eye on Z7, who was monitoring Noah’s actions.","The attentive Z7, seeing Noah’s men enter the train station and before he could notify Xia Jinyuan and G3, received a call from Ye Jian’s end. They quickly agreed on a meeting point, and after a three-second call, Z7 quickly informed Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan was still running in an S-shape amidst the crowd; the inside passengers all were running, and because Cyril’s men had not discovered him beforehand, they didn’t pay attention to a running figure.","Receiving the call from Z7, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes showed a cold chill, \"Noah wants to take advantage of the chaos to eliminate us, then push all the blame onto Will, making Cyril only focus on Will. By doing so, he can remove himself from the whole incident.\"","\"Damn it, pushing the entire incident and now wanting to cleanly remove himself, there’s no such easy deal!\" Z7 angrily said, \"Since they want to take advantage of the chaos to eliminate us, we can do the same to them.\"","\"I’ll contact G3 and have him handle it neatly.\"","Xia Jinyuan continued to run, leaping down from the high platform, heading towards the trains lined up in front, Will’s running speed was unexpectedly fast, fortunately, he caught up in time, or otherwise, he would have lost him in the station.","\"An eye for an eye, not bad. I’ll keep an eye on Will, you guys handle Noah’s men,\" Xia Jinyuan really didn’t mind giving Noah a taste of his own medicine.","Ye Jian protected Abei as they left the train station, and Z7, already responsible for the team’s communications, immediately contacted G3 again, found Noah’s men, and with a cold tone, G3 came back, \"Don’t worry, if I can’t kill both, I’ll kill one.\""]},{"number":5373,"title":"Chapter 5373 - 5374: Wrestling","paragraphs":["It was all about calculating each other’s moves, getting angry was unnecessary, what was needed was strength, to crush the opponent with strength, to tell the opponent with strength that underestimating others would lead to a dire outcome.","Rushing to meet Ye Jian at the rendezvous point, Z7 chuckled, \"Brother, are you saving the other one for the New Year? If you can take him down, do it; don’t think we’re easy to bully.\"","\"I’m very modest. Keep an eye on the outside; see you later.\" Having locked on the target, G3 had a good opportunity to strike and ended the call after speaking.","Z7, looking at his phone emitting a \"beep-beep\" busy tone, tightened his gaze and whispered softly, \"Brother, you’ve got to be careful.\"","Putting his phone in his pocket, he arrived at the rendezvous point, his gaze sternly scanning the surroundings.","Upon seeing Ye Jian, Z7 immediately approached her, and the two quickly escorted Abei to a safe place. Unfortunately, neither of them spoke the language of Molaban, and since Abei couldn’t speak English, Z7 immediately called White Crane to resolve the issue.","White Crane was on his way to the train station, where chaos had begun. Xia Jinyuan called G3, who then promptly informed Z7; Z7 in turn informed White Crane. The phone was their tool for mutual communication.","In the train station, Xia Jinyuan, who had been closely pursuing Mr. Will, moved through the densest crowd to reach the train head docking point in the station. Besides rows of train heads, it was hard to find any passengers, except for the station staff who might appear.","Xia Jinyuan took down one of the tough criminals, and before he could move, another criminal emerged from the side of a train head, raising his pistol.","Holding a silenced pistol, Xia Jinyuan quickly aimed at the assailant’s chest and fired. A muffled sound, like a bubble emerging in deep water, rang out, and the criminal holding the pistol fell, with a large patch of blood oozing from his chest.","A direct hit to the heart, killed instantly.","Not letting the body lie directly on the ground, Xia Jinyuan dragged the killed target under the train carriage and then quickly moved forward.","These people were standing individually, like sentinels.","Next, he swiftly moved to the coupling between two train carriages, aimed at another criminal who was approaching by the sound, and waited until the man was getting closer before shooting him in the head.","The sound of the silenced pistol was so faint that sometimes, if you didn’t listen carefully, you couldn’t hear it clearly; even if heard, it wouldn’t be recognized as a gunshot, only those frequently using guns could discern it.","Inside the train station, Xia Jinyuan, who had been shaken off by Cyril’s men, was now in the shadows. The Xueyu unit members preferred fighting in darkness for its efficiency and safety, and as the Captain, Xia Jinyuan was particularly skilled in stealth combat. At this moment, having taken down several targets, he tensely held his breath, waiting for a suspicious figure moving toward him.","The approaching figure was extremely cautious, stopping every two steps, taking five whole minutes to move from the front of the carriage to the back.","Just as he stopped again, his rifle slowly extending, Xia Jinyuan, who could almost touch the barrel of the gun by stretching out his hand, felt his cold intent deepening.","One, two, three... action!","He burst forward in a dash, his elbow striking hard against the man’s jaw, quickly shifting his stance, his left hand lightly slicing the man’s throat with a blade.","The ever-sharp dagger turned into a streak of cold light as it grazed the criminal’s neck. His speed was so fast, directly cutting through, severing the major arteries, blood spurted out like water from a high-pressure hose, splashing onto Xia Jinyuan’s right shoulder."]},{"number":5374,"title":"Chapter 5374 - 5375: Chaos upon Chaos","paragraphs":["The man who was stabbed fell to the ground convulsing, with no time to even clutch his throat, his body spraying blood like rain as it tilted towards the carriage; moments later, he passed away, his eyes wide with shock and horror that had not yet dissipated.","He thought he was unharmed, never expecting that he wouldn’t even have the chance to scream or fear, as the God of Death had already taken him away.","These were all Cyril’s men; they looked formidable with their guns pointed at civilians, but against the Special Forces, they were nothing more than embroidered pillows.","There were formidable figures within Molaban’s criminal underworld too; otherwise, how would they dare to clash with the government? However, clearly, the gangsters dealt with by Xia Jinyuan were mere underlings, requiring no great effort to handle, just careful and cautious tactics for resolution.","Just as Xia Jinyuan had pushed the gangster onto the tracks, a series of ghastly screams erupted from up ahead. With his face turning abruptly grim, Xia Jinyuan didn’t even bother to wipe the blood from his face as he hurried towards the source of the screams.","It was already too late. The heartlessly deranged members of Molaban’s criminal element, who dared to kill even policemen, picked up their pistols and sprayed a hail of bullets toward about a dozen train station workers.","Suddenly, the entire section of the carriage was filled with wails; blood spilled across the floor.","These were workers tasked with maintaining all the engines at the train station. Terrified by the sight of the armed gangsters, they all hid in an open carriage section, not knowing that the ’clang’ from a casually handled hammer dropping would lead to their collective demise.","Xia Jinyuan’s steps halted suddenly; his chest felt as though it had been heavily struck by a boulder, his internal anger seething, both deep and painful.","The gun-toting thugs emerged from the carriage one by one. Xia Jinyuan glanced over; there were three in total. As they approached along the tracks, he heard a voice he had heard a few days earlier at an auction, filled with brutality, bellowing, \"You bloody wolf spawn, do you realize what you’ve done? Do you?\"","\"You must be tired of living, still trying to talk your way out in front of me! Don’t think just because your brother died trying to save Cyril that you can do whatever you want! Speak up! Where have you hidden them all? Hand them all over now!\"","\"I’ll consider your brother’s contribution, the fact that you’re usually honest, and beg Cyril for mercy on your behalf to spare your life! You mongrel, this is your last chance!\"","The bald man, yelling in a fit of rage, kicked and cursed at Mr. Will. To Xia Jinyuan’s surprise, this guy actually knew Mr. Will, and Mr. Will’s brother had even saved Cyril.","Mr. Will, beaten until his body curled, gritted his teeth, his face bruised and swollen, yet he didn’t utter a word.","The bald man, furious to the point of exploding, shouted, \"You damned mongrel, are you trying to betray us? Beat him until he talks, and if he doesn’t, greet him with a bullet!\"","Xia Jinyuan, listening to the commotion, slowly retreated, then picked up a rifle dropped by one of the eliminated targets, pulled out the magazine to check it with a ’click’ before sliding it back in, and once again cautiously moved forward.","Then, with his agile movements, he quickly climbed on top of the train carriages, crawling slowly until he was in a position to swiftly eliminate the targets.","Raising the gun, taking aim, and squeezing the trigger, the continuous gunfire sounded like fireworks exploding, \"Bang bang... bang bang bang...\" Each bullet found its mark without fail.","The first to fall was not one of the underlings but the bald man; the back of his head was blown open by a bullet from Xia Jinyuan."]},{"number":5375,"title":"Chapter 5375 - 5376: Confrontation","paragraphs":["A bald head burst into a stunning crimson flower just seconds ago, and Cyril’s famed \"Think Tank\" now lay silently on the ground. Even in the moment of his death, he didn’t understand how he had fallen.","The gun fired, the bald man fell, and the fierce brigands who were responsible for closely watching the surroundings heard the gunfire. Before they could react, they too fell to the ground. Two of the brigands reacted quickly, immediately taking cover and returning fire.","As for those who took money to do jobs and followed orders without any opinion of their own, Xia Jinyuan had no intention of letting them go.","Mr. Will, who was curled up on the ground after being shot, still didn’t understand what was happening. As the gunfire rang out, he continued to hold his head, waiting to be hit by a bullet.","However, he was not shot. The bastard shooting them fell down one by one, and finally, it became so quiet around him that he could hear the wind, so quiet that he barely dared to open his eyes.","About two minutes passed. Xia Jinyuan, who couldn’t wait any longer, walked over to him, looked down, and coldly stared at Mr. Will, who was still clutching his head. \"You can come out now. How long do you plan to stay on the ground? Planning to stay down until the sun sets?\"","Hearing Xia Jinyuan’s voice, the incredulous Mr. Will released his hands and lay on the ground, forgetting to get up, staring blankly. Finally, Xia Jinyuan reached out and pulled him up. Mr. Will, in pain, suddenly panicked and frantically looked around.","Seeing the bald man lying in a pool of blood, Mr. Will’s face lost all color. When he looked at Xia Jinyuan, even his eyes were shaking, \"You, you... you killed... killed him. You... You killed him.\"","He was frightened, so frightened that he was stammering.","Xia Jinyuan seemed not to notice his fear. Instead, he deliberately misconstrued his words, his tone cold. \"It wasn’t me. Did you think it was Jesus who came to rescue you?\"","He said it casually, but Mr. Will was anything but casual, his pallid face as ashen as death. \"You maniac, you maniac... I think Cyril is going to completely lose it now. You’ve destroyed his adviser, he will never let you go.\"","\"He won’t let me go? Mr. Will, would Cyril have let you go if he hadn’t died? I don’t think so. Alright! Mr. Will, I think we should talk less and leave quickly. I’ve handed your men over to my brother, do you want to see him?\"","Xia Jinyuan’s icy voice again entered Mr. Will’s ears, who was so frightened that he didn’t even have the strength to step forward, and he fell silent.","He wasn’t wrong, he wasn’t wrong. Cyril would never have let him go, the bald man wouldn’t have either. Now that the bald man was dead, at least he was still alive, at least he was still alive for now.","It was this incredibly capable mercenary he had hired with a hefty commission that had saved him.","\"Thank you,\" he said with a dry voice. When Cyril had kidnapped Alice Cheng, he knew... he knew Cyril would not let him go easily.","He knew, he had always known, just... just that he didn’t want to face it, only wanted to escape.","Now it was over, now it was finally time to face it, no need to run anymore.","Although Mr. Will was still frightened, with his face still deathly pale, at least he could walk on his own now, and he could say to Xia Jinyuan, \"We need to figure out a way to cleanly deal with these guys. Do you have any good ideas?\""]},{"number":5376,"title":"Chapter 5376 - 5377: The Outcome of Arrogance","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan was most familiar with handling crime scenes, and while he was dealing with it on this side, Noah outside was driven mad with anger, no, not mad, but enraged.","In his fury, his facial features twisted out of shape, he still needed to be mindful of his surroundings, still needed to keep his voice low. His left hand spread wide, like the ferocious claws of a Jiaolong dragon, he roared over and over, \"Find them, let none escape! Let none escape! These damned bastards! Kill them all!\"","Two of his male soldiers had entered the train station and... were killed! Shot dead on the spot! They had no idea who had killed them!","A few mercenaries?","Now, these few mercenaries were nowhere to be seen, completely vanished, without any of his soldiers keeping up with them.","Was it them?","No!","Impossible.","Even if they were formidable, his soldiers were more so; it was impossible for a few mercenaries to stealthily kill them without any of the nearby searching soldiers noticing.","Cyril’s men?","Was it this damn thing?","For the first time since entering Molaban, Noah, his face fierce, tasted defeat, a defeat he deemed utterly impossible.","His two male soldiers were killed.","This undoubtedly dealt Noah a heavy blow, leaving him unable momentarily to accept it.","His soldiers were supposed to neutralize those dangerous mercenaries, not get killed by others, not get killed!","Enraged, Noah was no longer thinking about how to disguise as Cyril’s men in this chaos to kill Xia Jinyuan and the others; he needed to find the real murderer who killed his soldiers.","A confident Noah, seething with rage, had just emerged from the train station, while Z7 received his terse two-word text message, \"In pairs.\"","Seeing the message, Z7’s eyebrows arched, and he sent a text to Ye Jian and White Crane, and to T6, K7, and V8 who were still at the hotel, saying it wasn’t too late to discuss it when they returned.","White Crane had arrived, and he spoke Molaban’s language. As soon as he began to speak, Abei, his eyes red and swollen from crying, like meeting a long-lost relative, became excited and lunged forward to grab White Crane’s hand, spouting a torrent of incoherent, rapid words.","Ye Jian, who only understood two languages, completely failed to understand him. Judging from his body language, he was probably still worried about Mr. Will.","Though Abei had said a lot, White Crane only translated the most crucial sentence for Ye Jian, \"He said he needs to find a phone and we should not follow him.\"","Ye Jian shook her head, \"Tell him that it’s not possible. Until Mr. Will arrives, he cannot leave alone. This is for his safety.\"","White Crane translated faithfully, and after hearing it, Abei got even more agitated, his neck stiffening, so engorged that the blue veins became visible, \"No, you can’t! I must make a phone call! It’s very, very important!\"","\"You can make a phone call, but we need to follow you.\" White Crane said calmly, preventing him from escaping.","It was evident that Abei was desperate to make a call, the more they restrained him, the more he wanted to escape.","\"We can come up with a better solution; you go make the call, we’ll stand nearby, a bit farther away from you. How about that? If you agree, we can take you there now. If you disagree, the two of us will keep a strict eye on you, and you will have no chance to run.\"","Moved by White Crane’s suggestion, Abei finally nodded in agreement."]},{"number":5377,"title":"Chapter 5377 - 5378: Accompanying","paragraphs":["Abei had no choice but to agree, as he knew very well that he could not possibly escape from the two people in front of him, and he had to accept the situation.","After accepting, Abei spoke a few more words. Ye Jian, not understanding what he said, looked at White Crane, waiting for his translation.","\"He said he won’t make the call here, but in another place, which we have to walk to, about ten minutes away,\" White Crane’s brow furrowed slightly, \"That place is very safe.\"","To Abei, it might be safe, but not necessarily for Ye Jian and White Crane.","But since they had agreed to Abei, they naturally had to go there.","By this time, the train station was not nearly as bustling as it had been half an hour earlier, with the square completely cleared out, not a single pedestrian passing through. Those fleeing had escaped far from the train station to safety.","The belatedly arriving, fully armed police, carrying shields, ran towards the station, crossing the deserted square. Inside, the scene was entirely different, with a crowd in the midst of evacuation causing a stampede. Several passengers were trampled by the crowd surging behind them, resulting in casualties. The late-arriving police began to clear the scene.","An increasingly furious Noah did not stay any longer. The police had arrived and even though he wanted to find the killer who had murdered his two soldiers, it was necessary for him to retreat at that moment.","When he gave the command \"retreat,\" his hazel eyes were filled with reluctance. His somewhat lengthy and gaunt face showed his jaw clenched tight, leaving with a gloominess surrounding him.","Along the roadside were many cars that hadn’t been started, some with their doors wide open, showing how panicked the owners had been at the time.","Ye Jian and White Crane, along with Abei, crossed the street and soon disappeared around a corner.","Elsewhere, G3 and Z7 met up and celebrated with a high-five.","Xia Jinyuan and Mr. Will handled the scene smoothly, avoiding Cyril’s men who had not yet left.","On another side, Abei led the way through two streets and then into a commercial street selling Molaban’s local specialties.","The street was narrow but filled with Molaban’s character. This area was not affected by the shooting incident at the train station. It was bustling with people, and Ye Jian even saw street performers singing and playing their own instruments. The enthusiastic songs attracted many spectators, and the guitar case placed in front of him was piled up with various denominations of banknotes.","Here, no danger was visible. The hustle and bustle would inevitably bring a smile to one’s lips, making one relaxed heart and soul.","Continuously tense, Abei finally relaxed upon entering this area, his tear-stained face now bearing a smile. Passing two pushcart-like stalls, he flicked the silver bells hanging from the stall and suddenly asked White Crane, \"Mr. Will, will he be alright?\"","After asking, he immediately withdrew his gaze from White Crane and anxiously rubbed his fingers together.","White Crane laughed and said, \"He’ll be fine. We’re the bodyguards he hired to protect him, he won’t have any problems.\"","Hearing that Mr. Will would be alright, Abei’s eyes seemed to brighten instantly. \"Really? But...\"","He thought of something, and his eyes dimmed again. White Crane and Ye Jian exchanged looks silently; White Crane smiled like a caring older brother and asked further, \"But what? You can tell us.\"","\"Cyril, he won’t easily let Mr. Will go. He still needs Mr. Will’s cargo ship to transport goods for him.\" Abei’s expression became anxious again, \"You are Mr. Will’s bodyguards, will you protect him all the time?\""]},{"number":5378,"title":"Chapter 5378 - 5379: Convergence","paragraphs":["Shipping cargo by cargo ship?","White Crane, with a determined look in his eyes, nodded seriously and answered, \"Of course, we will certainly protect Mr. Will. Wherever Mr. Will goes, we will follow.\"","Cyril kidnapped Alice Cheng, presumably to threaten Mr. Will into shipping cargo for him, but during their communications, Mr. Will did not admit it; he even made it seem like he did not recognize Cyril at all.","In reality, they knew each other, and the kidnapping of Alice Cheng was entirely due to Mr. Will’s involvement.","Since Mr. Will wasn’t forthcoming, they needed to be even more cautious in their cooperation with him. Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly and thought of Xia Jinyuan who was with Mr. Will at the moment. They should have already escaped the danger, right?","Abei’s voice reached her ears, and Ye Jian saw him point to a small, even slightly dirty, accessory shop selling local ethnic-style trinkets from Molaban and say a string of words to White Crane.","\"That is where he made the phone call. He told us to wait for him on the opposite side, and he mentioned that he is very familiar with this place and that it’s very safe here, with no danger,\" White Crane translated to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian glanced around and spoke softly, \"We can’t be too far away. Since Cyril’s people have used him to lure Mr. Will to the train station, we can’t be sure that they haven’t arranged surveillance in the places where Abei usually goes.\"","White Crane nodded slightly. They couldn’t let Abei out of their sight by too far; nearby would be fine.","A strange ringtone from a cell phone reached their ears, and they both looked at Abei, who took out his phone, glanced at it, and excitedly said, \"It’s Mr. Will, it’s Mr. Will!\"","It was a joy that stemmed from the depths of his heart, along with a deep attachment.","Ye Jian’s phone also rang; it was a call from Xia Jinyuan.","Hearing the familiar deep voice come through the phone, Ye Jian felt all the coldness between her brows melt into a spring breeze, \"How’s the situation? Is everyone safe?\"","She asked with a smile.","\"You can check for yourself whether I’m safe,\" Xia Jinyuan answered leisurely with a smile on his handsome face. \"We are on our way to find you. Mr. Will wants to meet with Abei. Where are you guys at?\"","On the other side, Abei was gesturing excitedly as he told Mr. Will where he was. After ending the call, he laughed heartily, \"Hey, Mr. Will says he’s very safe now and that he’s coming to meet me soon. Mr. Will is fine, I’m really so happy, so happy.\"","Indeed it was a joyous thing. Ye Jian, seeing a man with the smell of blood on him but no injuries, walked over with a slight smile until he got close.","Mr. Will walked even faster, and when he saw that Abei was unharmed, he patted Abei’s shoulder forcefully, \"Today, you’re alive thanks to them! Without them, you would have been shot dead by Cyril’s men by now!\"","Seeing Abei safe made Mr. Will trust even more in the abilities of the mercenaries he hired. After letting Abei bow in thanks to Ye Jian and the others, Mr. Will said to Xia Jinyuan, \"I need to leave with Abei alone for a while now. You can take a stroll around the area.\"","\"Mr. Will, you’ve just escaped danger. Are you sure you won’t be in any trouble again?\" Xia Jinyuan asked him, \"Cyril has set his sights on you, and the places you frequent might have his men around.\"","Mr. Will’s expression changed several times upon hearing this, and sensing Abei tugging quietly at his sleeve, he gritted his teeth, \"I won’t go far, and I’ll be back soon.\"","Xia Jinyuan did not immediately respond. His gaze was somewhat cold as he stared at Mr. Will until he appeared very uncomfortable.","Then Xia Jinyuan’s lips curved up into a smile, \"OK, we understand.\"","If he trusted Abei so much, then, what business was it of theirs anymore?"]},{"number":5379,"title":"Chapter 5379 - 5380: Mutation","paragraphs":["If anything, Mr. Will’s well-being had become irrelevant to them, as everything that needed to be clear was already out in the open.","Insisting on speaking alone despite the danger, it seemed there were secrets more important than life itself.","Watching the two depart, Xia Jinyuan spoke in a detached tone, \"I just took out Cyril’s ’Think Tank’ directly. Next, Cyril’s men will definitely start searching for Mr. Will everywhere. Mr. Will may collaborate with Noah again, or he might choose to work with us again to oppose Noah and rescue Alice Cheng.\"","\"Mr. Will is not trustworthy,\" Ye Jian analyzed calmly. \"He’s indecisive and has concealed many key points. He knows Cyril, yet has constantly conveyed to us that he does not. Perhaps even Noah has been deceived by him.\"","\"We need to doubt every word he says. I don’t believe he will choose to cooperate with us. You killed the bald man by Cyril’s side; Mr. Will might indeed cooperate with Noah and might even tell Cyril proactively that it was us who killed the bald man.\"","Having said that, Xia Jinyuan lightly ruffled her hair. \"Don’t forget, we were the mercenaries Mr. Will brought in. Everything we do is linked to him. He won’t turn and pledge allegiance to Cyril; as for choosing to work with Noah again, that’s a possibility.\"","But would Noah believe him? Unlikely, thought the savvy businessman Mr. Will. On the contrary, we are the ones he’d be more satisfied to trust.\"","\"Because, on the way here, Mr. Will told me that Noah has been continually threatening his family. He wants us to deal with Noah, so his family is no longer threatened by him.\"","\"As for Cyril, he expressed his willingness to cooperate, to make Cyril believe that the one who killed the bald man was Noah. On one hand there’s the man threatening his family’s safety, and on the other, are the mercenaries he hired for a hefty price, who are solely motivated by money. A wise man like Mr. Will would prefer to trust the mercenaries he hired himself.\"","Mr. Will walked through the streets with Abei, seemingly worried that Xia Jinyuan and his team would follow. He glanced back cautiously, and upon seeing that the mercenaries he had hired were standing obediently, Mr. Will breathed a sigh of relief.","Ahead, only a child of about ten years old was seen with a sack on his back, crouching on the ground, drawing incomprehensible patterns with a stick. He was engrossed in his drawing, completely absorbed in his own world.","The moment the pair passed the child, the kid, who had previously been scribbling on the ground, stood up. Ye Jian’s pupils suddenly constricted, and then, she and her comrades charged forward almost simultaneously.","\"Get down! Get down!\" Xia Jinyuan shouted harshly!","The child pulled out a black object from his bag and aimed it at Abei, who had just walked past him. Mr. Will vaguely heard Xia Jinyuan’s voice, but the environment was too noisy, with heavy metal music playing, causing him to only slightly tilt his head before continuing the conversation with Abei.","\"Bang...\"","There was a sound from behind. Mr. Will then saw Abei, who had been talking while walking by his side, suddenly stop and grimace in pain.","Another low \"bang\" sounded. Mr. Will realized something, instinctively reaching out to support Abei as he fell forward, \"Abei! Abei!\"","He yelled!","Abei, shot twice in the back, collapsed, his blood soaked his clothes in an instant."]},{"number":5380,"title":"Chapter 5380 - 5381: Cooperation","paragraphs":["From the discovery of the situation to the fall of Abei, the whole process took no more than five seconds. Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian, and White Crane, no matter how fast they reacted, were ultimately separated by a busy street full of pedestrians, making it impossible to draw their pistols in time to stop the shooting by the young boy.","Abei, hit by two bullets, fell to the ground and lay twitching in a pool of blood, blood gushing from his mouth as he apologized to the screaming Mr. Will until, with tears in his eyes, Mr. Will forgave him.","Abei smiled with blood continuously spilling from the corner of his mouth; his lips moved slightly as if he wanted to say something, but his voice was so weak that even Mr. Will, leaning in close, could not make out what he was saying.","Maybe he wanted to share some important intelligence, or perhaps express his weariness of life; but it seemed irretrievable, and in less than a minute, Abei ceased to move.","\"Abei! Abei!\" Mr. Will cried out heartrendingly, clutching the profusely bleeding Abei. White Crane, who had rushed in, caught the boy who had fired the shots and escaped slick as an eel, chopping the boy’s neck from behind. The boy, his legs kicking in the air trying to struggle free, suddenly felt a severe pain and collapsed limp in White Crane’s hands.","He directly twisted the boy’s collar, holding him up like an eagle clutching a chick and brought him in front of Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the boy, no more than eight or nine, whose actions in shooting were disturbingly expert. His eyes darkened with a thick chill, \"Watch him.\"","\"Yes,\" White Crane nodded and twisted the boy aside.","Ye Jian took responsibility for guarding the surroundings to prevent further surprise shots.","Squatting down, Xia Jinyuan closed Abei’s eyes, which still held too much attachment to the world, \"Mr. Will, we need to move to another location to talk.\"","The recent shooting hadn’t caused much of a stir; passersby didn’t even realize they had just witnessed a shooting and that a young life had permanently departed from this world with lingering attachment.","Mr. Will did not leave immediately; he held the still-warm body of Abei, his hands stained with blood, the sticky blood dripping between his fingers as he gazed at Xia Jinyuan, saying, \"Q, let us collaborate.\"","His eyes were icy cold, even despairing.","Xia Jinyuan looked back at him and did not immediately choose to trust him because of his words. He coldly observed Mr. Will, who had proposed collaboration, and after a while, his lips twitched coldly into an emotionless smile, \"I’ve always thought we were collaborating, but now, it seems, Mr. Will, that you do not think so.\"","\"No, you are not wrong; we have been collaborating all along.\" Mr. Will lifted Abei, visibly struggling, yet he did not ask Xia Jinyuan for help, only asked him to place Abei’s arm over his shoulder.","Xia Jinyuan helped him, earning a sincere apology from Mr. Will, \"Thank you, Q. I need to take this child home now. If you have time, please accompany me in taking him home.\"","\"From now on, your wages will be settled daily; I know you charge high rates, but rest assured, I have ample ability to pay.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze steadied and he did not follow Mr. Will’s steps; instead, he asked calmly from behind, \"Alice Cheng, she is with Noah now, right?\"","This time, Mr. Will did not hide and answered Xia Jinyuan, \"Yes, she’s with Noah. She knows him but pleaded with me to rescue her and her child, who are both in Noah’s hands.\""]},{"number":5381,"title":"Chapter 5381 - 5382: Going Home","paragraphs":["As Mr. Will spoke, he trudged along with heavy steps, each one feeling like it carried a thousand pounds of weight; his tall frame cloaked in melancholy, making it clear to anyone that he was a man in mourning.","He was very familiar with this place and, instead of crossing the busy streets, he followed the uneven alleyways uphill.","The slope was steep—looking from the street to the top of the alley, it rose at least forty degrees. Each step Mr. Will took seemed exceptionally laborious; Ye Jian even saw him stumble several times, nearly falling backwards.","Bright red blood trailed all the way, meandering upward with alarming splotches.","Ye Jian lowered her head slightly, silently following behind White Crane, who was walking ahead holding the boy; with Xia Jinyuan behind Mr. Will, and White Crane in the middle, Ye Jian brought up the rear.","After at least half an hour, Mr. Will stopped in front of a decrepit bungalow, instantly recognizable as a dwelling from the lower stratum of Molaban. He didn’t need to ring the doorbell, for there was no doorbell to press; instead, he nudged the iron gate, rust stained so deeply that just wiping it would leave a handful of red oxide.","The iron gate creaked open, and Mr. Will, carrying the increasingly stiff-limbed Abei, walked inside. Xia Jinyuan looked back at his comrade, gave a slight nod, and then followed inside.","The bungalow had a narrow, elongated layout so that standing by the entrance, one could see straight down to the door at the other end.","Someone inside heard the noise and rushed out from the dimly lit room. The light was too dim to see clearly, but it appeared to be a middle-aged woman whose figure had gone to seed.","\"Mr. Will, is that you?\" The middle-aged woman who ran out, perhaps because Mr. Will was holding someone, called out somewhat uncertainly yet respectfully.","Mr. Will replied softly, his voice choked with emotion, causing the middle-aged woman who was about to step forward to suddenly halt. She must have sensed something and now refused to move an inch from where she stood.","In the dark room, the figure that had not moved for a long time, the atmosphere already solidified, oppressive to the point that Ye Jian found it hard to breathe.","This was a woman in her forties, with streaks of white in her hair, a denizen of Molaban. Her hands were rough, her joints swollen—a clear testament of a life filled with hardships.","As she watched Mr. Will approach, her gaze, frozen till now, finally fell upon the person he was holding. Her lips quivered slightly as she asked in the local language, \"Who are you holding?\"","\"Abei, Abei...\" Mr. Will began, his suppressed grief flooding the dreary bungalow like a tidal wave, \"Abei, he’s already...\"","\"He’s dead, isn’t he? He’s already dead, isn’t he?\" The middle-aged woman’s voice was so faint, as frail as bubbles floating in the air, vanishing upon the slightest touch.","Mr. Will did not answer, his silence was the clearest response.","\"How did he die? Can you tell me? What exactly happened, Mr. Will, can you tell me everything?\" The trembling middle-aged woman reached out her hands, wanting to hold her son, her child... oh, her child.","She couldn’t manage to lift Abei and, with a voice of continuous woeful sobbing, told Mr. Will to lay Abei on the bed.","Just as the pale-faced Abei was placed on the bed, loud voices, those of two men laughing and talking, came from outside the cramped bungalow. One of the men, who hadn’t even entered yet, shouted from the doorway, his voice bellowing as he made his way inside."]},{"number":5382,"title":"Chapter 5382 - 5383: Sorrow","paragraphs":["Two men walked in together, holding in their hands a little boy’s White Crane; they looked to the man on the left, who was in fact the male homeowner, while the shorter man was a friend.","The male homeowner, discovering strangers in his own home, was just about to ask who these people were when he heard his wife’s sobbing. His complexion changed, and he rushed toward the room inside, but then suddenly stopped outside the door without entering.","\"Mr. Will!\" he said happily, his voice filled with respect, \"God, it’s been such a long time... Why do I smell the scent of blood?\"","The homeowner stepped into the room lit only by a small table lamp, where he saw his child, Abei, lying on the bed, pale and motionless. He could not finish his sentence as the air grew deathly silent.","Minutes later, the homeowner exploded, \"Didn’t you say you’d protect him well? What happened to protecting him well? Ah! Why, why is my child gone! Why!\"","The man grabbed Mr. Will by the collar and questioned him, one after another. At this point, he no longer saw Mr. Will as a benefactor but as an enemy who had killed his child.","Xia Jinyuan whispered to Ye Jian, \"Let’s go outside first and wait for him to deal with things.\"","Mr. Will had brought them here to show Xia Jinyuan the extent of his commitment to their cooperation.","White Crane glanced at the young boy he was still holding, \"Should we hand him over?\"","\"Keep holding him,\" Xia Jinyuan said, eyeing the boy who had not yet regained consciousness, noting that White Crane must have been quite harsh with his approach.","There was no way to not be harsh; the boy was not of age yet and didn’t blink an eye in killing someone, firing two shots and taking a life instantly, so naturally, White Crane did not show mercy.","From inside came the sounds of a one-sided fight, and Ye Jian, recognizing it as punches being thrown viciously on another person, couldn’t help but cautiously ask Xia Jinyuan beside her, \"Should we go in and stand guard? Could they... kill Mr. Will?\"","Xia Jinyuan shook his head and, taking Ye Jian by the shoulders, stood in the not so bright sunshine, \"No need, if Mr. Will dared to bring Abei here himself, then he must have the courage to bear the consequences. Abei was their child, and now that Abei is gone, Mr. Will needs to take full responsibility.\"","They had suggested to follow closely as backup but were secretly signaled by Abei to refuse, and Mr. Will hesitated for a few seconds before ultimately choosing to refuse.","Ultimately, their decision led to Abei’s death at the hands of a boy’s pistol.","The shorter man inside pulled the homeowner away, then took Mr. Will to the back of the bungalow and asked him seriously what had happened and why Abei, who had gone out in the morning, was suddenly dead.","With his face severely punched and without hitting back, Mr. Will wiped the blood at the corner of his mouth and answered the shorter man, \"Cyril’s men threatened Abei, and after Abei escaped, he met with me. A kid playing by the roadside suddenly started shooting at Abei...\"","As he explained, the sadness that seeped out of his words made the shorter man reluctant to scold him, especially upon learning that Abei had led Cyril’s men to surround Mr. Will, the shorter man instantly became silent.","\"This is not your fault, not your fault...\" the shorter man gave Mr. Will a great salute of the local ethnic groups in Molaban, then step by step returned to a bungalow not much different in layout from his own home.","About ten minutes later, the young boy that White Crane had been holding finally woke up. He was a boy who had undergone special training, and the moment he opened his eyes, they burst forth a fierce light, crystal-clear and tough as glass, as he roared at White Crane and even tried to kick towards White Crane’s crotch."]},{"number":5383,"title":"Chapter 5383 - 5384: Darkness","paragraphs":["These specially trained boys are the most inhumane and brutal characteristic of the evil forces in Molaban, taking pleasure in abducting young children to primarily train them with a diet of raw meat from a very young age.","Xia Jinyuan had seen such boys in the carbao rings; they looked very ordinary, indistinguishable from normal children, but that was only on the surface. In reality, these little boys started with killing rats using the knives in their hands, gradually moving up to rabbits, cats, dogs, and other animals. Growing up with blood-stained hands, by the time they could use pistols to kill people, they had completely turned into killing machines for these evil forces.","The struggling little boy in White Crane’s grasp was a killing machine; his world had no color, only the color of blood. His daily activity consisted of only one thing: killing.","Seeing the brutality in the little boy’s eyes, White Crane slightly furrowed his brow, \"Let’s hand him over to the police for handling.\"","\"Years ago, the police rescued two little boys from somewhere and sent them to an orphanage. Later, the twelve children who shared a room with them were all killed in their sleep. The murder weapon was two fine knives stolen from the orphanage’s kitchen,\" said White Crane.","\"Handing them to the police, the police might place them in an orphanage,\" said Xia Jinyuan.","After Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, Ye Jian felt a chill down her spine, \"What should we do then?\"","\"Give him to Mr. Will,\" Xia Jinyuan answered indifferently, \"He killed Abei; let Mr. Will handle it. We don’t need to get involved.\"","Ye Jian fell silent, handing him over to Mr. Will... Would the little boy have any chance of survival?","\"You haven’t seen them kill. If you had, you would find that killing is as simple for them as eating is for us,\" Xia Jinyuan said, sensing the reluctance in Ye Jian’s silence.","If it were an adult man, Ye Jian would definitely not have any objections, but now it was a little boy, a child who would still be pampering in the presence of his parents in the Chinese context, whose life should still be long and filled with sunshine.","She was wrong, she thought incorrectly.","From the start of their training, these little boys’ lives were destined to be bloody and stormy, with no glimpse of sunshine. It was futile to think of using education to change them. Those who had been killing since childhood had already had their nature altered; releasing them would only result in more people dying at their hands.","In the end, the little boy was handed over to Mr. Will. Xia Jinyuan, seeing the haggard Mr. Will, asked him, \"Although we do not wish to see this outcome, it has already happened. What are your plans now? Cyril, who could kill Abei today, could just as well kill you tomorrow.\"","Mr. Will, looking at another unconscious murderer, said hoarsely, \"I need to properly bury Abei first, you guys go back to the hotel! I’ll come to see you after I’m done.\"","After a pause, he asked, \"Now, can you believe in the sincerity of my cooperation?\"","Xia Jinyuan watched him for a long while before shaking his head, \"No, we can’t talk about trust yet. Take care of Abei’s affairs first, then we’ll have a serious talk.\"","\"I want to remind Mr. Will, we just arrived in Molaban, where you solemnly told us it’s chaotic and the environment complicated, and that we should never let our guard down. Yet today, you felt relaxed,\" said Xia Jinyuan.","\"I’m glad that you’ve already paid me the earlier commission in full,\" said Mr. Will with a wry smile.","\"I know, this mistake was my fault. You guys go back to the hotel. I’ll come find you later,\" said Mr. Will."]},{"number":5384,"title":"Chapter 5384 - 5385: Negotiation","paragraphs":["Without lingering any longer, the three of them returned to the place where Abei had been shot and died, and rendezvoused with G3 and Z7, after which the five of them split into two taxis and headed back to the hotel.","After arriving at the hotel, it wasn’t until they entered the room T6 had been waiting in that K7 and V8, who were already there, saw their comrades return from the mission. Relief was clearly visible on their faces.","As soon as the door closed, T6 immediately asked, \"What exactly happened? We just saw the report on TV; the train station was in chaos, with countless casualties.\"","Z7, who already knew the full story, spoke in a grave tone without letting Xia Jinyuan open his mouth, \"A mole by Mr. Will’s side was killed by Cyril, and Cyril knows Mr. Will. Mr. Will is planning to collaborate with us, whether it’s to take out Cyril or Noah is yet to be decided.\"","\"The situation is escalating and becoming increasingly grim for us. Cyril has already taken notice of us. King Q, we need to have a thorough discussion and come up with a plan to divert Cyril’s attention.\"","\"We can’t just sit around and wait to be eliminated anymore, we need to take the initiative and figure out a way to rattle the guy in the hotel, make him believe Cyril secretly killed his man. That way, we’ll have a chance to rescue Alice Cheng and strike a fatal blow to Noah.\"","After all, Cyril wasn’t their target in this operation, Noah was.","\"Should we inform Mr. Will before we act? What is he doing now? Why didn’t he come back with you?\" T6 looked at Xia Jinyuan and asked.","Xia Jinyuan, who was twisting the cap off a bottle of mineral water, glanced up to see T6 looking at him, handed the bottle to Ye Jian after opening it, and answered coolly, \"He’s dealing with some things and will come to the hotel later. Let’s make our own plans first, everybody sit closer. Let’s hear any ideas you might have.\"","Hearing this, the comrades gathered around. Z7, with a somber expression, was the first to offer his idea, \"Based on what’s been said, since Cyril has noticed us already, I think we should take preemptive action and try to get Cyril under control first, then see if we can get any clues from him.\"","He shifted the focus to Cyril, who posed a danger to them.","Ye Jian didn’t quite agree. Just as she was about to speak, she heard V8 say in a deep voice, \"Your idea coincides with mine. Instead of waiting for him to come to us, it’s better to eliminate a known threat first, to avoid any unexpected complications.\"","\"This time, if we act, we must do it swiftly and cleanly, not like before where we ended up inadvertently benefiting others.\"","The reference was to the difficult rescue of Alice Cheng, who ultimately fell into Noah’s hands.","This time T6 didn’t speak first, indicating he may have different opinions from his two comrades.","G3 said, \"I have a thought, let me know if it sounds feasible. Cyril is already suspicious of us, right? So he will surely soon become aware of our hotel. Hasn’t there been no movement at the hotel side all this time?\"","After pausing and looking around at everyone, seeing a flicker of interest in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, he continued slowly, \"Could we perhaps lure Cyril here and let him clash with Noah right in the hotel, and then we reap the benefits after their conflict?\"","\"This aligns with the initial plan by King Q, with the only difference being that we need to lure Cyril to the hotel.\"","Among the views of the three comrades, Ye Jian was more inclined to agree with G3. Luring them to the hotel indeed seemed like a good strategy."]},{"number":5385,"title":"Chapter 5385 - 5386: Formulating","paragraphs":["The hotel was Noah’s turf, and Xia Jinyuan believed it feasible to use Cyril’s help to simultaneously destroy Noah’s place.","Given Cyril’s nature of repaying a small slight with a large revenge, demolishing a hotel should be simple.","T6 agreed this time, leaning toward Plan G3, \"G3’s idea is excellent, achieving two birds with one stone!\"","He expressed his thoughts, \"Cyril is not our final target; there’s no need to confront him directly. This is Molaban, where Cyril has a massive influence. We are only eight people and have already let him know, making it too dangerous to eliminate Cyril first.\"","The usually aloof K7 spoke up, \"G3, that works.\"","V8 and Z7 nodded simultaneously.","\"Then we need to plan carefully how to provoke Cyril into moving against Noah in the hotel,\" Xia Jinyuan said with a cool smile. He was a captain who listened to his comrades’ opinions and encouraged them to voice their thoughts. This way, their understanding of each other would deepen.","G3’s idea was also key to establishing cooperation with Mr. Will; here, Mr. Will needed to step forward.","\"We have a location we can utilize well, a place Mr. Will has taken us to before,\" Ye Jian said slyly.","\"The auction house! Right! How could I forget such an important clue? According to what Mr. Will told us before, the auction house, being one of the main economic sources for Cyril, is highly valued by him. If we blow it up, what do you think Cyril’s reaction will be?\" V8 clapped and laughed, \"This time, we’re in the dark, and Mr. Will leads Noah there, wouldn’t that be perfect?\"","\"Needless to say, he will definitely come looking in a fury,\" T6 laughed with his face full of schemes. \"Mr. Will wants to cooperate with us, right? We can do that, his sincerity lies in making Cyril meet Noah!\"","\"Excellent! That’s the exact effect we want, and next, we just watch them fight each other,\" he added.","\"Mr. Will has a critical role in our plan. We need to have a good chat with him first.\"","\"He wants to get rid of Noah and Cyril even more than we do. He probably doesn’t even want to stay in Molaban anymore.\"","The comrades took turns talking, their faces not showing a hint of nervousness or fear, only composure, calm, and wisdom. They would plan timely according to the daily changes, not allowing any information to slip.","When it was time for an attack, they would never back down. When it was time to retract their sharpness, they would certainly hide themselves carefully, revealing no trace of their actions.","Ye Jian felt that each time she fought alongside her comrades, she improved in every aspect.","After more than an hour of debate, discussion, and rehearsal, the Snow Region Brigade’s members had finally devised a dual-purpose strategy. Once the tasks were clearly delegated, each member of the Snow Region Brigade acted in an orderly fashion.","The most critical, Mr. Will arrived at the hotel in the evening, sneaking in without Noah noticing him.","However, at this time, Noah didn’t have the spare time to monitor Mr. Will. His two male soldiers had been killed, and he needed to manage the aftermath properly.","Noah was also on a mission but suffered the loss of soldiers during the final roundup. They wanted to access the surveillance footage at the train station, but the local police wanted to downplay the incident and had already destroyed all the footage, leaving no possibility of restoration.","Suspecting both the mercenaries and Cyril, Noah had the worst day since entering Molaban."]},{"number":5386,"title":"Chapter 5386 - 5387: Conversation","paragraphs":["Mr. Will contacted Xia Jinyuan around eleven o’clock in the evening and, for caution to avoid being discovered by Noah, suggested they meet outside the hotel. Xia Jinyuan gladly agreed.","Inside the hotel, T6, V8, and K7 continued their surveillance, while Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian, White Crane, and G3 left the hotel to meet Mr. Will. During their meeting, Mr. Will confessed his relationship with Noah to Xia Jinyuan and revealed that his family had been threatened by Noah’s men. Thus, he was compelled and unable to resist.","As for why Alice Cheng knew Noah, Mr. Will was silent for a long time before he answered, \"That night, realizing that Alice knew Noah shocked me more than anyone else.\"","\"I felt deceived, played by my own friend like a fool, and it even got my family threatened.\"","\"It wasn’t until Alice angrily condemned Noah for his betrayal in the car that I realized she too was being coerced; her child is still in Noah’s hands. If she doesn’t obey Noah’s arrangements, her child will be killed by Noah.\"","\"Do you believe every word Alice has said?\" Xia Jinyuan asked, \"Can you confirm that every word she said is without any problems? Also, her child, do you really believe that he’s in Noah’s hands?\"","After several probing questions, Mr. Will was unable to immediately respond. After a while, he bowed his head and tirelessly rubbed his face, \"I don’t know, I truly don’t know, my life has become a mess since Noah arrived.\"","\"Whether Alice has deceived me is no longer important. What’s important now is that I want my life to return to peace, wanting my wife and my two children to be free from harm.\"","Ye Jian suddenly spoke, interrupting Mr. Will coldly, \"It’s not about getting hurt; they could kill your wife and your two children at any moment.\"","Mr. Will, still bending over, looked up fiercely, \"No, no, I won’t let them harm my family. So, we need to collaborate! We need to join forces.\"","\"I have money, lots and lots of money. You help me kill Noah and Cyril, and all the problems will be resolved! Everything will be solved.\"","He had had enough of his current life. Every day was not a joy but a torment, living in constant fear of his family being killed or himself being murdered.","Xia Jinyuan could see how desperately Mr. Will wanted to escape the threats, but still, he needed to \"boil the frog in warm water,\" making Mr. Will even more afraid to succeed.","\"Your brother died protecting Cyril. Baldy said that Cyril didn’t kill you because of your brother’s sake, Mr. Will. Do you think Baldy is right? Do you think Cyril will spare you just because your brother once saved his life? I’m sorry, but I was surprised to hear Baldy’s words when I was rescuing you today.\"","\"Cyril, I don’t think he will let you off easily just because your brother saved him once. Killing Abei was already a warning to you. From your friends next to you, one by one will be killed because of you, Mr. Will. As long as you do not bow down to Cyril, he will keep killing, until all your friends and family are dead.\"","\"However, I think you wouldn’t just watch your friends and family be all killed. You will quickly nod in agreement, and from then on, become Cyril’s slave. Your family, your children, all becoming slaves in his hands. Mr. Will, do you like such a life?\""]},{"number":5387,"title":"Chapter 5387 - 5388 Deployment","paragraphs":["Do you enjoy a life constantly threatened by others? Do you like it when your family lives in fear every moment of every day?","No, absolutely no one likes that!","Mr. Will clenched his fist, slowly, fiercely, with a cold and hard response, \"I don’t like it! I’ve had enough! I need you to help me put an end to all this! I need your help!\"","He needed help urgently, and he couldn’t wait any longer!","Abei’s death had made him fully aware that he had to do something. Abei’s death had also told him that Cyril would not let him go.","The bald man was dead, killed by the mercenaries he had hired, taking out one of Cyril’s important henchmen. There was no turning back for him now; he could only move forward.","He looked at his own mercenaries and with the most determined voice he could muster, he made his resolution known, \"For my family, I must eliminate all threats! As long as you can help me, I will provide weapons, I will cooperate with you in anything!\"","As he spoke, Mr. Will slightly turned his body and took out a bank card from his pocket, \"200,000 USD, I think you’ll need it.\"","A commission of 200,000 USD, on top of the previous two payments, made Ye Jian blink in surprise. Mr. Will certainly was a wealthy man.","Xia Jinyuan, who was never short of money, smiled as he accepted the bank card, \"Mr. Will’s sincerity always touches me, and for its sake...\"","In his smile lurked a trace of ferocity as Xia Jinyuan said something that made Mr. Will’s heart skip a beat, almost making him want to slam the table.","He said, \"Kill Noah, and we can ask Cyril for help.\"","How they would help and what Mr. Will needed to do left him bursting with excitement!","\"Wait for my message; I will arrange everything very, very well. I will make sure Noah obediently follows me to the auction, and I will convince Cyril that the one who killed the bald man wasn’t someone else, it was Noah, the man who threatened me!\"","This was Mr. Will’s promise to Xia Jinyuan. How he would do it, that was Mr. Will’s own business.","After he left, Ye Jian, who didn’t quite trust him, said softly, \"Is he reliable? I still have some doubts about Mr. Will.\"","\"All he can do now is rely on us. Neither Noah nor Cyril will let him have it easy. We don’t need to trust him too much, we just need to let Noah know that his good days in Molaban are over,\" G3 chuckled in response to Ye Jian, glancing at Xia Jinyuan before adding, \"What’s important is that we need to draw the attention of the country Noah represents to us, so that it’ll be easier for our comrades to carry out the scientist’s rescue.\"","In other words, Xia Jinyuan’s combat plan had taken into account the comrades on another mission as well, even though he was in Molaban, he could still strategize and engage in battles thousands of miles away.","This was the prowess of Xia Jinyuan; as the Captain of the Snow Region Brigade and the \"King\" of all Special Forces, he knew that danger and sacrifice were constant threats to his comrades. But he would do his utmost to address these dangers, ensuring that every comrade on mission returned home safely.","In the days that followed, Mr. Will did not reappear, yet he reported to Xia Jinyuan everything he did and where he went. V8, secretly tracking him, relayed Mr. Will’s movements without any discrepancies.","Only then did Ye Jian start to believe what Mr. Will had said.","On the fourth day after Mr. Will left the hotel, he told Xia Jinyuan that it was time to act.","The Special Forces involved in the scientist’s rescue also identified the target location, commencing their meticulous operational plan. Both teams were in different countries, yet they coordinated seamlessly, displaying the unmatched expertise of the Snow Region Brigade’s Special Forces."]},{"number":5388,"title":"Chapter 5388: Bait","paragraphs":["On the fourth night, the Special Forces, carrying the \"carefully\" prepared \"present\" for Cyril, began their final plan: to blow up Cyril’s auction hall. Ye Jian was responsible for sniping to create chaos, while her comrades coordinated with each other to leave the scene.","As the last streak of twilight faded from the sky and night fell quietly, Xia Jinyuan led his comrades from the hotel’s underground parking lot, driving a van straight to the auction hall.","The auction house, set in the suburbs, seemed very quiet without the bustle of the city, but it was entirely surrounded by heavily armed guards on patrol. The illegal auction was to begin at nine o’clock that night, and the area would be heavily guarded to prevent any disturbances.","Mr. Will, arriving in the village, was vigilant all the way, noticing the strict security. He couldn’t help but worry, but since he was with Noah, he had no way to immediately inform Xia Jinyuan. All he could do was pray that the mercenaries he had hired would discover any threats beforehand and not be detected by Cyril’s men before they even started.","Looking at Noah, who accompanied him, Mr. Will couldn’t help but sneer coldly at his stern expression.","In order to hook Noah and to temporarily convince Cyril of his defection, he had given Cyril all four famous paintings he had once bought in an underground market in Noah’s country.","The four paintings came from the Gardner Botanical Garden. Ninety years ago, thieves disguised as police officers stole thirteen paintings from the museum in a single theft, including one of the thirty-six known works by a 17th-century master, which had remained undiscovered since the theft. No one knew that he had purchased four of the stolen paintings.","This time, he had given all four to Cyril. Cyril, who had an eye for art, upon seeing the paintings, exhibited a greed like that of a ravenous wolf. Taking possession of the paintings, he let out word the next day, which led to tonight’s auction.","He had spent a large sum of money back then. Six years later, the black market value of the paintings had increased thirty-six fold. Given Cyril’s greed, he would sell them to those insanely passionate and wealthy collectors at even higher prices.","Tonight, Cyril only took out two of the paintings for auction. Depending on tonight’s auction results and the collectors’ frenzy, he would re-determine the prices for the other two.","The greedy but shrewd Cyril regarded this auction highly, and with his goatee, he seemed to already envision piles of money stacking up before his eyes.","Noah, stern-faced, had been seething since learning that four of the thirteen paintings stolen from his country in the nineties had ended up in Cyril’s hands and two were to be auctioned off tonight. His mood was as if he’d been dunked in cold water in the dead of winter, impossible to warm up.","The car slowly entered the village, and Noah, with a dark expression, asked Mr. Will once more, \"Are you sure it’s really in his possession? Are you really sure?\"","\"I’m very sure. You can personally verify whether my information is accurate. Only two paintings are being auctioned off tonight; Cyril is keeping the other two for another auction. You have plenty of time to confirm the truth,\" replied Mr. Will casually, pleased at the thought of using the four famous paintings to rid his family of all troubles.","He spoke lightly, but Noah was anything but relaxed. Hearing this, his expression turned furious, and he growled in a low voice, \"You don’t understand anything! The thirteen paintings have been missing for fifteen years. We’ve been searching all this time without a clue!\"","\"Now we finally have one, and you’re telling me two of the paintings are being auctioned tonight! Once those vampire-like collectors buy them, they’ll disappear again, who knows where!\""]},{"number":5389,"title":"Chapter 5389 - 5388: Hooked","paragraphs":["Noah’s emotions were fluctuating, but the ferocity that burst from his hazel eyes not only failed to scare Mr. Will—it actually gave him a burst of pleasure.","Hahaha, look, look, it’s finally this damn creature’s turn to worry, the one who constantly threatens the safety of his family!","Hahaha, it’s finally their turn!","More things to worry about would follow, and the mercenaries he’d hired would surely not disappoint him! They definitely wouldn’t!","Noah was still growling lowly, his neck reddening with the effort, \"Did you know long ago that the painting was in his possession and deliberately waited until now to tell me?! Damn it, you did that on purpose, right?!\"","The thought of two paintings being auctioned off tonight made Noah’s emotions even more uncontrollable.","He suspected that Mr. Will did it deliberately!","Yes, that’s right, Mr. Will did it on purpose, but how could he possibly tell Noah it was deliberate? And how could he tell someone threatening his family’s safety that all four famous paintings were handed over to Cyril?","With a darkened expression, Mr. Will scoffed coldly, \"If I were doing it on purpose, I wouldn’t have told you that Cyril has the paintings stolen from your country in his hands. I’m not interested in the paintings; my only hope is that you don’t harm Alice Cheng, don’t harm her children!\"","When Alice Cheng was mentioned, Noah’s suspicions gradually ebbed.","Mr. Will’s efforts to save Alice Cheng were well known to Noah, who fell silent and sat quietly in the car, his lips pressed tightly, until he got out.","He didn’t want to clash with Cyril, but reality left him no choice.","To retrieve the stolen paintings of his country, he was bound to have a vicious fight with Cyril. He hoped that the reinforcement brothers would arrive in Molaban soon, and that they could bring all four paintings back to their country.","As Noah continued to pray inwardly, he saw the tight security nearby and sent a text message to his soldiers, instructing them to be careful to stay hidden and not to be discovered.","Wireless communication devices couldn’t be taken into the auction, and Cyril was too cunning. Everyone entering the venue, including collectors coming tonight, would be searched and signal jammers installed. Once inside the venue, there was no way to contact the outside, leaving Noah helpless to pass messages to his soldiers outside.","While he could still inform his soldiers that the village was heavily guarded, Mr. Will couldn’t inform Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan, sitting in the car, watched as the night outside grew deeper, his right hand lightly holding Ye Jian’s left, a few strands of coldness woven into his handsome face.","Everyone in the car was silent, with their eyes closed to rest, conserving energy to best complete the most important task of the night.","Although the journey from the city to the district was long, smooth traffic meant they arrived in one and a half hours. Last time they had come openly with Mr. Will, this time, they drove directly into the forest and then stealthily entered the village.","Ye Jian noticed that tonight Cyril had heightened the security around the village more than the last time; even before they approached the village, she spotted two groups of heavily armed bandits on patrol. She whispered, \"The security for the auction this evening seems to be taken much more seriously by Cyril than last time; he’s assigned at least three times more manpower for security.\"","\"An auction for four paintings lost for fifteen years, with incalculable value—anyone would add to their manpower.\" Xia Jinyuan chuckled softly and asked Ye Jian, \"Do you feel the pressure? Are you nervous?\"","Ye Jian smiled and shook her head, \"Not at all, I’m actually looking forward to it. I just hope that the more chaotic it gets here, the more it can somehow help our comrades with the reception task.\""]},{"number":5390,"title":"Chapter 5390: Infiltration","paragraphs":["Compared to the comrades from another operational group, Ye Jian knew the dangers their group faced were significantly less. The other group was up against an entire country, and without much thought, one could tell just how perilous their comrades’ situation was.","\"There won’t be many, but there will be some effect,\" said Xia Jinyuan lightly as he clasped Ye Jian’s hand. A line of eight people infiltrated the village under the cover of night.","T6, who had been recovering for a week, had not fully healed yet, with a broken rib that needed at least twenty days to heal. Now, only a week had passed, and it was still the recovery period, so he was tasked with guarding the route of retreat and providing communication.","Z7, who usually handled communications, temporarily took over T6’s operational role, as they switched positions for the time being.","In the quiet village where one could hear the nocturnal insects chirping, Ye Jian, hidden in the darkness, listened to the insects that knew no national borders and faintly felt as if she were back in her home country.","\"Four o’clock direction, five meters, sentry, avoid,\" came a whisper.","\"Roger that.\"","\"Roger that...\"","\"Entering the designated area, ready for action.\"","\"Roger that... have entered the designated area.\"","As several shadows continued to move stealthily, avoiding numerous sentries, they all reached the designated area, ready to take action. V8, responsible for reconnaissance, suddenly crouched down and, after carefully observing for a few seconds, chuckled softly, \"We must have run into Noah’s men. Mr. Will really did things right this time.\"","\"Ten o’clock direction, two targets, need to take them out?\" he asked Xia Jinyuan.","Hiding behind the bushes, Xia Jinyuan almost simultaneously spotted shadows flitting by in the ten o’clock direction. \"Do not alarm them yet, all teams be alert and ready for action.\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Cover!\"","\"Guard!\"","Quiet footsteps barely audible passed by as shadows moved like ghosts, avoiding sentries. Xia Jinyuan at the base of a three-meter-tall wall corner, G3 took a running start, stepped onto Xia Jinyuan’s hands raised on his knees, and with the help of Xia Jinyuan’s hands, G3 swiftly climbed the three-meter-high wall. K7 followed, stepping onto Xia Jinyuan’s hands, and with G3’s help above, also scaled the wall within seconds.","Once both comrades reached the top of the wall, G3 hung upside down, and Xia Jinyuan took a few running steps, stepped on the wall, then grabbed G3’s hands. Both men managed to climb up to the wall corner.","T6 ascended next. Considering his injury, he wasn’t asked to take a running start. Z7, carrying the wireless communication equipment, lifted T6, allowing the comrades above to help him, and quickly T6 too succeeded in scaling the wall corner.","V8, responsible for the surrounding vigilance, was the last one to go up, and in less than a minute and a half, all eight had infiltrated.","Avoiding sentry after sentry, each member worked together, each finding the best position for themselves.","Mr. Will indeed had some skills; the arms and equipment provided were exceptionally comprehensive. He knew how strictly guarded the auction would be, and supplied Xia Jinyuan with a full range of military-grade equipment, including things like infrared devices.","In Molaban, as long as you have money, arms dealers can supply you with any equipment you need.","Avoiding sentry after sentry, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, responsible for the operation, slipped through a door card and quickly crossed paths until they infiltrated the inner perimeter of the auction site.","Illegal trading sites almost always like to set up underground points, and Cyril was no exception. From the outside, his place of business showed no signs of trouble. The underground trading point was built ten meters below the ground, divided into inner and outer areas, with a total of four entrances and exits: a hidden door, a side door, an entrance, and an exit.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian infiltrated through the hidden door, which was also the most time-consuming spot."]},{"number":5391,"title":"Chapter 5391 - 5191: Thrilling","paragraphs":["The auction was conducted indoors this time, unlike the last time which was held outdoors, showing how much Cyril valued this auction.","They infiltrated through a secret door and reached a side door, the same one the bald man had exited last time, a very ordinary wooden door with a regular lock. After confirming there was no issue inside with an infrared scan, Xia Jinyuan inserted a wire into the keyhole and gently jiggled it a few times to unlock it.","The lock was opened, but the door remained still.","Xia Jinyuan gently pushed, but there was no movement; the door had a bolt lock inside, which was troublesome.","\"There’s a bolt lock,\" Xia Jinyuan signaled quietly, and Ye Jian’s eyebrows immediately furrowed.","Bolt locks are most vulnerable to vertical bolts; they can be unlocked but take extra time.","After confirming there was no heat signature inside and that the wooden door was joined by planks with large gaps between them—large enough to insert a kukri knife—Xia Jinyuan took the knife and inserted it into the gaps at the bottom of the door, slowly moving it upward.","When the knife reached the middle of the door, he encountered an obstacle that must have been the bolt. Xia Jinyuan gently fiddled with the knife. After about 2 minutes without success, they heard footsteps approaching.","This was a hallway with no way to retreat and nowhere to hide; the two of them instantly tensed up, holding their breath, ready to react at any moment.","The footsteps grew closer, and they could even see flickering light.","All of a sudden, Xia Jinyuan uttered in Molaban’s language, \"Who’s there! Stop, don’t move.\"","It was commanding and immediately fooled the three people approaching, making them think they had encountered patrolling allies.","Xia Jinyuan promptly turned on his flashlight, set the light to its brightest, gave Ye Jian a meaningful glance, and with a cold expression, Ye Jian stepped forward with her military kukri knife towards the three temporarily fooled and motionless people.","In a few seconds, someone asked them which group they belonged to.","Who knew which group they belonged to? The two quickened their pace, blinding the three standing men with the intense light, and Ye Jian suddenly leaped forward, while Xia Jinyuan turned off the bright light and rushed forward as well.","\"Hey...\"","The three unprepared men never expected that they were not facing comrades but the God of Death himself.","It’s no wonder they were caught off guard; there was no sign of disturbance outside, so how could there be an issue inside?","With one swift motion, almost simultaneously, the man in the middle was not immediately taken down, but Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian quickly handled the men on either side.","Without waiting for the others to react, one covered a man’s mouth while another’s kukri knife slit his throat, swiftly handling the three targets within seconds.","After finishing, both exhaled softly, and Xia Jinyuan whispered, \"You stand guard here while I go pry open the door.\"","\"Okay,\" Ye Jian nodded slightly; stationed there, she could react immediately if she spotted trouble, ensuring the safety of her teammate moving behind her.","Xia Jinyuan hastened his steps back to the door with the bolt, searching once again for the bolt’s position. About five minutes later, after some quiet clinking sounds, he wiped the slight sweat from his forehead and retracted the knife from the door gap.","He gently pushed the wooden door, and the previously sealed door finally opened, creaking with slightly rusty friction, and G3 and the others followed the sound.","Opening their light sources, they faced a narrow, long wooden staircase, and the two proceeded one after the other, step by step, cautiously treading up the stairs.","The interior was pitch-black, so dark they couldn’t see their fingers in front of them; they took out the small flashlights they carried, and the faint light illuminated the steps beneath Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian."]},{"number":5392,"title":"Chapter 5392 - 5192: Tricky","paragraphs":["As they nearly reached the end of the staircase, faint snoring sounds came their way. Xia Jinyuan slowly peeked out and saw two guards clinging to their pistols, fast asleep against the wall.","Xia Jinyuan gestured to Ye Jian for a split and clear motion, swiftly approached one of the guards, and directly slashed at his throat, sending the poor man into an eternal slumber.","\"To the left is the auction stand, and to the right are the small booths where the buyers sit,\" Xia Jinyuan pointed inside and said, \"There’s likely nothing important in the booths on the right. We should focus on the left, Mr. Will suspects there might be a hidden basement there, possibly storing contraband or the artifacts to be auctioned.\"","If they destroyed this place, Cyril would go mad.","Guided by the faint light emitted from the flashlight, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian carefully made their way to the auction stand they had seen that day. Ye Jian specifically noted that the entire tabletop was made of solid wood and whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"This must be Cyril’s favorite spot.\"","Her tone was relaxed, and her demeanor equally so, devoid of any tension.","Seeing her speak so casually about other matters, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile, \"After this is over, I’ll allow you to stand here for a minute to soak it in.\"","\"Thank you, Captain, but I don’t like it,\" Ye Jian quickly pulled back, realizing this was Cyril’s favorite spot, not hers.","Who knows how many Chinese artifacts this guy standing here had illegally auctioned off!","She retreated to Xia Jinyuan’s side. Xia Jinyuan casually handed her the dim flashlight, signaling Ye Jian to illuminate for him.","Taking the flashlight, Ye Jian directed the light onto the heavy drapes suspended above, which Mr. Will had mentioned were worth examining.","The two of them tiptoed to the front of the auction stand’s curtain. Xia Jinyuan slowly pulled the curtain on the left, revealing just a concrete wall with nothing unusual. When he pulled open the curtain on the right, they exchanged glances.","Behind the right curtain was a wall with a bulletproof steel door, firmly closed with two bank vault-like combination locks in front of them.","Xia Jinyuan gently pushed on it to no avail, knowing just a simple push wouldn’t open the door.","He listened closely at the door but couldn’t hear any sound from inside. After checking for heat sources with a thermal imager, T6 whispered, \"No heat sources, entry possible.\"","Cracking the combination lock was no hard task for Xia Jinyuan while Ye Jian kept watch. Xia Jinyuan checked whether he could successfully unlock it.","On the side, T6 could see the silhouettes of the two through the thermal imager—one standing guard, the other one fiddling with his arm. Suppressing his voice, he spoke somewhat boastfully, \"King Q, this time you’re teamed up with Azure Bird, don’t embarrass yourself. A mere lock like this, if it were me, I’d crack it in three minutes.\"","Opening the lock wasn’t really a problem for them, though it usually required some tools. Xia Jinyuan wasn’t provoked by T6, nor did he immediately go for the lock. After a careful inspection, he said calmly, \"Not enough tools, can’t open it. If I tamper with the first digit, the alarm control mainframe will immediately send an alert through the wireless network.\"","Cyril was careful, having installed the safest bank vault locks. It required three password groups to open the door and, moreover, entering the wrong password for the first digit would instantly trigger the alarm. Without the appropriate tools, Xia Jinyuan refrained from tampering with the lock as any rash action was unwise at the moment.","As for the action... they also couldn’t open the lock."]},{"number":5393,"title":"Chapter 5393 - 5193: Chaos","paragraphs":["The comrades waiting outside for the two to return heard the news and realized that the treasures Cyril had hidden here wouldn’t be touched tonight. They all felt it was a pity.","However, Ye Jian said, \"What’s inside might not necessarily be illegally obtained relics, our only goal is one thing. It would be great to make Cyril spit blood, but since we can’t now, let’s just blow it up.\"","\"Such a pity! I was thinking of taking a few pieces back to our country.\" T6 shook his head, feeling very disappointed. After seeing cultural relics stolen from Chinese territories being illegally auctioned last time, T6 had been hoping to help recover any Chinese cultural artifacts and bring them back to China.","He had come with great hopes, and now, knowing that there was no way to unlock and check, his face showed his disappointment as he took a deep breath, a fierce look flashing in his eyes, \"Then let’s get started, no more dilly-dallying.\"","It’s not only T6 who was disappointed; Ye Jian felt the same. But what could be done?","Xia Jinyuan, as the team captain, understood his comrades’ feelings at this moment very well. They had come here excited at the thought of recovering some cultural relics. Reality, however, had prevented them from doing so.","After a few seconds of silence, he said to Ye Jian, who was still staring at the steel door, \"Set up the explosives both inside and outside, and later in the small chamber outside too. Since we can’t see what exactly is inside, it’s better to destroy this place.\"","Ye Jian, who had gathered her thoughts, nodded, \"Mm.\"","Having said that, they put down their backpacks and quickly got to work.","Inside the backpacks were time bombs provided by Mr. Will, extremely powerful, just three of which could level this place.","They quickly set all the time bombs in place. On their way back, they took up a lot of time, having to avoid both Cyril’s sentries and the soldiers brought by Noah. The two alternated their movements, front and back, until they emerged, drenched in sweat.","Noah’s soldiers were still keeping watch nearby; they needed to watch if anyone would come out from inside, if those coming out were carrying auctioned famous paintings, and to keep a vigilant eye on the surroundings to avoid being discovered.","Inside the auction house, White Crane and G3, who had taken out two guards and disguised themselves, kept a tight watch on their surroundings until the lights in the auction hall flickered three times. Unable to maintain contact with the outside, the two knew it was their cue to act.","One famous painting had already been auctioned off, and the second one hadn’t been brought to the stage yet. After the auction hall’s lights flickered three times, they suddenly went out, followed immediately by the sound of gunfire.","Upon hearing the gunshots, Noah’s heart suddenly tightened, and then he heard Mr. Will exclaim in surprise, \"Is someone trying to steal the famous paintings?\"","Steal... the paintings?","Noah’s heart tightened and a look of joy flashed across his face as he whispered, \"Let’s move, get out of here.\"","As the gunshots rang out again, sounding as if they were to his right and then as if they were to his left, Noah didn’t wait to fully assess the situation before Mr. Will exclaimed again, \"God, someone is running towards the stage!\"","Noah, already on his feet, did not wait for Mr. Will to say anything more. With his expression tense, he disregarded the warning and crouched down heading towards the guard he had been watching earlier. Passing a few seats, he spoke a few words, and several more people stood up.","The suddenly darkened auction hall wasn’t chaotic; Cyril’s people constantly shouted loudly for everyone to stay calm, sit tight, and not to move, assuring that they would find the two who had fired the shots. White Crane and G3 caused more chaos by firing towards the auction stage again. As the gunshots continued, many people began to grow restless.","Meanwhile, Cyril, who was sitting calmly backstage, actually started to laugh. Mr. Will was indeed not wrong; someone had come to steal the paintings. Did someone really think they could steal a painting from him?"]},{"number":5394,"title":"Chapter 5394: Instigation","paragraphs":["Cyril was not a simple man, and even without Mr. Will’s reminder, he knew well that revealing he had several famous paintings in hand would inevitably tempt certain individuals to plot mischiefs. Cyril was prepared for the possibility of his paintings being auctioned off, and anyone who dared attempt to steal them would be met with lethal force.","Even amidst chaos within the venue, with Cyril in control, the situation wouldn’t devolve too far. Just as Noah and his team were about to act, suddenly, a massive roar like that of a volcanic eruption reverberated, and the entire place shook violently as if hit by an earthquake.","\"What’s going on?\"","Cyril, still pleased with his arrangements, steadied himself against the heavy wooden table and shouted angrily, \"Go outside and see what the hell is happening!\"","It wasn’t an earthquake; it was the shaking caused by a bomb detonation, and it was nearby!","The bomb’s power was considerable; it shook the venue so hard that the crystal chandeliers overhead clanged loudly. Countless shards of glass plummeted, instantly injuring several bodyguards of the collectors who had brought them.","Not a single collector under protection was injured, just slightly disheveled.","\"Damn it, Cyril, what crimes have you committed? Why has such a disastrously terrible thing happened tonight? Damn it, you’re a total failure this evening!\"","\"Right now, I seriously doubt your sincerity in holding this auction. Did you not intend to auction at all, but rather just make fools of us?\"","...","The collectors who had come started to show their discontent. They brought money to bid on the paintings, and it was on Cyril’s account that they chose to believe in him and come here.","And the result?","Damn it all!","One moment it’s gunfire, the next a bomb blast. God, what on earth does he want to do?","Cyril himself didn’t know what had happened. How could he answer these powerful collectors with whom he still hoped to continue collaboration? Even the usually savage Cyril needed to step forward and tackle this issue.","Unexpectedly, the explosion was not over yet. A second blast followed shortly, and within less than a minute, a series of loud booms continued to be heard, with flames soaring high into the sky, illuminating the entire village’s night sky.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian exchanged a smile; now Cyril would surely fall into their trap complacently.","\"Next, it’s Mr. Will’s turn, our mission is complete.\" Xia Jinyuan looked calmly at the sky ablaze with fire, his handsome face containing a cold chill, \"The more chaos there is for them, the better it is for us.\"","Breaking out in a sweat during the evacuation, Ye Jian wiped her forehead and pursed her lips before responding, \"I just hope there won’t be any problems on Will’s end.\"","She trusted Will’s eager desire to break free from Noah and Cyril, but she still couldn’t fully trust in Will’s character.","Because if Will were to reveal even the slightest bit of information about them to Cyril or Noah, she and her comrades, even if they all left Molaban alive... would still be skinned alive.","T6’s voice came through the earpiece, \"Let’s leave this place before we chat further. I’ve already evacuated; just waiting for White Crane and G3 to retreat from the venue.\"","Having not yet left the village, it indeed wasn’t the time for chatting. Xia Jinyuan tightened his grip on Ye Jian’s hand, and their silhouettes swiftly merged with the night.","Not far out, he turned off the wireless communication and said to Ye Jian with a smile, \"I find that every time I fight alongside you, things tend to go smoothly. Quite interesting.\"","Upon hearing this, Ye Jian thought about the missions they had carried out together and realized... it did seem to be the case.","She smiled, and a tender emotion flickered in her eyes, \"It’s because of our understanding, because neither of us wants the other to get hurt.\" Because, they both protected each other."]},{"number":5395,"title":"Chapter 5395: Intimidating","paragraphs":["Ye Jian had always hoped to catch up with Xia Jinyuan’s pace, to fight alongside him. Now that her wish had been realized, she applied her skills to walk with him through the battlefields, amidst the smoke and bullets, aspiring to become his strongest subordinate and protector.","Xia Jinyuan was especially pleased with her response, and during a retreat, he tightly grasped her hand, brought it to his lips for a kiss, and whispered with a low chuckle, \"Let’s both strive to avoid injuries and survive every battle.\"","The position they had reached today was the result of their joint efforts, and they would continue to strive together for the rest of their lives.","With flames soaring into the sky behind them, the pair had moved out of danger and quietly awaited the return of their comrades.","Meanwhile, V8 and K7 worked together to tackle a soldier under Noah, taking advantage of the chaos caused by G3 and White Crane to push the man outside to a certain location. This was all to make Cyril take serious notice of Noah; they needed concrete evidence to convince him.","They might as well set him up then.","The blaze had brightened the village. When Cyril, now aware of what was happening outside, received the reports from his subordinates, he flew into a rage. The explosion had virtually destroyed his auction house.","Faced with such deep-seated hatred, Cyril couldn’t wait to tear the perpetrator to pieces.","The exterior area exploded, and the interior suffered damage; all the crystal chandeliers had fallen, seriously affecting the structural integrity of the beams. What was once a well-functioning auction house had suddenly become a dangerous building.","The artwork was sent away in time. All the buyers who had come for the auction were escorted out of the interior area by their personal bodyguards and the staff arranged by Cyril.","Every person who came out had an appalling expression. They had entered the auction dressed in suits, looking like successful individuals, but they left in complete disarray; some buyers were even injured and bleeding.","Noah had attempted several times to rush the stage but was forced back and never got the chance to get close to the paintings. He had to watch helplessly as his country’s long-lost masterpieces slipped away right before his eyes.","The collectors were furious, blaming the evening’s injuries on Cyril’s lack of security. Some wanted to confront him, but considering Cyril’s personality, they ultimately chose to grudgingly leave.","\"If it weren’t for the painting, I wouldn’t have set foot in here for half a step, half a step!\" a collector, his forehead sliced by a shard of crystal chandelier glass, pressed a handkerchief to his wound and cursed loudly as he was escorted by four bodyguards to his car, \"Damn dwarf, he’ll one day die by his own greed!\"","Not having acquired the paintings he desired and leaving injured, this collector was very angry, and his rage was evident even in the way he walked away.","As Cyril, engaged in a conversation with Mr. Will, listened to his subordinate’s report, his sinister eyes narrowed; he simply gestured with his hand. Less than three minutes after the angry collector’s car had left, the remaining buyers saw the first vehicle explode mid-air, killing everyone inside.","Height was Cyril’s absolute taboo because he was only 164cm tall, a rather short man.","Witnessing Cyril dismiss six people with a mere wave of his hand, Mr. Will slightly lowered his eyelids and continued, \"Mr. Andre’s paintings will soon end up in Noah’s hands. The other three, he’s sure to take back.\"","Upon hearing this, Cyril laughed heartily. After his laughter, a chilling glint surged in his ominous eyes, \"I very much hope he tries to steal back the paintings I’ve auctioned. Very much indeed!\""]},{"number":5396,"title":"Chapter 5396: Tricked","paragraphs":["Cyril was quite satisfied with Mr. Will’s performance, but Noah was not, having originally planned to auction off both paintings tonight. He had arranged for male soldiers waiting outside to follow and seize the opportunity to take them.","But now, the auction house had been bombed, and the first painting that had been sold was not handed over to the buyer. It all went back into Cyril’s hands.","He didn’t want to confront Cyril about this, but... the time had come when he had to.","Someone had dared to bomb Cyril’s venue, which showed how much that person wanted to take all four paintings from Cyril.","These were the paintings that his country had been missing for over a decade, and now they were right in front of him. No matter what, he had to bring these four paintings back to his country.","Noah with a dark expression sat inside the car, waiting for the scattered Mr. Will to emerge, and continuously pondered how to snatch the paintings back from Cyril. Someone knocked on the car window and quickly pulled open the door to lean inside.","\"Colonel, we have a male soldier missing.\"","The person getting into the car brought Noah some even more distressing news, causing Noah’s face to turn as frosty as ice, \"Missing?\"","\"Yes, Colonel, missing. We’ve searched around and can’t find any trace of him. We suspect... he’s likely been sacrificed.\"","Likely sacrificed... Noah’s lips pressed into a sharp line as he looked towards the raging fire, feeling a heaviness sinking into his chest bit by bit.","If he had truly been sacrificed, hope would have been consumed by the fire. If... if he had been found by Cyril’s men, then... a dangerous light flickered in Noah’s hazel eyes, then, their confrontation with Cyril would start very soon.","The mobile phone rang, and the flickering screen cast Noah’s face in a ghostly, grim light. He answered the phone, and Mr. Will’s voice came through.","\"Noah, was that your doing just now? Have you gone mad? Blasting Cyril’s auction, you must be out of your minds, insane! All of you are damn lunatics!!\"","He yelled loudly, both anxious and angry, his voice filled with profound fear, \"Cyril is very, very, very angry right now, searching everywhere for the guy who ruined his auction. You’ve gotten me into danger too! You lunatics! Lunatics!\"","Noah quietly closed his eyes; Mr. Will thought that he was the one who had bombed the auction.","\"Mr. Will, I need the paintings, and destroying the auction venue is of no benefit to me. Where are you now? I’m waiting in the car, we need to meet!\"","Noah cut off the call, issuing orders to the subordinate in the car, \"Regroup, head back to the hotel.\"","The hotel was now their territory, and all their weapons were there too. If Cyril really wanted to find them, at least they had weapons to defend themselves.","Mr. Will quickly arrived, and without waiting for Noah to speak, he burst into rage as he got into the car, \"You lunatics, why didn’t you tell me about this huge matter in advance? What do we do now, what do we do!?\"","\"Cyril will never let us off, he will never forgive us! Do you understand? You lunatics, do you understand?!\"","Caught in his fury, Noah didn’t bother explaining to someone who had lost control of his emotions and simply ordered the driver to go.","Meanwhile, Cyril, looking at the body that had been dragged back, examined the person’s palms and wrists closely, a Caucasian who often handled a pistol.","\"Caucasian...\" With a harsh look in his eyes, Cyril stood up. After a few seconds of standing still, he gave a fierce order, \"Find out where he’s from... no, find out where he’s been living and where he’s been recently. I’m very curious now to see who dares to be my enemy.\""]},{"number":5397,"title":"Chapter 5397: Success","paragraphs":["Though the man was dead, the traces he left behind wouldn’t fade so swiftly. To know a person’s background, start by investigating the places he had been to and the people he had met. It wouldn’t take long to dig out some information about him.","Cyril didn’t need much information, he just needed to know if the man had any accomplices.","If there were accomplices, take them out directly.","No accomplices?","Could there be none?","The brooding Cyril certainly didn’t believe that.","He took a fierce draw from the cigar in his hand, as if only the rich tobacco flavor could suppress the fiery rage bubbling up inside him.","On this end, Xia Jinyuan and his eight men had successfully diverted the disaster elsewhere and swiftly exited the auction. They sped back to the hotel, and their next mission was a significant one: to rescue the scientist’s wife, Alice Cheng.","Despite some issues with Alice Cheng’s identity, she was the scientist’s wife, and the Snow Region Brigade’s Special Forces had come specifically to rescue her. Therefore, no matter what, they had to save Alice Cheng.","\"Alice Cheng is hidden in this area...\" Back at the hotel, V8 immediately brought out the hotel’s fire safety layout and used a pencil to indicate the potential areas where Alice Cheng could be hidden, \"The thirteenth floor, where Noah and his group were staying. Among those, the four rooms near the fire exits on both sides have been quiet with no one coming in or out, making it very likely that Alice Cheng is in one of those rooms.\"","\"By now, Cyril must have discovered the clues we intentionally left behind. Given his caution, he will surely follow them, and sooner or later, he’ll trace them to the hotel.\"","\"A guy who prefers to solve problems with violence might just charge into the hotel with his men. We could take advantage of...\"","Before Xia Jinyuan could finish his thought, a \"ding-dong\"-text message alert came from his phone. He picked up the phone that was on the edge of the table. His eyes narrowed slightly, \"Cyril is moving faster than we anticipated.\"","Though the remark was somewhat disjointed, his comrades, attuned to silent cooperation, revealed identically subtle smiles. Ye Jian quietly picked up the glass of water by her side and took several small sips, her gaze lowered.","That was indeed great news; Cyril and Noah clashing... It seemed Mr. Will must have exerted significant effort to handle things smoothly.","Captain Xia had said that Mr. Will would certainly facilitate this matter, and it turned out to be true.","After finishing her water, Ye Jian held the glass, her dark eyes brimming with a light smile, fixating on the man who was beginning to lay out the next step of their operation plan. Admiration swelled deeply in her gaze.","Cyril was already en route to the hotel, and at the same time, Noah was also on his way back to the hotel. Things were getting interesting; if the two groups encountered each other, they were likely to come to blows directly, giving Xia Jinyuan’s team enough time to infiltrate the thirteenth floor and rescue Alice Cheng.","In Molaban, Cyril had his own extensive intelligence network. Once he gave the order to investigate the Caucasian’s identity and his whereabouts, coupled with Mr. Will deliberately leaking the auction of the paintings, Cyril quickly found the information he needed about some suspicious Caucasians and their movements.","Why did Cyril trust Mr. Will’s words so much? It was simple: Mr. Will told him that these Caucasians might have found out that the paintings were with him and intended to approach him. Furthermore, Mr. Will informed Cyril that his family had received threats from the Caucasians. Cyril’s investigation confirmed this, and he quickly believed Mr. Will.","He even attributed the death of the bald man to Noah."]},{"number":5398,"title":"Chapter 5398: Encirclement","paragraphs":["Cyril was a man of action. Noah, with a grim face, had barely arrived at the hotel when Cyril stormed in with his men, all armed and firing a barrage of bullets at the hotel ceiling.","The sounds of gunfire mixed with screams, plunging the entire hotel into panic.","Ye Jian, who had been hiding in the shadows, noticed a short, fierce-looking middle-aged man with a full beard standing in the center. He lightly raised his hand, and the gunfire abruptly ceased. A muscular man with bulging muscles approached the front desk, brandishing an AK whose barrel was still hot from shooting, and pressed it against the counter.","The bearded middle-aged man standing in the center was indeed Cyril, protected by at least 50 fully armed men behind him.","Ye Jian leaned into Xia Jinyuan’s ear and whispered softly, \"He’s making such a grand entrance; Noah has enough time to escape.\"","\"You are underestimating him,\" Xia Jinyuan said, smiling and shaking his head, \"He is trying to frighten Noah, hoping Noah will come out willingly.\"","\"The outside must be surrounded by Cyril’s men; he won’t let Noah escape the hotel.\"","Ye Jian blinked, \"Captain Xia, you know Cyril very well.\"","\"Cobra is from Molaban,\" Xia Jinyuan explained succinctly, knowing Ye Jian would understand his meaning.","Ye Jian nodded slightly and hummed in agreement. Through her earpiece, she heard V8’s slightly excited voice, \"King Q, Cyril has blocked all the exits; Noah is really in trouble now!\"","At this, Xia Jinyuan gave Ye Jian a look that bragged \"I’m impressive,\" making her purse her lips and smile—she always knew her Captain Xia was incredible.","Returning to the hotel, Noah had not expected Cyril to find the hotel so soon. Although he was prepared for a confrontation with Cyril, he was counting on getting reinforcements first.","Now, with the reinforcements yet to arrive and Cyril already at the hotel, Noah, who didn’t want any trouble that night, remained calm, secretly alerted the front desk, and immediately arranged for an evacuation after monitoring how many men Cyril had brought through the front desk surveillance.","\"King Q, Noah is preparing to retreat,\" G3 reported in a low voice, keeping a close watch on the thirteenth floor, \"Someone opened room 1317...\"","Pausing briefly, the pressurized voice of G3 became slightly excited, \"Alice Cheng, they are planning to take Alice Cheng!\"","G3 had previously mentioned the need to confirm which room Alice Cheng was in, but now Noah had inadvertently exposed her location, making even the calm G3 a bit excited.","Xia Jinyuan was not nearly as excited, \"From the way they are guarding Alice Cheng now, it’s confirmed that they have given up on using Alice Cheng as bait, as long as their country’s forces keep a close watch on our other team.\"","This was a message to his comrades: seeing Alice Cheng abroad shouldn’t be taken lightly; looser security on her was good news for their team, but not for the other team.","The whereabouts of the other team had been completely exposed.","Upon hearing this, a heavy feeling sank into everyone’s hearts, their expressions unspeakably solemn.","In the hotel lobby, the front desk’s lack of cooperation made Cyril lose patience. He did not want to waste time on these people, a light statement, and the entire lobby was enveloped in gunfire.","\"Don’t destroy the computers.\" That’s what Cyril had instructed his men before they opened fire.","However, someone did not want Cyril to check the phone. As Cyril and his men burst into the hotel, the lobby manager, sensing danger, ducked behind a large column inside the hotel. When he saw Cyril instructing someone to go around to the front desk and realized what might happen, the lobby manager stopped hiding, pulled out his own pistol, and started shooting at the front desk."]},{"number":5399,"title":"Chapter 5399: Confirmation","paragraphs":["Everything happening in the hall had nothing to do with Xia Jinyuan and his team; almost all the staff in the entire hall were from Noah’s country. Even if Cyril were to kill all the hall staff now, Xia Jinyuan and his team wouldn’t intervene.","Gunshots echoed in the lobby, stray bullets shattered the splendid crystal lights, scattering pieces all over the ground. Illuminated by the light, the floor glittered like countless diamonds embedded in it, with blood snaking across, staining the sparkling shards and wetting the shining floor.","Cyril, who would shoot at the drop of a hat, was now well-protected, sitting on the hotel sofa, waiting to blow up his auction venue and for the fool who wanted to steal the four famous paintings to show himself.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were in the process of evacuating; they needed to intercept Noah now.","It wasn’t exactly to intercept Noah—Cyril’s men were on it. They were just conveniently rescuing Alice Cheng in passing.","All the hotel corridors were manned by Cyril’s people. Guests who heard the gunshots and tried to flee in a panic ended up sending themselves to a point of no return, as they were directly shot dead by Cyril’s men, who allowed no one the chance to escape.","Whoever dared to flee would be shot, that was Cyril’s order.","Retreating Noah had reached the stairway exit on the first floor, which led to the sub-basement two parking garage. They only had to descend five more floors to enter the parking garage and drive away, but they were blocked.","Cyril’s men were stationed at the first-floor exit, holding rifles aimed at the second floor, ready to fire at the slightest noise from above.","\"Six people in total, don’t let anyone escape,\" Noah whispered as he fitted a silencer onto his pistol, \"I’ll count to three, then we shoot.\"","\"Yes, Colonel!\"","The twelve accompanying male soldiers nodded softly. As soldiers of their country, they were somewhat nervous but not overly afraid, facing the armed foe outside with calmness and belief in their escape.","Keeping watch, G3 silently followed, edging along the wall of the stairway step by step, his pistol drawn slowly. He didn’t need to aim at any particular target; a random shot to alert the guys in the hallway would suffice.","1, 2, 3... Noah signaled the soldiers to fire.","\"Bang... Bang...\"","The sudden gunshots, like the ghastly voice of a demon, echoed violently within the stairwell.","G3 fired ahead of them, successfully alerting Cyril’s men, leaving the six targets, already in the crosshairs of Noah’s soldiers, without any hesitation to open fire upwards.","\"Bang bang bang...\"","The barrage of gunfire was fierce. Some of the foes were instantly shot dead by Noah’s soldiers, while others miraculously escaped and quickly counterattacked.","\"FUCK!\"","Noah cursed under his breath and yelled, \"Upstairs! GOGOGO!\"","Having already alerted the enemy below, they had no way to retreat now.","The gunfire from the fire escape resulted in at least ten of Cyril’s subordinates rushing up the stairs armed, and what had been a relatively quiet hotel now resounded with shots from every direction as Noah led his twelve soldiers firing while swiftly falling back.","Hidden behind the fire room on the second floor, G3 saw Alice Cheng, whom they were there to rescue, calmly firing to defend herself.","Witnessing this scene, G3 fully agreed with Xia Jinyuan’s initial analysis.","The scientist’s itinerary was exposed because his wife had reported it upstairs in advance, leading to the scientist who was preparing to return to his country being placed under house arrest.","Alice Cheng was the scientist’s wife and had also been monitoring him all along. Even though she had children with the scientist, her duty was still to watch his every move and to report immediately at the first sign of anything amiss."]},{"number":5400,"title":"Chapter 5400: The Plan","paragraphs":["G3 slowly retreated behind the fire door, closely watching every move of Alice Cheng. In the dimly lit corridor, only the subdued green of the emergency exit lights was visible; in the dark, he could see the trajectories of bullets dragging their fiery tails, some hitting the walls, some hitting the iron staircase handrails, filling the entire fire escape with incessant gunfire and echoes.","Noah’s men were few, but their combat capability was formidable—a fact G3 had learned early at the train station.","Coming to Molaban on a mission, it was unlikely that the country would send ordinary soldiers; they sent elite troops from within their regular forces, but not from the Special Forces.","This also reflected the country’s disregard for the Chinese side, believing their elite regular troops were enough to ensure that those sent to rescue Alice Cheng would not return.","The country always considered itself a major power and was always arrogant, so overlooking the Chinese side was not surprising. It must be noted that it wasn’t just the Chinese they underestimated; they didn’t take any country in the world seriously.","Any country daring to oppose this nation usually received a harsh lesson from them, and the wars they had instigated in recent years further demonstrated their domineering attitude.","Watching Noah’s men, pressured by Cyril’s subordinates’ firepower and unable to go downstairs, chose to go up instead. After they reached the third floor, Cyril’s men happened to pass by G3. Boldly, he darted out from behind the fire door and successfully blended into Cyril’s team.","This time, G3 was directly confronting Noah in battle.","\"Don’t wipe them all out, keep them to slow Cyril down,\" Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice came over the sound of gunfire through the radio, \"Hold your fire a bit, now’s not the time to wipe them out entirely.\"","Z7, who was shooting, snorted coldly, \"They want to wipe us out, and now we have a chance to wipe them out—why hold back? Wipe them out, if there’s an issue put it on Cyril.\"","\"Eliminate Noah now and leave Alice alone to escape?\" Xia Jinyuan pressed his voice low, \"Let Alice get out, then it’s not too late to wipe them out.\"","\"That works,\" Z7 agreed profoundly, damn, he had wanted to deal with these pests for a long time, as annoying as flies.","V8 then asked, \"The hotel is filled with Noah’s people; how did you figure they would leave their rooms to face Cyril directly? Staying in their rooms and letting the hotel personnel deal with Cyril would have meant no need for personal risk.\"","With their own people everywhere, it was difficult for Cyril to capture them.","Ye Jian resolved the query, \"Noah didn’t want the hotel’s exposure, nor did he want Cyril and Molaban to know about the hotel’s connection to his country.\"","\"This place is very important to Noah’s country; he must protect the hotel and the hotel staff, ensuring not to destroy everything here because of him.\"","Although they were currently opposed to Noah, it had to be said that Noah was a qualified soldier, clearly understanding his role, unwilling to sacrifice more lives even if it concerned his own safety.","With Xia Jinyuan’s reminder, G3, who had infiltrated among Cyril’s men, fired blindly, his combat skill unknowingly many levels above those of Cyril’s people, continuously forcing Noah and his men to retreat upstairs, until pushing them to the floor where Xia Jinyuan and his team were located.","Cyril’s men were all heading to the fire escape; Xia Jinyuan and his team had to get ahead of them to successfully rescue Alice Cheng."]}]);
